e\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Cliff Notez',634,4551,'oompa',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Cliff+Notez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Latrell James',20892,101393,'MFnMelo','Latrell James is a rapper and producer based in Massachusetts. He runs a home studio out of his basement in Brockton, MA, and has received recognition at the annual Boston Music Awards.   <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Latrell+James\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Moe Pope',3786,36715,'Fresh Breath Committee','Boston MC Moe Pope\'s career first took off in the early 2000s with Bay Area-based hip-hop band Crown City Rockers, which originally formed in Boston as Mission:. Aside from singles and 12\"s, Pope only appeared on the group\'s first LP, One, in 2001, before he decided to return to Boston in order to look after his daughter. Back in his hometown, he started performing with rapper/producer Insight and his five-man outfit Electric (formerly Electric Company). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Moe+Pope\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Optic Bloom',411,1648,'Qhairo',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Optic+Bloom\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('G-rdz',582,4308,'Jayx',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/G-rdz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ShabZi Madallion',139,696,'N\'veigh',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ShabZi+Madallion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Brandie Blaze',224,1179,'oompa',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Brandie+Blaze\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('D-Weez',70,465,'H2MG AR',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/D-Weez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Scoot Da Kidd',1337,6675,'42 Twinz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Scoot+Da+Kidd\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('munch lauren',10048,57860,'Cerop',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/munch+lauren\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mula Kkhan',2373,21074,'Scar$',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mula+Kkhan\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Landro',2086,12439,'Ab Arel',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Landro\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dubb Saq',304,1109,'Bleak AG',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dubb+Saq\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Spectacular Diagnostics',58372,250428,'Boldy James',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Spectacular+Diagnostics\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Love Guru',485,2862,'Á Móti Sól',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Love+Guru\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ice One',2197,17628,'Cor Veleno','Ice One aka Sebi is one of the top artistic forces in the Italian Hip Hop scene, renowned for his MCing, DJing, and production work. Raised in Rome, Ice One started in the early 1980s DJing for different venues in his city. Around that time he became involved in graf & break dancing performing with the Special Breakin\' Crew. \n\nIce One joined forces with a variety of groups, including 24-7 Crew, MC Shark\'s Raptional Scream, and the Mad DJ\'s Band. In the late 1980s, he performed with Ice T and Afrika Bambataa during their Italian tours.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ice+One\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gonzo G',593,3200,'richcheezy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gonzo+G\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('mad stage',57,302,'BassRox',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/mad+stage\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Skritt',103,737,'Coughing Dove',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Skritt\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Microwaveman',155,3572,'Microwave Man',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Microwaveman\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ATK',24511,323691,'Scred Connexion','ATK est la contraction de l\'expression \"Avoue que Tu Kiffes\".Dans une interview pour Académie HH Cyanure indique \"A l\'époque on avait un morceau avec Pit avec un sample un peu chelou. On se disait que personne n\'allait aimer alors on a eu l\'idée de mettre très bas en fond du morceau \"Avoue que tu kiffes, avoue que tu kiffes…\" Quand est venu le concert, il nous fallait un nom de posse et on a pris ATK \"Avoue qu\'tu kiffes\".\n\nAu début des années 1990 les collectifs Hip-Hop commencent à se multiplier un peu partout dans Paris <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ATK\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Hanjin Tan',779,5449,'陳奐仁',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Hanjin+Tan\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('The Architect',95419,852329,'Guts','If it\'s messing around with cassettes, singing, playing the piano, playing the guitar, hitting the drums, making weird noises or just listening to it, Bas (a.k.a. The Architect) was always busy with music. Happy hardcore (in the 90\'s) and trance were always his favorite genres. After a time of being a fan of rock and metal he discovered hardstyle. This happened because of the jumpstyle-mediahype in 2006. Since then he started producing and his sound became better and better.\nNowadays he takes it very seriously. \'Nuff said. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/The+Architect\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ice One',2197,17628,'Cor Veleno','Ice One aka Sebi is one of the top artistic forces in the Italian Hip Hop scene, renowned for his MCing, DJing, and production work. Raised in Rome, Ice One started in the early 1980s DJing for different venues in his city. Around that time he became involved in graf & break dancing performing with the Special Breakin\' Crew. \n\nIce One joined forces with a variety of groups, including 24-7 Crew, MC Shark\'s Raptional Scream, and the Mad DJ\'s Band. In the late 1980s, he performed with Ice T and Afrika Bambataa during their Italian tours.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ice+One\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Baze',10474,216067,'Chlyklass','Baze aka Brocoli George gilt als einer der talentiertesten Rapper der Schweizer Hip Hop Gemeinde. Kaum ein anderer polarisiert und versteht es Worte und Stimmungen auf eine so tiefgehende Art in Bildern zu vermitteln wie er. Gerne lehnt er sich dabei auch mal über die Grenzen des Genres hinaus, beweist damit aber nur seine musikalischen Qualitäten und seine Vielfalt. So konnte es schon passieren, dass er einen Chlöisu Friedli Song mit Greis und <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Baze\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ramson Badbonez',19114,211668,'Contact Play','Ramson Badbonez is a british MC from London who is associated with the rap crew Task Force.\n\nIn 2013 he signed to UK record label High Focus Records and released the acclaimed LP \"A Year In The Life Of Oscar The Slouch\". He followed this up in 2018 with \"Jason Bonez\", and \"Mic Day The 13th\" in 2019.\n\nMany of his mixtapes are available for free download via his official Bandcamp page: http://ramsonbadbones.bandcamp.com/ <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ramson+Badbonez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kenny K-Shot',269,3932,'Ish Kevin',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kenny+K-Shot\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ET',19882,222372,'Colonia','1. Et is a mexican post-rock band taking influence from the stars https://et432hz.bandcamp.com/\n\n2. Electro Team (ET) is a hip hop/eurodance band from Croatia, active since 1987.  ET saw their greatest popularity while performing with their former lead singer Vanna, who joined the band in 1991 and left for solo career in 1998.\n\nAt the beginning of 1993 they had a premiere performance of the song “Tek je 12 sati“ from debut album Electro Team, a tremendously successful hit which, a few years later, was proclaimed Croatian hit of the decade. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ET\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ZUTI',515,2223,'Sale Tru',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ZUTI\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil P',1368,5752,'RLSG BSMITH','About Me:I was born in Raised Ronterrius Williams,In The South Of Georgia And North Florida.Where I Grew Up And The Neighbor Hood Of Sub Division(Sub-D)and Quincy,Fl.I started FreeStylin Around The Age of 10,And Was Noticed By A Local Dj.Named Cadilliac Joe(Mr.Boop)Of Quincy,Fl And Was InFluenced That I had The Talent To Rap.So I begin Writing,As I Attended High School At East Gadsden High,Havana,Fl.I Was Introduced to Freestyle Battle\'s.I Battled My First Battle vs A SongWriter/Lyrics From NY and a live Judge Battle. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+P\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ShabZi Madallion',139,696,'N\'veigh',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ShabZi+Madallion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gonzo G',593,3200,'richcheezy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gonzo+G\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Skinny Stylus',487,3650,'Danase',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Skinny+Stylus\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('MIKS',388,2450,'Misho',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/MIKS\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('River',69831,407723,'Omnia','There are multiple artists named River:\n\n1) River is a band founded by Ant Balci, leader and founder guitarist of the Turkish death metal band In spite, in 2006. River is also a debut album by Ant Balci, who has no financial purpose, therefore has distributed his song over internet. \nhttp://www.river-project.com/tr/\n\n2) River is a Cascadian folk band from Oregon and Washington, USA, formed by Nate Myers (Leech, Mania, Vault Dweller), Dylan Bloom (Huldrekall, Wake) and Michael Korchonnoff (Alda, Novemthree, Satus). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/River\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ZUTI',515,2223,'Sale Tru',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ZUTI\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Omg Oumy Gueye',278,1563,'Viviane Chidid',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Omg+Oumy+Gueye\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tao Quit',345,3761,'Hugo Toxxx','Mladý  rapper a Dj. z Vrchlabí.\n\nMAM NA SOBĚ TRENKY DOMA, PROTOŽE JSEM SÁM DOMA - TAO QUIT <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tao+Quit\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ruggedman',2325,11298,'Lord Of Ajasa','Bio\n\nBorn Michael Ugochukwu Stephens on the 20th of September in Ebem Ohafia, Abia state, all levels of schooling were done in Lagos state. I am a graduate of Political Science Lagos State University Ojo. I started loving rap music from around 1989 when I was learning the words in rap tracks I liked and rapping along to their instrumentals - until I decided that I could do mine, then I started writing my own lyrics. 1999 was when I put out my first cd for air play. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ruggedman\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('grgy',6247,156472,'smib','grgy is a well known producer and rapper from da bims <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/grgy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Reklews',1639,21800,'King Grubb',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Reklews\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bang On!',11512,41323,'Soul P','One of the most exciting artists Big Dada has signed recently is the Liverpool bred Bang On. A born MC, Elliott Egerton\'s delivery effortlessly moves between funny and furious, as he spins yarns and nails metaphors that make rap sound like a good idea again. Combined with raw, bass-hefty production that could make a bleeding-edge dubstepper weep, he\'s set to be a force to be reckoned with in the coming year. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bang+On%21\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('STEwie G',57,654,'Richie Ledreagle',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/STEwie+G\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('BIG SOM',505,2865,'Кажэ Обойма',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/BIG+SOM\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Subliminal',21697,319498,'Karl Runau','If you are looking for the Israeli rap artist סאבלימינל  (real name Kobi Shimoni), your music is incorrectly tagged. You will find him here: סאבלימינל \n\nThere are at least ten artists known as Subliminal.\n\n1) Subliminal  is a german power electronics project by Albert Fisch. The typical sound of his work is one of the characteristic features of Haus Arafna\'s infamous  \'Galakthorrö\' label on which he released the albums \'Gracebudd\' (2000) and \'Coping\'(2006). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Subliminal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Amit Sagie',634,2053,'Tzaguy Boy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Amit+Sagie\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Benjahvites',123,1708,'Jahleel',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Benjahvites\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Hoodini',1271,10243,'tr1ckmusic','Bulgarian rap artist from Burgas <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Hoodini\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Fang',67863,810188,'Flipper','There are at least 5 acts called Fang:\n\n1. The first rumblings from Bay Area street demons Fang came around \'80, with the experimental psychedelic 2-song EP \"Yukon Fang,\" the brainchild of guitarist Tom Flynn.  After this record\'s release, vocalist Sammy (a.k.a. \"Slammie,\" \"Sammytown\") was recruited from a punk band called Shut Up, and the classic \"Fun With Acid\" was recorded.  This appeared on the \'82 Alternative Tentacles/MRR comp. double LP \"Not So Quiet On The Western Front,\" soon followed by the 8-song 12\" EP \"Landshark,\" in \'82. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Fang\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Manny Phesto',222,4201,'Mike Mictlan',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Manny+Phesto\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bad Balance',37661,784787,'Detsl aka Le Truk','Bad Balance is a Russian rap group considered to be one of the first rap acts in USSR. The group maintained a devoted underground following during 1990\'s.\nBad Balance was formed as a breakdance crew in 1980\'s in Saint-Petersburg by students from Donetsk named Vlad Valov (SheFF) and Sergey Krutikov (Михей). Group switched to rapping and recorded the debut album \"Vishe Zakona\" in 1989 for Gala Records.\n\nThe band toured France and US. Classic Bad Balance albums \"Naletchiki Bad B. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bad+Balance\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ironik',149797,867668,'McLean','There is more than one artist with that name.\n\n1. Ironik is the rapper / producer combo of Ironik and wily. \n\n2. Ironik was born on January 18th 1988 in London, England. He was interested in music from an early age starting his career at the age of 13 when he worked as a DJ in clubs, not just in his home country but across Europe.\nAged 20 he signed a contract with the record label Atlantic/Warner UK, releasing his début album \'No Point In Wasting Tears\' on September 29th 2008.\n\n3. Ironik is also a rapper from Quebec and member of L\'Assemblée. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ironik\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Starvz',118,1349,'Local',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Starvz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Daniel Williams',490,4509,'DeRevo','hundreds of artists with this name. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Daniel+Williams\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Fat Jack',2638,20574,'Ellay Khule','Real Name: James Clark\n\nIf Dr. Dre represents the mainstream Los Angeles hip-hop scene better than any other producer, then Fat Jack best represents the L.A. underground. A mainstay on the South Central circuit since the Goodlife days of the early ‘90s, Fat Jack possesses the uncanny ability to match the feel of his beats with the sensibilities of each of the many emcee that he collaborates with. His early work with Volume 10 and Ganjah K highlighted a fine taste in samples <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Fat+Jack\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Fat Jack',2638,20574,'Ellay Khule','Real Name: James Clark\n\nIf Dr. Dre represents the mainstream Los Angeles hip-hop scene better than any other producer, then Fat Jack best represents the L.A. underground. A mainstay on the South Central circuit since the Goodlife days of the early ‘90s, Fat Jack possesses the uncanny ability to match the feel of his beats with the sensibilities of each of the many emcee that he collaborates with. His early work with Volume 10 and Ganjah K highlighted a fine taste in samples <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Fat+Jack\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Raheem The Dream',5422,20922,'Trigga Man','Raheem the Dream is MC from Atlanta, GA, USA. Born in Dallas, TX, USA. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Raheem+The+Dream\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Baby Brown',7559,43702,'Rayven Justice',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Baby+Brown\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nyanda',1399,7705,'Ishawna','2013 marked the start of a new chapter for the multi-talented singer/songwriter Nyanda Thorbourne, known to the world as Nyanda from the chart topping Pop/Reggae duo Brick & Lace. Born to a Jamaican father and an American mother, both of whom are musical, she was raised on the sounds of reggae, R&B, Hip Hop and Country – which explains the trans-eclectic sound you hear reverberating from her music.\n\nNyanda entered the music business in the late 90s singing background vocals for Jamaican icons Marcia Grifiths, Beres Hammond and Diana King. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nyanda\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('D-Weez',70,465,'H2MG AR',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/D-Weez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Eazy Racks',202,877,'Young Lox',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Eazy+Racks\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Icaki',416,9951,'Novem',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Icaki\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Atchi',279,10290,'Novem',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Atchi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Novem',783,18142,'kileumre',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Novem\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('PISTOLPOSSE',374,30884,'alphamob',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/PISTOLPOSSE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Baby Shiva',181,6989,'killdummies',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Baby+Shiva\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gonzo G',593,3200,'richcheezy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gonzo+G\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gonzo G',593,3200,'richcheezy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gonzo+G\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Old Grape God',580,10200,'Slick Devious',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Old+Grape+God\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('munch lauren',10048,57860,'Cerop',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/munch+lauren\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mestizo',30886,211145,'Offwhyte','Mestizo -the Bona fide one of a kind multifaceted emcee who embodies the true sound of his California roots, but has acquired dexterity from all the city\'s Like Chicago and Phoenix, he has known to call home. Born to a Filipino father from California and a Sicilian mother from New York, this Bay Area native is the living definition of his name... MESTIZO. The Tagalog and Spanish literal translation for of \"mixed races\" and he is the spokesman for the new breed of human and the new generation man. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mestizo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jacin Trill',25488,1017409,'leafs',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jacin+Trill\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('leafs',16313,435825,'Jacin Trill','Leafs is the alias of Jahmil Dapaloe, a rap/hip hop artist from Almere, the Netherlands. Born in 2001, he made his first EP on the age of 15. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/leafs\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mula Kkhan',2373,21074,'Scar$',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mula+Kkhan\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Thug Lucciano',134,461,'Brick Wolfpack',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Thug+Lucciano\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kenny K-Shot',269,3932,'Ish Kevin',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kenny+K-Shot\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Skritt',103,737,'Coughing Dove',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Skritt\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ben Jones',11079,58969,'Jo Russell','Ben Jones was the singer and songwriter for The Lovedays. He has produced The Soundcasters, Scott Brunger and Rich Clark independently, and is a multi instrumentalist. \nHe released his first solo album, \"Echobox\" in 2010, swiftly followed by his second, \"Kaleidoscope\" in 2011.\nBoth were met with critical acclaim. He is currently writing the \"difficult\" third album, and also co-writing an album with Maxine Kerr. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ben+Jones\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Love Guru',485,2862,'Á Móti Sól',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Love+Guru\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('The Architect',95419,852329,'Guts','If it\'s messing around with cassettes, singing, playing the piano, playing the guitar, hitting the drums, making weird noises or just listening to it, Bas (a.k.a. The Architect) was always busy with music. Happy hardcore (in the 90\'s) and trance were always his favorite genres. After a time of being a fan of rock and metal he discovered hardstyle. This happened because of the jumpstyle-mediahype in 2006. Since then he started producing and his sound became better and better.\nNowadays he takes it very seriously. \'Nuff said. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/The+Architect\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Zaga El Veterano',129,300,'Xplicitos',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Zaga+El+Veterano\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('B-Threy',161,2538,'Juno Kizigenza',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/B-Threy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('The Architect',95419,852329,'Guts','If it\'s messing around with cassettes, singing, playing the piano, playing the guitar, hitting the drums, making weird noises or just listening to it, Bas (a.k.a. The Architect) was always busy with music. Happy hardcore (in the 90\'s) and trance were always his favorite genres. After a time of being a fan of rock and metal he discovered hardstyle. This happened because of the jumpstyle-mediahype in 2006. Since then he started producing and his sound became better and better.\nNowadays he takes it very seriously. \'Nuff said. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/The+Architect\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Benjahvites',123,1708,'Jahleel',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Benjahvites\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gonzo G',593,3200,'richcheezy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gonzo+G\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Benjahvites',123,1708,'Jahleel',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Benjahvites\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Conjuro Epiléptico',336,4699,'Los Niños Telepaticos',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Conjuro+Epil%C3%A9ptico\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sondy',229,691,'Kaascouse',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sondy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('zeman',1282,25259,'Вожык','There are more than one artist with the same name:\n\n1. Zeman is a Belarusian band with a strong presence in the underground music scene. Their music is available on Bandcamp, Their latest album, \"Vandroŭny cyrk majho hramadskaha žyćcia\", was released on June 22, 2023. The lyrics for Zeman\'s songs are written by Zeman himself, and the recording is done by Ashas (AshArtSound). The band\'s music is characterized by its unique blend of hip-hop and rap, with a distinct Belarusian flavor. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/zeman\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Adem Delon',48,869,'pervers',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Adem+Delon\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Shle Berry',87,582,'ZED KENZO',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Shle+Berry\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rico',87969,751393,'The Skatalites','There are at least nine different artists called Rico.\n\n1. Rico is a reggae and ska trombonist. Full name: Rico Rodriguez.\n\n2. Rico \"Ricardo Capuano\" was a Scottish industrial rock musician based in Glasgow, United Kingdom. He was regarded as Glasgow\'s answer to Trent Reznor. The high-point of his career was his 2003 collaboration with Gary Numan , Crazier which reached no.13 on the UK singles charts. He released two albums 1998\'s Sanctuary Medicines and 2004\'s Violent Silences. Born 23rd June 1971 he passed away 16th August 2022. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rico\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Blauwe Uil',694,3853,'Chip Charlez',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Blauwe+Uil\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Old Grape God',580,10200,'Slick Devious',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Old+Grape+God\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Heartspace',1345,4044,'Ellee Duke',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Heartspace\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sean Gonzalez',471,2578,'nopornada',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sean+Gonzalez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Omg Oumy Gueye',278,1563,'Viviane Chidid',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Omg+Oumy+Gueye\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DJ Spinna',87413,621338,'Jigmastas','DJ Spinna (b. Vince Williams), is something of an anomaly in music. A humbling example of what it takes to truly succeed within the framework of multiple fields. A steadfast work ethic, an obsessively extensive vinyl library & the willingness to pursue - the full extent of his roots (funk, soul & jazz), foundation (hip-hop) & future (electronic / dance music) - without restraint.\n\nA cornerstone of Hip-Hop\'s late 90\'s indie-uprise, DJ Spinna made much <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/DJ+Spinna\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Choppa',11441,69873,'Louisiana Ca$h','New Orleans (West Bank) rapper (real name: Darwin Lendell Turner) originally bouncing with Take Fo\' Records; recently signed to Master P\'s New No Limit label; appeared with the 504 Boyz on their \"Ballers\" CD (2002). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Choppa\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Benjahvites',123,1708,'Jahleel',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Benjahvites\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Akhil',50651,565667,'Jass Manak',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Akhil\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lay Lay',148,591,'SimulationRxps',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lay+Lay\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Snelle',58921,2880424,'Suzan & Freek','Lars Bos (born in Gorssel, Netherland, 3 October 1995), better known by his artistic name Snelle, is a Dutch rapper and singer originating from Deventer.\n\nBos studied at the Herman Brood Academie. His first major hit was \"Scars\", which peaked at number 4 on the Dutch Singles Chart and was certified platinum. \"Plankgas\" followed as a joint hit with Frenna. Born with a cleft lip, he was bullied for his appearance. His singer \"Reünie\" that peaked on the Dutch charts is an autobiographical story about what he passed through. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Snelle\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Малик Тухигов',33,348,'Тамара Адамова',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/%D0%9C%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%BA+%D0%A2%D1%83%D1%85%D0%B8%D0%B3%D0%BE%D0%B2\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Blackface',3509,15676,'Scrill','Blackface is a rapper from the Brightmoor neighborhood located in Detroit, MI. He is a member of the super group Rock Bottom, with a solo album on the way. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Blackface\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Richie Ledreagle',27,656,'STEwie G',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Richie+Ledreagle\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kenny K-Shot',269,3932,'Ish Kevin',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kenny+K-Shot\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Spectacular Diagnostics',58372,250428,'Boldy James',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Spectacular+Diagnostics\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nazeem',267,4811,'Baurus',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nazeem\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('$kinny Hardaway',104,174,'Pepperboy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/$kinny+Hardaway\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mainciaga',258,3569,'Pengz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mainciaga\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('VAGRANT REAL ESTATE',1289,4894,'Emil','Vagrant Real Estate is an Aberdeen based producer and DJ working across several genres, from hip-hop and R&B to grime and UK rap. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/VAGRANT+REAL+ESTATE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Freeway',333563,2278423,'Memphis Bleek','There is more than one artist with the name Freeway:\n\nThe first is:\n\n1. Leslie Edward Pridgen (born March 24, 1977), better known by his stage name Freeway, is an American rapper. Freeway a.k.a. Philly Freeway began rapping while in high school. He later met fellow rapper Beanie Sigel, who would be signed to Roc-A-Fella and later help Freeway get a contract with the record label. Freeway became one of the label\'s most visible artists after making <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Freeway\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Camp Blood',552,3426,'Censored Dialogue',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Camp+Blood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Reklews',1639,21800,'King Grubb',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Reklews\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bang On!',11512,41323,'Soul P','One of the most exciting artists Big Dada has signed recently is the Liverpool bred Bang On. A born MC, Elliott Egerton\'s delivery effortlessly moves between funny and furious, as he spins yarns and nails metaphors that make rap sound like a good idea again. Combined with raw, bass-hefty production that could make a bleeding-edge dubstepper weep, he\'s set to be a force to be reckoned with in the coming year. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bang+On%21\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Peace Chong',24,262,'VitoVVs',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Peace+Chong\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bad Balance',37661,784787,'Detsl aka Le Truk','Bad Balance is a Russian rap group considered to be one of the first rap acts in USSR. The group maintained a devoted underground following during 1990\'s.\nBad Balance was formed as a breakdance crew in 1980\'s in Saint-Petersburg by students from Donetsk named Vlad Valov (SheFF) and Sergey Krutikov (Михей). Group switched to rapping and recorded the debut album \"Vishe Zakona\" in 1989 for Gala Records.\n\nThe band toured France and US. Classic Bad Balance albums \"Naletchiki Bad B. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bad+Balance\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jonah Cruzz',10665,56491,'LouTribe Jigg',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jonah+Cruzz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kenny K-Shot',269,3932,'Ish Kevin',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kenny+K-Shot\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Pix\'L',2487,47771,'LÉA CHURROS',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Pix%27L\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('M7',1868,15699,'Isolated Incident','1. French rapper.\n\n2. Portuguese rapper from Porto. Associated with the Syzygy act, recorded the \"Martataca\" mixtape in 2008.\n\n2. OYA? was formed with ,the leader of a PUROGURE animation community, and Mr. Raiden Yuzawa of RX, and Mark which should be pursuing progressive rock woke up to POPS suddenly, and formed m7. He who sold simultaneously with a maniac fusion lock route from his school days in fact, and was pursuing Line POPS once stopped musical activities of the self of the 90s which was swaying to Rock considerably <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/M7\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Luminary',129978,998351,'Lange','There are at least 2 bands named Luminary:\n\n1. Now defunct collaboration between British producer Laurence Rapaccioli (Arksun) and Ashley Tomberlin, a previously unknown vocalist and musician from the United States. After completing a few initial tracks, they lost touch until the fall of 2003 when they began to take another look at the music they had created the previous year. With a renewed sense of purpose, the musical partnership finally gelled, and Luminary was born. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Luminary\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Hamed Slash',251,2600,'Rokh',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Hamed+Slash\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Drug Dilla',238,1116,'DARREM',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Drug+Dilla\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gonzo G',593,3200,'richcheezy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gonzo+G\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Raha',2506,16492,'Arta',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Raha\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Skritt',103,737,'Coughing Dove',' 