 town of Radom. It consists of \'Tomek \"Miodu\" Mioduszewski\' and \'Łukasz Borowiecki\'. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jamal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Hooligan',7462,36374,'Nightwatchers','There are several artists/group who share the name Hooligan. One of them is a Korean rock band.\nHere is what Hooligan (훌리건) have to say about themselves on their official site:\n\nThese aren’t the hooligans that go crazy over football.\nNo, these five guys simply share a common passion for music and their music is listed #1 on their crucial list.\n\nThey don’t care what the world thinks of them nor do they give any concerns to how others might see them.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Hooligan\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Guy Mar',596,4076,'Anton Vlasov',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Guy+Mar\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rayen Youssef',762,3228,'Mortadha Ftiti',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rayen+Youssef\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gonzo G',593,3200,'richcheezy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gonzo+G\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('mad stage',57,302,'BassRox',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/mad+stage\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Subliminal',21697,319498,'Karl Runau','If you are looking for the Israeli rap artist סאבלימינל  (real name Kobi Shimoni), your music is incorrectly tagged. You will find him here: סאבלימינל \n\nThere are at least ten artists known as Subliminal.\n\n1) Subliminal  is a german power electronics project by Albert Fisch. The typical sound of his work is one of the characteristic features of Haus Arafna\'s infamous  \'Galakthorrö\' label on which he released the albums \'Gracebudd\' (2000) and \'Coping\'(2006). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Subliminal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Zaman',7823,71496,'Hedonistic Noise','1. For the Egyptian band see زمان\n2. For the Palestinian band see زمن\n3. Grunge/Punk band from Istanbul, Turkey. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Zaman\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yusei',107159,1356763,'Kudasaibeats','Yusei is a lofi-beat producer, formerly Yusei is the name of ミサルカ\'s ex-guitarist, who left the band in December 2009. Lately they have become known for uploading their songs on YouTube as free to use beats for use by other artists. \n\nYusei has released of their beats publically as songs, mainly instrumentals with repeating vocals which can be found on Youtube, Spotify, Deezer and other streaming platforms. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yusei\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Al Safir',18610,1140064,'Hard GZ',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Al+Safir\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Al Safir',18610,1140064,'Hard GZ',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Al+Safir\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Al Safir',18610,1140064,'Hard GZ',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Al+Safir\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Al Safir',18610,1140064,'Hard GZ',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Al+Safir\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Wise',34840,453920,'NERDHEAD','There are at least 2 artists named Wise:\n\n1. Seiji Kameyama (亀山晴児, Kameyama Seiji?), born in 1979 to a Japanese father and American mother, is a Japanese hip hop musician who raps in both Japanese and English under the name WISE. During high school he lived in the United States. He is affiliated with the creative group KAZENOHITO. In 2005, he formed the groups WISE`N\'SONPUB with beatmaker SONPUB, and TERIYAKI BOYZ with RYO-Z and ILMARI from RIP SLYME and VERBAL from m-flo. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Wise\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dualy',179,680,'J.Moods',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dualy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Young Martino',24539,208601,'Yeruza',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Young+Martino\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Joyce Santana',40501,379693,'Caleb Calloway',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Joyce+Santana\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Al Safir',18610,1140064,'Hard GZ',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Al+Safir\">Read more 