nternacional de Red Bull Batalla de los Gallos.\n\nCarrera\n\nWos arrancó desde muy pequeño rapeando en las plazas y participando en competencias como El Quinto Escalón, donde ya demostraba un gran potencial y sobre todo mucho coraje. Pero fue en 2016 cuando demostró que su nivel estaba para mucho más que una plaza <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Wos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Evlay',9569,72994,'La Bomba De Tiempo','EVLAY es Facu Yalve, músico, compositor y técnico en sonido, quien a sus cortos 26 años ya se convirtió en uno de los productores musicales más distinguidos de la Argentina.\n\nTrabajó con muchos artistas prodigiosos que revolucionaron la cultura urbana: Wos, Lali Espósito, Nicki Nicole, Acru, Louta, Ca7riel, Paco Amoroso, Ángela Torres, Vicky Bernardi, Benjamín Amadeo, Dakillah, Emme y Maia.\n\nEs el productor del disco debut de WOS, Caravana, y de su último EP Tres Puntos Suspensivos. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Evlay\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Al Safir',18610,1140064,'Hard GZ',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Al+Safir\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('D3llano',21377,150576,'hnos munoz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/D3llano\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yesan 雪山',2398,17410,'c n d',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yesan+%E9%9B%AA%E5%B1%B1\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kheis',1901,134156,'Korpe',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kheis\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sotan',836,6490,'Swit Eme',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sotan\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Juancho Marqués',29206,841195,'Sule B','\n\n\n\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Juancho+Marqu%C3%A9s\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('InnerCut',16807,158489,'Juancho Marqués','Adrià Domènech is ‘InnerCut’:\n\nSometimes, when you least expect it, artists appear out of blue, seemingly becoming permanent fixtures in the blink of an eye. This is definitely the case for Adrià Domenech, aka InnerCut, who has attracted attention from around the world with just a few tracks posted on the internet. His secret? a warm, well-crafted and current sound, combining post-dubstep, neon synths and an openly pop vocation. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/InnerCut\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kid Cudi',4647285,270182694,'KIDS SEE GHOSTS','Scott Ramon Seguro Mescudi (born January 30, 1984 in Shaker Heights, Ohio, United States), better known by his stage name Kid Cudi, is a Grammy award nominated rapper, singer and actor who first gained attention after the release of his debut mixtape A Kid Named Cudi which he released in 2008 in collaboration with New York street wear brand 10.Deep. The mixtape caught the attention of Kanye West and led to Cudi\'s signing to the G.O.O.D. Music Label. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kid+Cudi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Moro',20987,374383,'RedOgre','Moro is one of two artists:\n\n1) Hardcore arranger, principal arranger of KINZOK ON from Japan.\nAlso known as morrrrrro\nKINZOK ON bandcamp: https://kinzokon.bandcamp.com/music\nMORO on Twitter: https://twitter.com/moro_108\n\n\n2) Moro is a beast composed of two reasonably-sentient beings: Nolan Thomas and Daniel Lee Ruff Smith, and born in the hills surrounding a village known as Eau Claire, WI. The beast is sometimes called \"M o r o\", or \"M O R O\" by different tribes. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Moro\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('3Robi',35547,919677,'Mula B','Anass Haouam (born 24 January 1995), known professionally as 3robi, is a Dutch rapper of Moroccan origin. Born in Amsterdam, he started his musical career in 2013. His debut studio album, Jonge jongen naar de top, was released in 2017 and reached at number-one on the Dutch Album Top 100. In 2019, 3robi founded his own record label Spow Business and released his second album in the next year. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/3Robi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Zaramay',24110,574974,'Chulu',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Zaramay\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dani Ribba',45250,1007943,'LIT killah','Daniel Ribba, más conocido como Dani es un cantante de trap argentino, nacido el 6 de agosto de 1999. Conocido por su etapa como freestyler, participó en competencias como El Quinto Escalón y FMS Argentina. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dani+Ribba\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Al Safir',18610,1140064,'Hard GZ',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Al+Safir\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Al Safir',18610,1140064,'Hard GZ',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Al+Safir\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Fulston',191,1234,'Mayo 214',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Fulston\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('La Cantera',1027,8052,'DENEK',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/La+Cantera\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('YUNG SARRIA',21685,437069,'Elpatron970',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/YUNG+SARRIA\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Elpatron970',9589,329055,'kg970',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Elpatron970\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Clas Beats',26,71,'Dirty Porko',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Clas+Beats\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('SabioBeats',425,3140,'SD KONG',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/SabioBeats\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('SR',220404,3095116,'Poundz','There are several things called SR.\n\nSR (1) SR (formerly Stabber[2]) is a British rapper and songwriter that went viral for his single \"Welcome to Brixton\" in 2020.[1][3] His follow-up song, \"Practice Makes Perfect\", was named in the top 10 songs to come out of the U.K. by DJBooth in May of 2021.[\r\n\r\n\r\n[b]SR (2) is the acronym for Sveriges Radio (the Swedish national broadcasting company).\n\nSR (3) is Stefaaans demos - mainly hardcore/punk.\nAt the moment the recordings are very low budget as I\'m using: a cheap low quality microphone <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/SR\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Baby Gang',118128,6385865,'SIMBA LA RUE','Zaccaria Mouhib (Arabic: زَكَريا موهيب, romanized: Zakariyaa Mouhyb; born 26 June 2001), known professionally as Baby Gang, is an Italian-Moroccan rapper. He began his musical career in 2018 and released his debut EP \"EP1\" in 2021.\n\nBaby Gang released his first single \"Street\" in 2018 in Calolziocorte, followed by \"Education\" and \"Cella 1\" in 2019, songs inspired by his experiences in prison. In May 2021 he released the EP \"EP1\", which peaked at number 15 on the FIMI Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Baby+Gang\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Higashi',287,1522,'FT Kings',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Higashi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Stormy',23558,761505,'ElGrandeToto','Stormy is a Moroccan rapper. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Stormy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mounika.',237233,2494427,'Ours Samplus','A Hip-hop / Abstract / Electronic artist from Tours, France. Born in Poitiers. Name \"Mounika\" comes from the  \"Out Of Breath\" film, American version of Godard\'s movie.\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/mounikabeat/\nhttps://mounika.bandcamp.com/\nhttps://soundcloud.com/mounika-beat\nhttps://twitter.com/mounika_beats/\nhttps://www.instagram.com/mounika.beatmaker/ <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mounika.\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ocie Elliott',277822,3191393,'Harrison Storm','Ocie Elliott is a musical duo comprised of Jon Middleton and Sierra Lundy from Victoria, B.C., Canada. The two met on Salt Spring Island in the summer of 2012 and started singing together three years later.\n\nIn late October 2017, they released their first EP to the world, recorded in the woods of Vancouver Island, and immediately attracted an international following. Since then, they’ve toured Europe and the western United States and opened shows for the likes of Mason Jennings <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ocie+Elliott\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ken Carson',1141006,275656195,'Destroy Lonely','Kenyatta Lee Frazier Jr. (born April 11, 2000), professionally known as Ken Carson (previously stylized as Ken Car$on) is an American recording artist, and record producer from Atlanta, Georgia. He is signed to the record label Opium and has released multiple EPs and albums throughout his career, including his debut album Project X (2021) and his follow-up X (2022).\n\nCarson began his career under the stage name Ken Car$on, but changed it to Ken Carson <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ken+Carson\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dopebwoy',88703,2058403,'Sevn Alias','Dutch-Surinamese rapper and producer, born 14 March 1984 in Amsterdam, North Holland, and based in Almere, Flevoland. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dopebwoy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('3Robi',35547,919677,'Mula B','Anass Haouam (born 24 January 1995), known professionally as 3robi, is a Dutch rapper of Moroccan origin. Born in Amsterdam, he started his musical career in 2013. His debut studio album, Jonge jongen naar de top, was released in 2017 and reached at number-one on the Dutch Album Top 100. In 2019, 3robi founded his own record label Spow Business and released his second album in the next year. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/3Robi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Boef',70661,3633056,'Josylvio','Sofiane Boussaadia (Aubervilliers, 28 februari 1993), beter bekend als Boef is een Nederlandstalige rapper en vlogger met de Algerijns-Franse nationaliteit.[1]\n\nBinnen een jaar na zijn start in 2015 behoorde hij na Lil\' Kleine en Ronnie Flex tot de populairste rappers van Nederland.[2] Hij bracht een album uit en verschillende singles. Zijn vlog en rapvideo\'s werden vele miljoenen malen bekeken op het internet. In 2020 kreeg hij zijn eigen documentaire: Gewoon Boef. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Boef\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Srno',66388,465156,'Yssi SB',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Srno\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dani Ribba',45250,1007943,'LIT killah','Daniel Ribba, más conocido como Dani es un cantante de trap argentino, nacido el 6 de agosto de 1999. Conocido por su etapa como freestyler, participó en competencias como El Quinto Escalón y FMS Argentina. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dani+Ribba\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Landy',43185,864251,'L2B','There are at least two artists called Landy.\n\n1. LANDy is Adam Goldberg, with the likes of Steven Drozd of Flaming Lips, Aaron Espinoza of Earlimart, a host of others, and often times Goldberg very much alone. LANDy\'s are songs of love and loss. Renditions of contrition. If you\'ve ever been jilted or are generally antipathetic you\'ll get a kick out of LANDy! LANDy\'s debut album, \"Eros and Omissions,\" was recorded in Los Angeles, New York, and Norman, Oklahoma, in studios, living rooms, and truck stops (not really). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Landy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bymonkid',93,762,'Beltran3k',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bymonkid\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Club Hats',4165,142760,'enzocerobulto',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Club+Hats\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yesan 雪山',2398,17410,'c n d',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yesan+%E9%9B%AA%E5%B1%B1\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('$uicideboy$',1562946,458697571,'Scrim','$uicideboy$ are an American hip-hop duo from New Orleans, Louisiana, founded in 2014 by cousins Ruby da Cherry and $crim. Via the music sharing platform SoundCloud, the duo rose to popularity for their abrasive, self-produced beats, as well as their harsh lyrical content and themes prominently featuring substance use disorder and suicidal ideation. The duo are considered one of the most popular artists in the underground rap scene. They own and operate their own label, G*59 Records, under which all of their music is released. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/$uicideboy$\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Crudo Means Raw',29596,1290896,'granuja','Crudo Means Raw (nombre real: Fernando Bustamante) es un productor musical, rapero y cantante colombiano nacido en Medellín. Se ha destacado por su estilo versátil, que mezcla el hip hop clásico con sonidos latinos como el funk, el jazz, el bolero, la salsa y el reguetón. Su propuesta musical se caracteriza por la fusión de lo vintage con lo moderno, y por letras que reflejan vivencias personales, reflexiones sociales y una estética callejera y elegante al mismo tiempo. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Crudo+Means+Raw\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Prem Dhillon',18543,561393,'Arjan Dhillon',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Prem+Dhillon\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sidhu Moose Wala',76427,3735657,'Karan Aujla','Sidhu Moose Wala hails from the village of Moosa in Mansa district of Punjab. He was born to Balkaur Singh and Charan Kaur.\n\nAfter graduation, Sidhu Moose Wala moved to Canada and there he released his first song \"G Wagon\".  He started to perform live in India in 2018. He had also performed successful live shows in Canada. In August 2018 he launched his first film soundtrack song, \"Dollar\", for the film Dakuaan Da Munda\n\nMoose Wala had a rivalry with Karan Aujla, both have been replying each other through their songs. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sidhu+Moose+Wala\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Naseeb',6391,106259,'Schubi AKpella',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Naseeb\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jalen Santoy',268030,2823352,'LeRoyce',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jalen+Santoy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gunna',1777718,176214335,'Lil Baby','Sergio Giavanni Kitchens (born June 14, 1993), known professionally as Gunna, is an American rapper, singer and songwriter. Best known for his collaborations with Young Thug and Lil Baby, he is signed to Thug\'s record label, YSL Records, as well as 300 Entertainment and Atlantic Records.[2] He released his debut studio album, Drip or Drown 2 on February 22, 2019 and followed it up with his second studio album Wunna on May 22, 2020, which debuted atop the Billboard 200.[3] <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gunna\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lacrim',100348,3486701,'Niro','Karim Zenoud (born 19 April 1985), better known by his stage name  Lacrim, is a French rapper of Algerian descent. After collaborations with various rap artists, he released his album \"Faites entrer Lacrim\" on May 14, 2012 followed by a mixtape \"Toujours le même\" in Dec 17, 2012. The following two albums, \"Corleone\" in 2014 and \"Force et Honneur\" in 2017 both topped the French Albums Chart. He also released three successive mixtapes under the R.I.P.R.O series; two in 2015 and a third in 2017. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lacrim\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Maes',106953,6477063,'Ninho','1.) Maes, de son vrai nom Walid Georgey, né le 10 janvier 1995 à Villepinte en Seine-Saint-Denis, est un rappeur français originaire de Sevran. \n\nMaes naît le 10 janvier 1995 à Villepinte en Seine-Saint-Denis. Il grandit à la cité des Beaudottes à Sevran avec ses deux parents, ses cinq frères et ses deux sœurs. Maes commence à rapper à l\'âge de 14 ans ; avec ses amis Radmo et SY, ils forment le groupe MSR. Après le lycée, il effectue un séjour de 18 mois à la maison d\'arrêt de Villepinte de début 2016 à fin 2017.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Maes\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Club Hats',4165,142760,'enzocerobulto',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Club+Hats\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yesan 雪山',2398,17410,'c n d',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yesan+%E9%9B%AA%E5%B1%B1\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ninho',174483,12333842,'Gazo','Ninho, pseudonyme de William Nzobazola, est un rappeur, chanteur et auteur-compositeur français né le 2 avril 1996 à Longjumeau dans l\'Essonne.\n\nAvec plus de 1,2 million d\'albums écoulés, il est en 2020, le douzième rappeur à avoir vendu le plus de disques en France avec ses cinq projets (sans prise en compte des mixtapes gratuites) en moins de cinq ans d\'activité. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ninho\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Maes',106953,6477063,'Ninho','1.) Maes, de son vrai nom Walid Georgey, né le 10 janvier 1995 à Villepinte en Seine-Saint-Denis, est un rappeur français originaire de Sevran. \n\nMaes naît le 10 janvier 1995 à Villepinte en Seine-Saint-Denis. Il grandit à la cité des Beaudottes à Sevran avec ses deux parents, ses cinq frères et ses deux sœurs. Maes commence à rapper à l\'âge de 14 ans ; avec ses amis Radmo et SY, ils forment le groupe MSR. Après le lycée, il effectue un séjour de 18 mois à la maison d\'arrêt de Villepinte de début 2016 à fin 2017.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Maes\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Booba',190532,15278570,'Kaaris','Élie Yaffa (born December 9, 1976 in Boulogne-Billancourt, France), better known by his stage name Booba is a French rapper of Senegalese and French descent, from Boulogne-Billancourt, a commune in the western suburbs of Paris. He began his career as a rapper in 1994. In 1996 he co-wrote, with Ali (the co-founder of Lunatic) \"Le crime paie\". And from 1997 to 1998 he was incarcerated for the robbery of a taxi driver. Lunatic went on to found their own label, 45 Scientific, and in 2000 released the much vaunted Mauvais Oeil. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Booba\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mesita',228262,4312196,'3am','Mesita is the name of more than one artist:\n1) US indie pop \n2) Uruguay rap/trap \n\n1) James Cooley AKA Mesita is an American multi-instrumentalist from Colorado. He started releasing music under The Frustration Corporation, a plunderphonics project. He released his debut album under Mesita, Cherry Blossoms, in June 2008, with his debut EP No Worries coming out around a year later. In 2010, he released his second EP Living/Breathing. The EP changed his sound from indie rock to a more polished indietronica/pop sound. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mesita\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lefty SM',60583,1322525,'Santa Fe Klan','Juan Carlos Sauceda Vásquez (San Luis Río Colorado, Sonora; 22 de abril de 1992- Zapopan, Jalisco; 2 de septiembre de 2023), conocido como Lefty SM, fue un rapero y cantante mexicano. Su canción por mi México se considera un himno para los mexicanos residentes fuera del país <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lefty+SM\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mañas Ru-Fino',10577,288383,'Métricas Frías',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ma%C3%B1as+Ru-Fino\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DeeJohend',507,2014,'Mañas Ru-Fino',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/DeeJohend\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Remik Gonzalez',21621,279538,'Tren Lokote','Rapero mexicano, originario de Tijuana, Baja California.\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Remik+Gonzalez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Buhodermia 夜',20722,985175,'Doble Porcion',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Buhodermia+%E5%A4%9C\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('El Maese KDS',1251,15662,'Caelite',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/El+Maese+KDS\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lacrim',100348,3486701,'Niro','Karim Zenoud (born 19 April 1985), better known by his stage name  Lacrim, is a French rapper of Algerian descent. After collaborations with various rap artists, he released his album \"Faites entrer Lacrim\" on May 14, 2012 followed by a mixtape \"Toujours le même\" in Dec 17, 2012. The following two albums, \"Corleone\" in 2014 and \"Force et Honneur\" in 2017 both topped the French Albums Chart. He also released three successive mixtapes under the R.I.P.R.O series; two in 2015 and a third in 2017. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lacrim\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('French Montana',1937417,29070130,'DJ Khaled','Karim Kharbouch (born November 9, 1984), better known by his stage name French Montana, is a Moroccan-American rapper. Born and raised in Morocco, he immigrated to the United States with his family at the age of 13. He embarked on a musical career in 2002, releasing a slew of independent material until signing a joint-venture record deal with Puff Daddy\'s Bad Boy Records and Rick Ross\'s Maybach Music Group in 2012.\nKharbouch released his debut mixtape in 2007 and had his first breakthrough with the single \"Choppa Choppa Down\" in 2010. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/French+Montana\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alemán',201633,4812659,'Gera MX','Erick Raúl Alemán Ramírez was born on February 20, 1990, in Cabo San Lucas, Baja California Sur.\n\nHe began exploring rap at the age of 14 alongside his childhood friend MC King, with whom he formed a group called “2 Rimas.” A year later, they met DJ Phat, who joined the group, prompting them to change their name to “Doble Rima.” In 2009, they released an album titled Click Clack Punto Exacto.\n\nIn 2010, MC King decided to take a break, leaving DJ Phat and Alemán to continue the project. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/Alem%C3%A1n\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lefty SM',60583,1322525,'Santa Fe Klan','Juan Carlos Sauceda Vásquez (San Luis Río Colorado, Sonora; 22 de abril de 1992- Zapopan, Jalisco; 2 de septiembre de 2023), conocido como Lefty SM, fue un rapero y cantante mexicano. Su canción por mi México se considera un himno para los mexicanos residentes fuera del país <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lefty+SM\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('13 Organisé',23289,244810,'Jul',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/13+Organis%C3%A9\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('SCH',107720,15296593,'Laylow','There are multiple artists by the name of SCH.\n\n1) Sch (from Schwarzer, his real family name) is a French rapper from Marseille, of German descent. He blew up in 2015, after releasing his debut mixtape A7, reaching 30\'000 sales by the end of the year. His first studio album, Anarchie, was released in 2016. THe second one, Deo Favente, came out in 2017. In january 2018 he created his own label Maison Baron Rouge. Later in 2018 he released a third album JVLIVS. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/SCH\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Soso Maness',48106,1080568,'Hornet La Frappe',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Soso+Maness\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Elams',9165,102455,'Kamikaz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Elams\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Solda',325,2046,'Graya',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Solda\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Houari',9919,82603,'THABITI',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Houari\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Freddie Gibbs',1277560,107519893,'Boldy James','Freddie Tipton (born June 14, 1982 in Gary, Indiana), better known as Freddie Gibbs, is an American rapper who became popular after being included in XXL Magazine\'s ten Freshmen of 2010. He was previously signed to Interscope Records before being let go from his deal without an official record being released. He has released five mixtapes since his first in 2005 including Live From Gary, Indiana, Big Bizness, The Miseducation of Freddie Gibbs, midwestgangstaboxframecadillacmuzik and Str8 Killa No Filla. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Freddie+Gibbs\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('The Alchemist',1347530,47088057,'Roc Marciano','Alan Daniel Maman (born October 25, 1977), better known as The Alchemist, is a hip-hop producer and MC. The Alchemist has been an active producer since 1991. He hails from affluent Beverly Hills, California. After rising to prominence in the late 1990s as a close associate of Dilated Peoples, he went on to produce for many of hip-hop\'s leading artists in the 2000s.\n\nAs a teen, Al began to identify strongly with the rebellious lyrics and urban sounds of hip-hop, and he began writing his own lyrics as a creative outlet. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/The+Alchemist\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Khalil?',261197,4043501,'Jaybexo','Khalil Greaves, better known by his stage name Khalil?, is an up-and-coming rapper who started off rapping about random things with his younger cousin, Manny Mock, who he was in a duo in called “Manny & Khalil.” The duo slowly decided to break up. Now he raps about topics such as anime, e-thot’s and Juul’s.\n\nHe started to gain attention through tracks like “Birthday Belle,” which was a song directed towards popular Instagram star Belle Delphine.\n\nOh April 12, 2019, Khalil would release his debut mixtape, GameStop. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Khalil%3F\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Maes',106953,6477063,'Ninho','1.) Maes, de son vrai nom Walid Georgey, né le 10 janvier 1995 à Villepinte en Seine-Saint-Denis, est un rappeur français originaire de Sevran. \n\nMaes naît le 10 janvier 1995 à Villepinte en Seine-Saint-Denis. Il grandit à la cité des Beaudottes à Sevran avec ses deux parents, ses cinq frères et ses deux sœurs. Maes commence à rapper à l\'âge de 14 ans ; avec ses amis Radmo et SY, ils forment le groupe MSR. Après le lycée, il effectue un séjour de 18 mois à la maison d\'arrêt de Villepinte de début 2016 à fin 2017.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Maes\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dharius',34651,773920,'Cartel de Santa','Mexican Rapper and former Member of the Mexican Hip-Hop/Rap Group Cartel De Santa. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dharius\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Neto Peña',34320,610083,'Toser One',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Neto+Pe%C3%B1a\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tiro Loko',2773,25902,'Toser One',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tiro+Loko\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Baby Gang',118128,6385865,'SIMBA LA RUE','Zaccaria Mouhib (Arabic: زَكَريا موهيب, romanized: Zakariyaa Mouhyb; born 26 June 2001), known professionally as Baby Gang, is an Italian-Moroccan rapper. He began his musical career in 2018 and released his debut EP \"EP1\" in 2021.\n\nBaby Gang released his first single \"Street\" in 2018 in Calolziocorte, followed by \"Education\" and \"Cella 1\" in 2019, songs inspired by his experiences in prison. In May 2021 he released the EP \"EP1\", which peaked at number 15 on the FIMI Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Baby+Gang\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sacky',15834,410590,'Escomar',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sacky\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Baby Gang',118128,6385865,'SIMBA LA RUE','Zaccaria Mouhib (Arabic: زَكَريا موهيب, romanized: Zakariyaa Mouhyb; born 26 June 2001), known professionally as Baby Gang, is an Italian-Moroccan rapper. He began his musical career in 2018 and released his debut EP \"EP1\" in 2021.\n\nBaby Gang released his first single \"Street\" in 2018 in Calolziocorte, followed by \"Education\" and \"Cella 1\" in 2019, songs inspired by his experiences in prison. In May 2021 he released the EP \"EP1\", which peaked at number 15 on the FIMI Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Baby+Gang\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Népal',77892,6231204,'Nekfeu','Népal, whose real name is Clement Di Fiore, was a French rapper and beatmaker born the 12th of October 1990 in the 14th arrondissement of Paris. He was also known by the names KLM and GrandMaster Splinter. Member of the collective 75th Session, he formed with Doums the duo 2Fingz. He was also close to the collective L\'Entourage. Népal attached great importance to anonymity, showing himself only masked with a hood or make-up.\n\nOn August 23, 2019 <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/N%C3%A9pal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Buhodermia 夜',20722,985175,'Doble Porcion',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Buhodermia+%E5%A4%9C\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Buhodermia 夜',20722,985175,'Doble Porcion',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Buhodermia+%E5%A4%9C\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Una María',589,2144,'Encarta 98','Artist and composer based in Medellín, Colombia. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Una+Mar%C3%ADa\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ovi',113046,2229760,'Natanael Cano','1. Ovi is a cuban artist based in Miami with Natanael Cano are one of the biggest exponents for Corridos Tumbados/Trap Corridos mixing Mexican/Cuban/Latino culture on a higher level.\n\n2. Romanian singer who represented Romania in Eurovision 2010 & 2014 with the songs ‘Playing With Fire’ and ‘Miracle’ with Paula Seling. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ovi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alemán',201633,4812659,'Gera MX','Erick Raúl Alemán Ramírez was born on February 20, 1990, in Cabo San Lucas, Baja California Sur.\n\nHe began exploring rap at the age of 14 alongside his childhood friend MC King, with whom he formed a group called “2 Rimas.” A year later, they met DJ Phat, who joined the group, prompting them to change their name to “Doble Rima.” In 2009, they released an album titled Click Clack Punto Exacto.\n\nIn 2010, MC King decided to take a break, leaving DJ Phat and Alemán to continue the project. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/Alem%C3%A1n\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Freddie Gibbs',1277560,107519893,'Boldy James','Freddie Tipton (born June 14, 1982 in Gary, Indiana), better known as Freddie Gibbs, is an American rapper who became popular after being included in XXL Magazine\'s ten Freshmen of 2010. He was previously signed to Interscope Records before being let go from his deal without an official record being released. He has released five mixtapes since his first in 2005 including Live From Gary, Indiana, Big Bizness, The Miseducation of Freddie Gibbs, midwestgangstaboxframecadillacmuzik and Str8 Killa No Filla. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Freddie+Gibbs\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('The Alchemist',1347530,47088057,'Roc Marciano','Alan Daniel Maman (born October 25, 1977), better known as The Alchemist, is a hip-hop producer and MC. The Alchemist has been an active producer since 1991. He hails from affluent Beverly Hills, California. After rising to prominence in the late 1990s as a close associate of Dilated Peoples, he went on to produce for many of hip-hop\'s leading artists in the 2000s.\n\nAs a teen, Al began to identify strongly with the rebellious lyrics and urban sounds of hip-hop, and he began writing his own lyrics as a creative outlet. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/The+Alchemist\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rick Ross',2438381,36476450,'Young Jeezy','\nWilliam Leonard Roberts II (born January 28, 1976), better known by his stage name Rick Ross, is an American rapper. He derived his stage name from the drug trafficker \"Freeway\" Ricky Ross. Ross founded the record label Maybach Music Group, on which he released his studio albums Deeper Than Rap ,Teflon Don, God Forgives, I Don\'t, Mastermind, Hood Billionaire, Black Market, Rather You Than Me, and most recently Port of Miami 2. \n\nWilliam Leonard Roberts II was born in Coahoma County <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rick+Ross\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gambi',90451,2302124,'Jazzy Bazz','Gambi est un rappeur français né le 12 janvier 1998 à Fontenay-sous-Bois, dans le Val-de-Marne. Wikipédia\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gambi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('MC Paulin da Capital',116061,1468343,'Dj GM','Dono de uma das vinhetas mais famosas do funk (É o Mandrake, Mandrake na voz), o MC Paulin da Capital é um dos principais nomes da atualidade no gênero. O Mandrake tem a música em sua vida desde pequeno, graças ao pai, que também é músico. Seu início foi no pagode, mas não demorou muito para ele conhecer e se apaixonar pelo funk. Inspirado em Daleste e Felipe Boladão,  ele logo se tornou o MC Paulo Loko, mas foi preso antes de chegar ao sucesso. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/MC+Paulin+da+Capital\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dj GM',75180,766229,'MC Paulin da Capital',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dj+GM\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Afaz Natural',14432,152176,'Al2 el Aldeano',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Afaz+Natural\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jauria Santa',22282,862534,'La Santa Grifa',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jauria+Santa\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Saramalacara',97573,8943873,'Rojuu','Sara Azul Froján, conocida artísticamente como Saramalacara, es una artista argentina de Mataderos, Buenos Aires, nacida el 8 de noviembre de 2000, y miembro del colectivo Rip Gang.\n\nSu nombre artístico surgió de una broma con sus amigos. Ella explicó que lo eligió porque rimaba, le gustaba que estuviera en español y, aunque no le gustan mucho las cosas en inglés, sí acepta un poco de Spanglish.\n\nComenzó en la escena urbana haciendo graffiti, bajo el nombre \"Korea\", pintando trenes y paredes. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Saramalacara\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Taichu',79854,2705153,'fiah','Tais López Miranda, better known by her stage name \"Taichu\" (her childhood nickname), was born on April 22, 2001 (Age 22). She is an Argentinian singer-rapper, ex-founder of \"Rip Gang\".\n\nWhen young, she dropped out of school to work as a nail technician and, in her free time, took singing lessons. She began recording covers and uploading them to Instagram, until one day she got a fan base and began to compose.\n\nHer musical inffluences are diversed <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Taichu\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('EvaR',435,1809,'Saramalacara','http://hardwax.com/03030/ <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/EvaR\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Apache',68288,665115,'Canserbero','Apache is a name used by more than one artist: \n\n1) Building his New Jersey street credibility in the late \'80s by fronting the hip-hop group the Flavor Unit, Apache eventually broke solo to show off his own microphone skills and won the recognition of Tommy Boy Records in the process. After the release of his self-titled debut in 1991, Apache scored the underground hit \"Gangsta Bitch\" without the use of radio or video airplay in 1993. Upon his minor success, Apache followed through with \"...Ain\'t Shit\" that same year. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Apache\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('White Gold',6225,17629,'Pain Jerk & John Wiese','1) White Gold is a post-apocalyptic power pop trio comprised of lead singer/guitarist White Gold (SM) and rhythm section The Calcium Twins (SM). The ultimate west coast rock combo, they’re influenced by regions around Northern California, Southern California, and the central chakras. Blending the Calcium Twins impactful harmonies with the howling vocals of White Gold himself, White Gold pours out music that regularly lifts its audience to healthy new heights.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/White+Gold\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Timal',41739,1788833,'GLK',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Timal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Maes',106953,6477063,'Ninho','1.) Maes, de son vrai nom Walid Georgey, né le 10 janvier 1995 à Villepinte en Seine-Saint-Denis, est un rappeur français originaire de Sevran. \n\nMaes naît le 10 janvier 1995 à Villepinte en Seine-Saint-Denis. Il grandit à la cité des Beaudottes à Sevran avec ses deux parents, ses cinq frères et ses deux sœurs. Maes commence à rapper à l\'âge de 14 ans ; avec ses amis Radmo et SY, ils forment le groupe MSR. Après le lycée, il effectue un séjour de 18 mois à la maison d\'arrêt de Villepinte de début 2016 à fin 2017.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Maes\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yensanjuan',144,1016,'Lara Project',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yensanjuan\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lacrim',100348,3486701,'Niro','Karim Zenoud (born 19 April 1985), better known by his stage name  Lacrim, is a French rapper of Algerian descent. After collaborations with various rap artists, he released his album \"Faites entrer Lacrim\" on May 14, 2012 followed by a mixtape \"Toujours le même\" in Dec 17, 2012. The following two albums, \"Corleone\" in 2014 and \"Force et Honneur\" in 2017 both topped the French Albums Chart. He also released three successive mixtapes under the R.I.P.R.O series; two in 2015 and a third in 2017. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lacrim\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Wos',187849,15540001,'Trueno','\nValentín Oliva, (Buenos Aires, Argentina; 23 de enero de 1998) conocido artísticamente como Wos, es un rapero, freestyler argentino. Es conocido por ser el actual campeón en el torneo internacional de Red Bull Batalla de los Gallos.\n\nCarrera\n\nWos arrancó desde muy pequeño rapeando en las plazas y participando en competencias como El Quinto Escalón, donde ya demostraba un gran potencial y sobre todo mucho coraje. Pero fue en 2016 cuando demostró que su nivel estaba para mucho más que una plaza <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Wos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ninho',174483,12333842,'Gazo','Ninho, pseudonyme de William Nzobazola, est un rappeur, chanteur et auteur-compositeur français né le 2 avril 1996 à Longjumeau dans l\'Essonne.\n\nAvec plus de 1,2 million d\'albums écoulés, il est en 2020, le douzième rappeur à avoir vendu le plus de disques en France avec ses cinq projets (sans prise en compte des mixtapes gratuites) en moins de cinq ans d\'activité. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ninho\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Redimi2',23847,495991,'MaDiel LaRa','Nace el 3 de junio del 1979, en la cuidad de Santo Domingo, Republica Dominicana. Su verdadero nombre Willy González Cruz. En su crecimiento se desarrollo en las artes como el dibujo, danza, pintura y teatro. \nLlego a ser uno de los más brillantes estudiantes de su escuela primaria y ya a sus 12 años siente la inclinación por la música Rap. A sus 15 años este estilo de música se convierte en su favorita. Ya a los 17 y 18 años Willy pasaba la mayor parte de su tiempo en fiestas y discotecas <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Redimi2\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kid Cudi',4647285,270182694,'KIDS SEE GHOSTS','Scott Ramon Seguro Mescudi (born January 30, 1984 in Shaker Heights, Ohio, United States), better known by his stage name Kid Cudi, is a Grammy award nominated rapper, singer and actor who first gained attention after the release of his debut mixtape A Kid Named Cudi which he released in 2008 in collaboration with New York street wear brand 10.Deep. The mixtape caught the attention of Kanye West and led to Cudi\'s signing to the G.O.O.D. Music Label. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kid+Cudi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Buhodermia 夜',20722,985175,'Doble Porcion',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Buhodermia+%E5%A4%9C\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kaza',36083,1086421,'DA Uzi','Kaza est un rappeur originaire de Val de Fontenay dans le 94. Partagé entre une carrière dans le basket ou dans le rap, c’est sa série de morceaux HRTBRK qui va le conforter en tant que rappeur : le second épisode HRTBRK #2 lui permet d’exploser et totalise à ce jour plus de 15 millions de vues sur YouTube. Signé sur le label Elektra France, il était proche du rappeur Gambi et dit avoir été grandement influencé par le groupe XV Barbar. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kaza\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Freeze Corleone',89510,8074698,'Osirus Jack','Issa Lorenzo Diakhaté (born 6 June 1992 in Les Lilas, Seine-Saint-Denis), better known as Freeze Corleone, is a French rapper, singer-songwriter and record producer. He is also the founder of the collective 667, and CFR (with Norsacce and Osirus Jack). He lives in Dakar, Senegal.[1][2][3] \n\nCorleone was born in Les Lilas in Seine-Saint-Denis to a Senegalese father and an Italian mother.[4] In an interview with Les Inrocks, he claims to have spent his early years in Pantin, before attending high school in Dakar, Senegal.[5] <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Freeze+Corleone\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('NAV',1107793,58394127,'NAV & Metro Boomin','Navraj Singh Goraya was born on November 3, 1989, in Toronto, Ontario and was raised in the city\'s suburban Rexdale neighbourhood. He is of Punjabi descent; his parents are Sikhs originally from the northern state of Punjab in India. His mother was involved in computer manufacturing and his father operated a forklift. Goraya first became interested in music after his mother bought him a boombox in the third grade. His uncle, who was a popular singer in Punjab, also brought him to a studio. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/NAV\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gunna',1777718,176214335,'Lil Baby','Sergio Giavanni Kitchens (born June 14, 1993), known professionally as Gunna, is an American rapper, singer and songwriter. Best known for his collaborations with Young Thug and Lil Baby, he is signed to Thug\'s record label, YSL Records, as well as 300 Entertainment and Atlantic Records.[2] He released his debut studio album, Drip or Drown 2 on February 22, 2019 and followed it up with his second studio album Wunna on May 22, 2020, which debuted atop the Billboard 200.[3] <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gunna\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('El Arkeologo',12223,169566,'Luis7Lunes','Juan Carlos Fonnegra Toro, más conocido como Gambeta, es un rapero y productor musical colombiano, nacido en Medellín el 11 de noviembre de 1984. Desde muy joven se interesó por el hip hop y la cultura urbana, y empezó a escribir sus propias rimas y a participar en batallas de freestyle. En 1998, junto con su amigo Kaztro, formó el dúo Alcolirykoz, que se convirtió en uno de los referentes del rap nacional, con álbumes como \'La Revancha de los Tímidos\' (2010), \'Servicios Ambulatorioz\' (2017), y \'Aranjuez\' (2021). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/El+Arkeologo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gambeta',77,418,'Kaztro',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gambeta\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nayana Iz',54415,352892,'Wesley Joseph','NAYANA IZ (“eye-zee”, her first name means beautiful eyes in Hindi) was raised in North London but born in India. After a childhood of wishing she lived in her motherland, the English capital might have grown on the 19-year-old musician but she still has big plans to relocate in the future. Though still in her teens, NTS guest host Nayana, who just came off tour with Irish rapper Kojaque, says that she feels at least 100,000 years old. Must be all that hard work she’s putting into life <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nayana+Iz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Los Nandez',2906,28865,'Asilo 38',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Los+Nandez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oboy',104923,5206870,'Josman','Mihaja Ramiarinarivo (born 6 January 1997), better known by the stage name OBOY, is a Malagasy-born French rapper. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oboy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mister You',41280,911675,'Lacrim','Younes Latifi (born 5 February 1984), better known by his stage name Mister You, is a French rapper of Moroccan origin and known for his freestyles and big collaborations with other rap and urban artists.\nBorn in Paris, he was raised in the Belleville area of the capital. He had a troubled youth and held in juvenile prison for brief periods on three occasions. But he was condemned for trafficking drugs to a 5-year term in 2007. But he escaped justice <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mister+You\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Westside Gunn',1041917,83663745,'Benny the Butcher','Alvin Lamar Worthy (born July 27, 1982), known professionally as Westside Gunn, is an American rapper. He is the paternal half-brother of fellow rapper Conway The Machine, with whom he forms the duo Hall N Nash, and the cousin of fellow Buffalo native rapper Benny the Butcher. In 2014, he founded the record label Griselda Records, as well as clothing brand Fashion Rebels.\n\nIn 2016, he released his first commercial album, Flygod. On March 3, 2017, Griselda Records signed a deal with Eminem\'s Shady Records <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Westside+Gunn\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Joey Bada$$',1734040,113072898,'Kirk Knight','Jo-Vaughn Virginie Scott (born January 20, 1995), better known by his stage name Joey Bada$$, is an American rapper, producer and artist from Brooklyn, New York. He is a member of the hip hop collective Pro Era, with whom he has released three mixtapes. Joey released his debut mixtape 1999 on June 12 2012.  Featuring production from other Pro Era members, as well as some J Dilla and MF DOOM beats, the tape was released to general critical acclaim. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Joey+Bada$$\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Billie Essco',5075,57426,'The 6th Letter',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Billie+Essco\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('AP Dhillon',126305,8139628,'Karan Aujla','Amritpal Singh Dhillon (b. [birthdate]January 10, 1993[/birthdate]), known as AP Dhillon, is an Indian singer, rapper, songwriter and record producer associated with Punjabi music who lives in Victoria, Canada. Five of his singles have peaked on the Official Charts Company UK Asian and Punjabi charts, while \"Majhail\" and \"Brown Munde\" have topped Billboard charts.\n\nDhillon started his career in 2019 with the single \"Fake\" with Shinda Kahlon. He also appeared in the music video of the track \"Faraar\" by Gurinder Gill and Shinda Kahlon <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/AP+Dhillon\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gurinder Gill',21373,646281,'Navaan Sandhu',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gurinder+Gill\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gminxr',7285,108891,'Tegi Pannu',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gminxr\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dowba Montana',6713,130037,'Martin Lora',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dowba+Montana\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mobb Deep',1699918,38808028,'Nas','\nMobb Deep was a hip-hop duo made up of Havoc and Prodigy. Both members are natives of Queensbridge, New York; located in Long Island City. They are perhaps most famous for their landmark album, The Infamous, and the accompanying hit single, Shook Ones Pt. II.\n\n1992–1994: Early Career\n\nProdigy and Havoc met one another while attending the prestigious High School of Art & Design in Manhattan. Coming from similar backgrounds, the duo broke into the rap game in 1992. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mobb+Deep\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Luis7Lunes',8963,404648,'No Rules Clan','Luis7Lunes es médico de profesión y rapero por vocación. Aunque se ha mantenido en un bajo perfil, es una de las voces más conocidas de la escuela del rap de la ciudad de Medellín. Era conocido anteriormente como “Luiyima”, alias bajo el cual realizó varias producciones antes de su actual proyecto Luis7Lunes, que debutó en el año 2015 con el álbum Ruidos en Hamelin, producido en el estudio M.A.A.T, disco que dio a conocer su particular estilo <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Luis7Lunes\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Afterclass',3062,22229,'Oghu',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Afterclass\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gambeta',77,418,'Kaztro',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gambeta\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Pink Siifu',358967,6497610,'Mike','Pink Siifu, born Livingston Matthews and based in Los Angeles, has made music under many other names, most prominently Iiye.  Matthews’ music weaves a web between various pillars of neo-soul, and sun-dried California hip-hop but at the center, there is a comprehensible Siifu. His persona is fully fleshed out: an earnest poet dependent on prayer but too shy to scan as self-serious, speaking his thoughts through the voices of others and disguising his own in crooked, glinting bars. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Pink+Siifu\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Fly Anakin',59528,1072369,'Mutant Academy','Fly Anakin (born Frank L. Walton, Jr.) is an American rapper from Richmond, Virginia; best known as a member of the collectives Mutant Academy and Scheme Team. In 2014, Fly Anakin formed the Mutant Academy collective with fellow rapper Henny L.O., releasing the collaborative mixtape Open House that same year. This was followed by mirrors_episode.1, a collaborative EP with producer Ewonee. Anakin\'s debut solo mixtape Elsewhere Ave. was finally released in July 2015; followed by The Mandate [side a] EP with Koncept Jack$on <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Fly+Anakin\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Fousheé',419887,4567465,'Ravyn Lenae','Brittany Fousheé, known simply as Fousheé (pronounced foo-shay), is a singer-songwriter from Harlem, New York. She participated in the 15th season of The Voice, where her blind audition of the song \"Redbone\" by Childish Gambino made two seats turn, she got a place in Adam Levine\'s team and later, due to her vocal quality, she jumped onto the global scene. .\n \nHer love for music stemmed from her mother, who was a drummer for PEP, an all-female Jamaican reggae band. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Foushe%C3%A9\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Crem\'e',667,6913,'ERNST JR.',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Crem%27e\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rich Vagos',38435,658485,'Faruz Feet',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rich+Vagos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Samantha Barrón',10759,114307,'Yoss Bones',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Samantha+Barr%C3%B3n\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yoss Bones',16329,162020,'Rich Vagos',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yoss+Bones\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Cejaz Negraz',10196,233550,'Solitario soldado',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Cejaz+Negraz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Guellaz',69,104,'Joes Yawar Cru',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Guellaz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bosh',45111,710045,'GLK','Bosh est un rappeur et acteur français né le 26 mai 1992 à Dreux et originaire de Plaisir. \n\nEn 2020, il se fait connaître du grand public dans la série de Canal+ Validé et avec son titre Djomb qui atteint la première place des ventes de singles en France. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bosh\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sevn Alias',57908,2964159,'Josylvio','Sevn Alias is a Dutch rapper (with Surinamese roots) from Amsterdam, now based in Almere, The Netherlands. He contributed tracks to compilation albums, released a few singles, a mixtape (Twenty Four Sevn, 2015) and an EP (Twenty Four Sevn 2, 2016). He featured on recordings by Hef, gaining prominence in the Dutch hiphop scene. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sevn+Alias\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Josylvio',51836,3139941,'Sevn Alias','Joost Theo Sylvio Yussef Abdel Galil Dowib (Naarden, 14 april 1992), bekend onder zijn artiestennaam Josylvio, is een Nederlands rapper.\n\nBiografie\nJosylvio werd geboren in Naarden als de zoon van een Nederlandse moeder en een Egyptische vader. In 2015 deed hij een Zonamo-sessie onder de naam Jaybay. In 2015 bracht hij de single Le7nesh uit (met Sevn Alias). Het was de aanleiding voor het album Ma3seb, dat hij samen met hiphopproducent en jeugdvriend[1] Esko uitbracht. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Josylvio\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('MocroManiac',10613,212281,'Pietju Bell','Abdelilah el Foulani (Amsterdam, 26 december 1987), beter bekend als MocroManiac of Mani, is een Marokkaans-Nederlands rapper.\n\nMani maakte van 2010 tot 2014 deel uit van de Hydroboyz, waarmee hij de clubhit Hindabuilding scoorde. In 2014 ging hij solo verder en bracht in 2018 zijn debuutalbum Maniac uit.\n\nJeugd in Amsterdam\nFoulani groeide op in Kraaiennest (Bijlmer) in Amsterdam-Zuidoost. Als kind was hij wild en roekeloos en leefde hij vooral op straat. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/MocroManiac\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Farid Bang',103938,4338822,'Kollegah','Farid Bang (*1986 in Melilla, Spanien; bürgerlich: Farid Hamed El Abdellaoui) ist ein deutscher Rapper marrokanischer Herkunft, der stilistisch dem Genre Gangster Rap zuzuordnen ist.\nFarid begann mit 19 Jahren gemeinsam mit „Tekken“ zu rappen. Als er Eko Fresh kennen lernte, unterschrieb er einen Vertrag bei dessen Label German Dream Entertainment.[3] Drei Lieder mit ihm erschienen 2005 auf Eko Freshs Mixtape Fick immer noch deine Story, Ekos Abrechnung mit Kool Savas. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Farid+Bang\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('French Montana',1937417,29070130,'DJ Khaled','Karim Kharbouch (born November 9, 1984), better known by his stage name French Montana, is a Moroccan-American rapper. Born and raised in Morocco, he immigrated to the United States with his family at the age of 13. He embarked on a musical career in 2002, releasing a slew of independent material until signing a joint-venture record deal with Puff Daddy\'s Bad Boy Records and Rick Ross\'s Maybach Music Group in 2012.\nKharbouch released his debut mixtape in 2007 and had his first breakthrough with the single \"Choppa Choppa Down\" in 2010. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/French+Montana\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Fousheé',419887,4567465,'Ravyn Lenae','Brittany Fousheé, known simply as Fousheé (pronounced foo-shay), is a singer-songwriter from Harlem, New York. She participated in the 15th season of The Voice, where her blind audition of the song \"Redbone\" by Childish Gambino made two seats turn, she got a place in Adam Levine\'s team and later, due to her vocal quality, she jumped onto the global scene. .\n \nHer love for music stemmed from her mother, who was a drummer for PEP, an all-female Jamaican reggae band. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Foushe%C3%A9\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Buhodermia 夜',20722,985175,'Doble Porcion',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Buhodermia+%E5%A4%9C\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Iziou',38,237,'Mañas Ru-Fino',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Iziou\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Club Hats',4165,142760,'enzocerobulto',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Club+Hats\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yesan 雪山',2398,17410,'c n d',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yesan+%E9%9B%AA%E5%B1%B1\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Métricas Frías',20754,807060,'Mañas Ru-Fino','Santiago Marín Villa (Envigado, 22 de julio de 1994 - Manizales, 26 de agosto de 2022) más conocido como Métricas Frías o Sadman fue un compositor y rapero colombiano. Fue uno de los artistas más influyentes del género del país.\n\nNació en Envigado. Desde su adolescencia se radicó en Medellín. Empezó a componer rap. Se inició en 2010 como freestyler y asistiendo a batallas del Freestyle local.​ En 2011, con Mañas Ru-Fino, formaría el grupo musical Doble Porción <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/M%C3%A9tricas+Fr%C3%ADas\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DeeJohend',507,2014,'Mañas Ru-Fino',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/DeeJohend\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Djadja & Dinaz',55163,3088576,'Ninho',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Djadja+&+Dinaz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Uzi Vert',2691670,420518117,'Playboi Carti','Symere Bysil Woods (born July 31, 1995, Philadelphia, USA), known professionally as Lil Uzi Vert, is an American rapper, singer, and songwriter. Characterized by their face tattoos, facial piercings, eccentric hairstyles, and androgynous fashion, their music is often defined by dark subject matters and imagery built on a melodic emo approach to trap.\n\nThey attracted mainstream attention following the release of their debut single \"Money Longer\" in 2016. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Uzi+Vert\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ashafar',40315,1227144,'Henkie T',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ashafar\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Baby Gang',118128,6385865,'SIMBA LA RUE','Zaccaria Mouhib (Arabic: زَكَريا موهيب, romanized: Zakariyaa Mouhyb; born 26 June 2001), known professionally as Baby Gang, is an Italian-Moroccan rapper. He began his musical career in 2018 and released his debut EP \"EP1\" in 2021.\n\nBaby Gang released his first single \"Street\" in 2018 in Calolziocorte, followed by \"Education\" and \"Cella 1\" in 2019, songs inspired by his experiences in prison. In May 2021 he released the EP \"EP1\", which peaked at number 15 on the FIMI Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Baby+Gang\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Métricas Frías',20754,807060,'Mañas Ru-Fino','Santiago Marín Villa (Envigado, 22 de julio de 1994 - Manizales, 26 de agosto de 2022) más conocido como Métricas Frías o Sadman fue un compositor y rapero colombiano. Fue uno de los artistas más influyentes del género del país.\n\nNació en Envigado. Desde su adolescencia se radicó en Medellín. Empezó a componer rap. Se inició en 2010 como freestyler y asistiendo a batallas del Freestyle local.​ En 2011, con Mañas Ru-Fino, formaría el grupo musical Doble Porción <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/M%C3%A9tricas+Fr%C3%ADas\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mañas Ru-Fino',10577,288383,'Métricas Frías',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ma%C3%B1as+Ru-Fino\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Luis7Lunes',8963,404648,'No Rules Clan','Luis7Lunes es médico de profesión y rapero por vocación. Aunque se ha mantenido en un bajo perfil, es una de las voces más conocidas de la escuela del rap de la ciudad de Medellín. Era conocido anteriormente como “Luiyima”, alias bajo el cual realizó varias producciones antes de su actual proyecto Luis7Lunes, que debutó en el año 2015 con el álbum Ruidos en Hamelin, producido en el estudio M.A.A.T, disco que dio a conocer su particular estilo <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Luis7Lunes\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Afterclass',3062,22229,'Oghu',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Afterclass\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Buhodermia 夜',20722,985175,'Doble Porcion',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Buhodermia+%E5%A4%9C\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Durk',1068426,63277852,'Only The Family','Durk Derrick Banks (born October 19, 1992), better known as Lil Durk, is a rapper, singer, and songwriter from Chicago, Illinois. Durk is best known for his involvement in the drill wave that took the music world by storm in the 2010s. He is the founder of his own record label, Only the Family (OTF).\n\nDurk’s early career was, like many drill artists, plagued with legal issues and accusations of violence. These issues eventually led to his shows being canceled. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Durk\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DAX',238570,4966776,'Jelly Roll','There are two artists named DAX.\n1) DAX is a Canadian American Rapper.\nIn January 2019, rapper DAX Released a success \"You Should Have Known\" with Hopsin which had gained over 5 million views on Youtube and over 1 million on Spotify. In February 2019 DAX released \"I\'m Not Joyner or Don Q\" Tory Lanez Diss, after Tory claimed he was the best rapper alive, After it was posted, Tory forced DAX to apologise on camera, allegedly not because of the song itself but because of \"reckless talk in DMs\", although many people remain sceptical of this. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/DAX\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Meekz',102277,2461366,'Potter Payper','Born in Gorton, Manchester. Meekz came to prominence with the release of his debut mixtape \'Late Nights Early Mornings\' via Audio Saviours on Youtube and his two debut songs \'Take Losses\' and \'Trxppish\' which both released on his Soundcloud. However, the songs that took off for him the quickest were some of his freestyles, such as \'Hoods Hottest\', filmed infront of the now-demolished Showcase Cinemas. RIP Deezy <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Meekz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jelly Roll',324660,6869329,'Chase Matthew','Jason Bradley DeFord (born December 4, 1984 in Antioch, TN), known professionally by his stage name Jelly Roll (sometimes written as JellyRoll), is an American rapper known for his collaborations with Lil Wyte, Struggle Jennings, Tech N9ne, Merkules, and Ryan Upchurch.\n\nJason DeFord grew up in Nashville, Tennessee, in the southside community of Antioch.\n\nJelly Roll\'s 2010 collaboration \"Pop Another Pill\" with Memphis rapper Lil Wyte reached over 6. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jelly+Roll\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gambi',90451,2302124,'Jazzy Bazz','Gambi est un rappeur français né le 12 janvier 1998 à Fontenay-sous-Bois, dans le Val-de-Marne. Wikipédia\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gambi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('TRAMPA BILLONE',1007,6988,'Ognvndo',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/TRAMPA+BILLONE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Buhodermia 夜',20722,985175,'Doble Porcion',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Buhodermia+%E5%A4%9C\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mañas Ru-Fino',10577,288383,'Métricas Frías',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ma%C3%B1as+Ru-Fino\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DeeJohend',507,2014,'Mañas Ru-Fino',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/DeeJohend\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Redveil',625348,19439170,'Mavi','Marcus Morton (born April 20, 2004), known professionally as redveil, previously as DEVI*N, is a 20-year-old hip-hop artist and producer based in Maryland. redveil\'s genres and styles include jazz rap, abstract hip-hop, and alternative hip-hop backed by soul and funk samples. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Redveil\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('N\'seven7',8740,88831,'100 Blaze','N’seven7 (NORD 77) est un groupe de rap français originaire de Vaires-sur-Marne dans le 77. Le groupe formé en 2018 est composé de 5 membres.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/N%27seven7\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Koba LaD',72257,3579444,'Ninho','Koba LaD, de son vrai nom Marcel Junior Loutarila, est un rappeur français né le 3 avril 2000, Koba LaD est originaire d\'Évry, en Essonne. D\'ascendance congolaise, il réside, avec sa mère et ses dix frères et sœurs, au quartier du Bois-Sauvage avant d\'emménager au quartier du Parc aux lièvres aux alentours de ses dix ans. Il commence à rapper à l\'âge de quinze ans et forme le groupe Seven Binks avec ses amis Kaflo et Shotas. Le groupe se dissout rapidement pour permettre à chacun de poursuivre une voie en solo. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Koba+LaD\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ninho',174483,12333842,'Gazo','Ninho, pseudonyme de William Nzobazola, est un rappeur, chanteur et auteur-compositeur français né le 2 avril 1996 à Longjumeau dans l\'Essonne.\n\nAvec plus de 1,2 million d\'albums écoulés, il est en 2020, le douzième rappeur à avoir vendu le plus de disques en France avec ses cinq projets (sans prise en compte des mixtapes gratuites) en moins de cinq ans d\'activité. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ninho\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Boef',70661,3633056,'Josylvio','Sofiane Boussaadia (Aubervilliers, 28 februari 1993), beter bekend als Boef is een Nederlandstalige rapper en vlogger met de Algerijns-Franse nationaliteit.[1]\n\nBinnen een jaar na zijn start in 2015 behoorde hij na Lil\' Kleine en Ronnie Flex tot de populairste rappers van Nederland.[2] Hij bracht een album uit en verschillende singles. Zijn vlog en rapvideo\'s werden vele miljoenen malen bekeken op het internet. In 2020 kreeg hij zijn eigen documentaire: Gewoon Boef. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Boef\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ashafar',40315,1227144,'Henkie T',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ashafar\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DrefQuila',77114,4051365,'Young Cister','Chilean rapper that with the use of Autotune and synthesisers blend their voice, using pre recorded reggaeton tracks, in what it\'s known as \"Latin Trap\". <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/DrefQuila\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lamatrix',9173,76818,'Hös Copperfield',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lamatrix\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Uzi',108402,11706994,'Morad','1) A Los Angeles Pop duo\n2) Japanese hip-hop artist\n3) Hard rock band from Chicago (who later moved to L.A.) in the 90\'s .. see Üzi.\n4) An \'80s no wave/post-punk band from USA.\n5) Lithuanian rap group in the 90\'s\n6) German-Polish horrorcore rapper\n7)  Punk band from Bogotá, Colombia \n8) A french hip hop artist\n9) A Turkish hip hop artist\n\n1)  Uzi was a duo that consisted of Gab3 and Mik3 aka Young Forever.\n\n2) Uzi (pronounced as \"Uji\") is a Japanese hip-hop artist. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Uzi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ZetaZeta',4167,75412,'Zof ziro',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ZetaZeta\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mañas Ru-Fino',10577,288383,'Métricas Frías',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ma%C3%B1as+Ru-Fino\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Los Nandez',2906,28865,'Asilo 38',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Los+Nandez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Young Dolph',501052,18575869,'Key Glock','Coming on the scene with stern club bangers and cold punch lines, Memphis-based rapper Young Dolph became a local hero with a series of mixtapes before breaking nationwide around 2014. Since then, he frequently landed in Billboard with albums like 2020\'s Top Five-charting Rich Slave and two Dum and Dummer releases with  Key Glock, as well as single collaborations with  Megan Thee Stallion,  O.T. Genasis, and others.\n\nBorn Adolph Thornton, Jr. in Chicago, Dolph debuted in 2008 with the mixtape  Paper Route Campaign. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Young+Dolph\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Key Glock',975153,40854068,'Young Dolph','Markeyvius LaShun Cathey (born August 3, 1997), known professionally as Key Glock, is an American rapper, songwriter, and record producer. The cousin of late Memphis rapper Young Dolph, Cathey signed with his record label, Paper Route Empire, to release his commercial mixtape, Glock Season (2017). His debut studio album, Yellow Tape (2020), peaked at number 14 on the Billboard 200 and received gold certification by the Recording Industry Association of America (RIAA). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Key+Glock\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Uzi Vert',2691670,420518117,'Playboi Carti','Symere Bysil Woods (born July 31, 1995, Philadelphia, USA), known professionally as Lil Uzi Vert, is an American rapper, singer, and songwriter. Characterized by their face tattoos, facial piercings, eccentric hairstyles, and androgynous fashion, their music is often defined by dark subject matters and imagery built on a melodic emo approach to trap.\n\nThey attracted mainstream attention following the release of their debut single \"Money Longer\" in 2016. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Uzi+Vert\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tyla Yaweh',369342,5813817,'iann dior','Tyler Jamal Brown (born May 31, 1995), known professionally as Tyla Yaweh, is an American rapper, singer and songwriter. He is currently signed to Epic Records and London Entertainment.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tyla+Yaweh\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Depp',3403,33057,'Métricas Frías',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Depp\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('RMR',90423,1178785,'SAINt JHN','RMR (pronounced \"rumor\") is an American rapper and singer. He first attained notoriety when his song \"Rascal\" went viral on YouTube in February 2020.\n\nRMR was signed to Warner Records and Cmnty Rcrds from 2020 to 2022. After his release from Warner, he started his own label, RMRHasIt, a division of AWAL Recordings America. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/RMR\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mañas Ru-Fino',10577,288383,'Métricas Frías',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ma%C3%B1as+Ru-Fino\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Westside Gunn',1041917,83663745,'Benny the Butcher','Alvin Lamar Worthy (born July 27, 1982), known professionally as Westside Gunn, is an American rapper. He is the paternal half-brother of fellow rapper Conway The Machine, with whom he forms the duo Hall N Nash, and the cousin of fellow Buffalo native rapper Benny the Butcher. In 2014, he founded the record label Griselda Records, as well as clothing brand Fashion Rebels.\n\nIn 2016, he released his first commercial album, Flygod. On March 3, 2017, Griselda Records signed a deal with Eminem\'s Shady Records <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Westside+Gunn\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Conway the Machine',398715,13502306,'Benny the Butcher','Demond Price (born February 16, 1982), better known by his stage name Conway the Machine, is an American rapper from Buffalo, New York. He is the brother of fellow rapper Westside Gunn and the cousin of Benny the Butcher. Price is signed to Westside Gunn\'s record label, Griselda Records, and has released his entire discography on the label. In 2017, Shady Records signed a distribution deal with Griselda for Westside Gunn and Conway\'s work, making the two the first rappers from Buffalo to achieve major label distribution. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Conway+the+Machine\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Benny the Butcher',536026,23221723,'Conway the Machine','Jeremie Pennick (born November 27, 1984), known professionally as Benny the Butcher, is an American rapper from Buffalo, New York, USA. He is part of the hip hop group Griselda with Westside Gunn and Conway The Machine, and is part of the collective Black Soprano Family. Benny The Butcher knew by the age of ten that he wanted to be involved with music. He self-released his mixtapes in the late 2000s as B.E.N.N.Y., including The Mayor\'s Back and Chains Bond. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Benny+the+Butcher\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('L7NNON',389885,9930093,'MC Cabelinho','Lennon Frassetti (a.k.a. L7NNON), was born in Realengo, Rio de Janeiro. He blew up in the scene in 2017, after releasing a few hobby-kind of songs. His second album, Hip Hop Rare, was released in 2020. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/L7NNON\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lefty SM',60583,1322525,'Santa Fe Klan','Juan Carlos Sauceda Vásquez (San Luis Río Colorado, Sonora; 22 de abril de 1992- Zapopan, Jalisco; 2 de septiembre de 2023), conocido como Lefty SM, fue un rapero y cantante mexicano. Su canción por mi México se considera un himno para los mexicanos residentes fuera del país <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lefty+SM\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gzuz',110805,7898732,'Bonez MC','Kristoffer Jonas Klauß, der deutsche Rapper Gzuz wurde als Mitglied der Hamburger Hip-Hop-Crew 187 Strassenbande bekannt. Gzuz, der eigentlich Jonas Klauß heißt und 1988 in Hamburg geboren wurde, tat sich 2006 mit 187-Kopf Bonez MC zusammen und veröffentlichte mit der Crew einige Download-Alben. Dann wurde er 2010 aber wegen räuberischen Diebstahls zu dreieinhalb Jahren Haft verurteilt. Die Crew machte währenddessen Stimmung für ihn, weshalb seine Karriere nach der Entlassung richtig startete: 2014 erschien High & hungrig <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gzuz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('AP Dhillon',126305,8139628,'Karan Aujla','Amritpal Singh Dhillon (b. [birthdate]January 10, 1993[/birthdate]), known as AP Dhillon, is an Indian singer, rapper, songwriter and record producer associated with Punjabi music who lives in Victoria, Canada. Five of his singles have peaked on the Official Charts Company UK Asian and Punjabi charts, while \"Majhail\" and \"Brown Munde\" have topped Billboard charts.\n\nDhillon started his career in 2019 with the single \"Fake\" with Shinda Kahlon. He also appeared in the music video of the track \"Faraar\" by Gurinder Gill and Shinda Kahlon <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/AP+Dhillon\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gurinder Gill',21373,646281,'Navaan Sandhu',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gurinder+Gill\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gminxr',7285,108891,'Tegi Pannu',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gminxr\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lianna',5014,62290,'Mabiland','From catchy pop tunes with a dash of rock-and-roll sparkle to introspective ballads about life\'s myriad paths, Lianna\'s music spurs listeners to reflect — when it\'s not insisting they clap along. The band\'s brand new self-release, From Here, features 13 original songs that highlight Lianna\'s soaring vocals, the guys\' ear-candy harmonies, kickin\' percussion, and guitar work turns as muscular as a summer storm, as gentle as the first breath of spring.\n\nLianna. Hook-heavy pop/rock from the heart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lianna\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gambeta',77,418,'Kaztro',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gambeta\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rich Vagos',38435,658485,'Faruz Feet',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rich+Vagos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dean Blunt',913189,68522948,'Babyfather','Roy Nnawuchi (8 February 1984, born in Hackney, East London), better known by his pseudonym Dean Blunt, is a British musician, singer-songwriter, record producer, and conceptual artist. Blunt is best known for both his solo work and his partnership-based creations with avant-garde groups Hype Williams (featuring himself and Inga Copeland) and Babyfather, a hip-hop project comprised of himself, DJ Escrow (alias of poet James Massiah) and Gassman D; he was also the co-founder of London rock band Graffiti Island. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dean+Blunt\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sauce Walka',166007,1661817,'IceWear Vezzo','One-half of the rap duo Sauce Twinz who performs alongside his partner Sancho Saucy. He has released mixtapes titled Sorry 4 the Sauce, Sorry 4 the Sauce 2 and In Sauce We Trust. He grew up in Houston with a mother who was an addict. Some of his biggest singles include \"The Kid That Did\" and \"Ring Around the Rosies.\" He has a brother named Dillon Clemons. His father was a professional wrestler. He made waves in the hip hop game after releasing a diss track of Drake. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sauce+Walka\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Métricas Frías',20754,807060,'Mañas Ru-Fino','Santiago Marín Villa (Envigado, 22 de julio de 1994 - Manizales, 26 de agosto de 2022) más conocido como Métricas Frías o Sadman fue un compositor y rapero colombiano. Fue uno de los artistas más influyentes del género del país.\n\nNació en Envigado. Desde su adolescencia se radicó en Medellín. Empezó a componer rap. Se inició en 2010 como freestyler y asistiendo a batallas del Freestyle local.​ En 2011, con Mañas Ru-Fino, formaría el grupo musical Doble Porción <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/M%C3%A9tricas+Fr%C3%ADas\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mañas Ru-Fino',10577,288383,'Métricas Frías',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ma%C3%B1as+Ru-Fino\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ninho',174483,12333842,'Gazo','Ninho, pseudonyme de William Nzobazola, est un rappeur, chanteur et auteur-compositeur français né le 2 avril 1996 à Longjumeau dans l\'Essonne.\n\nAvec plus de 1,2 million d\'albums écoulés, il est en 2020, le douzième rappeur à avoir vendu le plus de disques en France avec ses cinq projets (sans prise en compte des mixtapes gratuites) en moins de cinq ans d\'activité. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ninho\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bones',1057616,130859040,'surrenderdorothy','There are multiple artists that perform under the name \'Bones\'. \n\n1. Elmo Kennedy O\'Connor, an American rapper from Howell, Michigan.\n2. A death metal band from Antwerp, Belgium.\n3. A death metal band from Chicago. \n4. Michael Miller, a punk infused delta blues performance artist.\n5. An alias of Julien Skrobek, an experimental HNW artist from France.\n6. An experimental rock band from Huntington Beach, CA.\n\n1. Elmo Kennedy O\'Connor, known professionally as Bones, is an American rapper from Howell, Michigan. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bones\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Fivio Foreign',555622,12086713,'Bizzy Banks','Maxie Lee Ryles III (born. March 29, 1990), better known by his stage name Fivio Foreign, is a rapper from Brooklyn, New York who started getting popularity from his June 2019 single “Big Drip,” which was boosted by support from Juice WRLD among others.\n\nFivio was born around 1990. Around 2011, long before Fivio gained prominence in the drill scene, he used to rap under the name Lite Fivio. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Fivio+Foreign\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('NAV',1107793,58394127,'NAV & Metro Boomin','Navraj Singh Goraya was born on November 3, 1989, in Toronto, Ontario and was raised in the city\'s suburban Rexdale neighbourhood. He is of Punjabi descent; his parents are Sikhs originally from the northern state of Punjab in India. His mother was involved in computer manufacturing and his father operated a forklift. Goraya first became interested in music after his mother bought him a boombox in the third grade. His uncle, who was a popular singer in Punjab, also brought him to a studio. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/NAV\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gunna',1777718,176214335,'Lil Baby','Sergio Giavanni Kitchens (born June 14, 1993), known professionally as Gunna, is an American rapper, singer and songwriter. Best known for his collaborations with Young Thug and Lil Baby, he is signed to Thug\'s record label, YSL Records, as well as 300 Entertainment and Atlantic Records.[2] He released his debut studio album, Drip or Drown 2 on February 22, 2019 and followed it up with his second studio album Wunna on May 22, 2020, which debuted atop the Billboard 200.[3] <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gunna\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sheff G',384570,19282311,'Sleepy Hallow','Michael Williams, better known by his stage name Sheff G, is a drill rapper from Brooklyn, New York. He is known for his standout lyrical capabilities compared to the rest of the drill scene, mixing storytelling in with the genre’s signature hardcore style.\n\nSheff first broke out with his diss track “No Suburban,” directed at fellow Brooklyn rapper 22Gz, in May 2017. He later released his debut mixtape THE UNLUCCY LUCCY KID in September 2019, following up with his second mixtape, One and Only, in May 2020. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sheff+G\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jay Critch',211825,3413671,'Rich the Kid','Jason Cole Critchlow (born February 25, 1998), known professionally as Jay Critch, is an American rapper, singer and songwriter from Brooklyn, New York City. He signed with Rich the Kid\'s record label, Rich Forever Music in November 2016, and first received recognition for his collaborations with the rapper. He signed a joint venture with Interscope Records to release his debut solo mixtape Hood Favorite (2018), which entered the Billboard 200 along <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jay+Critch\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Eli Fross',62373,1992292,'Sleepy Hallow','New York,NY – Elijah Quamina, better known as Eli Fross, has bigger problems to worry about outside of being removed from Pop Smoke\'s “Top Shotta.” The 20-year-old New York rapper was reportedly arrested Thursday (July 15) after he was caught on camera shooting at a motorcyclist and his friend. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Eli+Fross\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Zola',118420,6388126,'Ninho','Aurélien N\'Zuzi Zola (born November 16, 1999 in Évry, Essonne), better known by the mononym Zola, is a French rapper of Congolese descent.  Cicatrices, his debut album was released in 2019. His song \"California Girls\" was featured in the soundtrack of the film Taxi 5. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Zola\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('AP Dhillon',126305,8139628,'Karan Aujla','Amritpal Singh Dhillon (b. [birthdate]January 10, 1993[/birthdate]), known as AP Dhillon, is an Indian singer, rapper, songwriter and record producer associated with Punjabi music who lives in Victoria, Canada. Five of his singles have peaked on the Official Charts Company UK Asian and Punjabi charts, while \"Majhail\" and \"Brown Munde\" have topped Billboard charts.\n\nDhillon started his career in 2019 with the single \"Fake\" with Shinda Kahlon. He also appeared in the music video of the track \"Faraar\" by Gurinder Gill and Shinda Kahlon <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/AP+Dhillon\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gurinder Gill',21373,646281,'Navaan Sandhu',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gurinder+Gill\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Money Musik',26637,186415,'PinkHeartz','Money Musik is a 21 year old producer from Brampton, Canada who is signed to NAV/XO. He produced almost every song on NAV\'s album “Bad Habits”. Before signing to NAV in 2019, he was well known in the Toronto underground music scene for working with artists such as Booggz, WhyG, Pressa, He has also produced songs for Lil Uzi Vert, Gunna, Quavo, Takeoff, Offset & Lil Gotit. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Money+Musik\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('PLK',137654,10879066,'Josman','PLK (born 1997 in Paris) is a French rapper and member of the rap group Panama Bende. He began writing songs at a young age. He released his first solo EP in 2015 followed by a second in 2016. His first album, Ténébreux was released in 2017. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/PLK\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Maes',106953,6477063,'Ninho','1.) Maes, de son vrai nom Walid Georgey, né le 10 janvier 1995 à Villepinte en Seine-Saint-Denis, est un rappeur français originaire de Sevran. \n\nMaes naît le 10 janvier 1995 à Villepinte en Seine-Saint-Denis. Il grandit à la cité des Beaudottes à Sevran avec ses deux parents, ses cinq frères et ses deux sœurs. Maes commence à rapper à l\'âge de 14 ans ; avec ses amis Radmo et SY, ils forment le groupe MSR. Après le lycée, il effectue un séjour de 18 mois à la maison d\'arrêt de Villepinte de début 2016 à fin 2017.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Maes\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tian vck',19420,291360,'ControlR',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tian+vck\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kkkevin',288,2037,'CØDA',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kkkevin\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('N9ZDA',47513,702772,'Stefanaras',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/N9ZDA\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lacrim',100348,3486701,'Niro','Karim Zenoud (born 19 April 1985), better known by his stage name  Lacrim, is a French rapper of Algerian descent. After collaborations with various rap artists, he released his album \"Faites entrer Lacrim\" on May 14, 2012 followed by a mixtape \"Toujours le même\" in Dec 17, 2012. The following two albums, \"Corleone\" in 2014 and \"Force et Honneur\" in 2017 both topped the French Albums Chart. He also released three successive mixtapes under the R.I.P.R.O series; two in 2015 and a third in 2017. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lacrim\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ninho',174483,12333842,'Gazo','Ninho, pseudonyme de William Nzobazola, est un rappeur, chanteur et auteur-compositeur français né le 2 avril 1996 à Longjumeau dans l\'Essonne.\n\nAvec plus de 1,2 million d\'albums écoulés, il est en 2020, le douzième rappeur à avoir vendu le plus de disques en France avec ses cinq projets (sans prise en compte des mixtapes gratuites) en moins de cinq ans d\'activité. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ninho\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Guè',71734,6655929,'Marracash','Cosimo Fini, better known as Guè (born in December 25 in 1980 in Milan), is one of the most influential and iconic Italian rappers, known as a founding member of Club Dogo and for his highly successful solo career. Previously known as Gué Pequeno, he has helped define the Italian rap scene, standing out for his raw style, entrepreneurial mindset, and his skills as a record producer. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gu%C3%A8\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mahmood',246324,10372764,'Angelina Mango','Alessandro Mahmoud (born 12 September 1992 in Milan), known by the stage name Mahmood, is an Italian singer-songwriter. His mother is Italian while his father is Egyptian. He won the 2019 Sanremo Music Festival on 9 February 2019 with the song \"Soldi\". He had earned a spot at the Sanremo Music Festival by winning the second night of the standalone Sanremo Giovani 2018 competition on 21 December 2018 with the song \"Gioventù bruciata\". He previously competed on the sixth series of the Italian reality television singing competition X Factor.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mahmood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Marracash',94763,9646118,'Guè','Fabio Rizzo (b. Nicosia, May 22, 1979), better known by his stage name Marracash, is an Italian rapper of Sicilian origin. He is also a member of the Milan-based rap group Dogo Gang. He launched his musical career at the \"Muretto\", a popular Milanese location frequented by Italian hip hop groups. His first album with Dogo Gang was released in 2004. Marracash released his self-titled debut solo album in 2008. To date, Marracash has released four albums, three of which were with Dogo Gang. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Marracash\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('almanegra',5969,58794,'Toser One',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/almanegra\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lefty SM',60583,1322525,'Santa Fe Klan','Juan Carlos Sauceda Vásquez (San Luis Río Colorado, Sonora; 22 de abril de 1992- Zapopan, Jalisco; 2 de septiembre de 2023), conocido como Lefty SM, fue un rapero y cantante mexicano. Su canción por mi México se considera un himno para los mexicanos residentes fuera del país <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lefty+SM\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Shiva',100105,7686535,'Sfera Ebbasta','1 - A heavy metal/progressive band. Though signed to the classic Heavy Metal label during the height of the NWOBHM, Shiva had little in common with many of their contemporaries, opting for a melodic style influenced a bit by progressive rock rather than the rough style of the era. Firedance was an interesting album, but a bit lost in time, and possibly because of this, they were unable to survive, breaking up in the summer of 1983 and then reuniting for one final show in 1986. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Shiva\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Eiffel 65',1206919,10477974,'Prezioso','Eiffel 65 is an Italian eurodance group, formed by producers/composers Jeffrey Jey (also vocals), Maurizio Lobina and Gabry Ponte. All three members are from the city of Turin (Italy). The name of the group came from a random word generator that produced the word \"Eiffel\". The \"65\" was added as a mistake: part of a phone number scribbled on a demo by accident.\n\nTheir greatest worldwide success came with their first single \"Blue (Da Ba Dee)\" from their 1999 album Europop. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Eiffel+65\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('1PLIKÉ140',37999,2275380,'Beendo Z',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/1PLIK%C3%89140\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tana',389969,13420081,'Autumn!','Steven Lewis (b. nov 14 2006) known professionally as tana is a rapper and recording artist from Columbus, Georgia. He became known after his music went viral on his YouTube account. antisocial featuring slump6s was his breakout hit and cemented him as one of the most talked about underground artists of 2021. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tana\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('KA$HDAMI',324760,14248840,'Autumn!','David Wallace III (born December 16, 2004), better known by his stage name KA$HDAMI, is an American rapper reigning from Las Vegas, Nevada. He moved to the DMV area when he was 7, which is where he currently resides.\n\nDuring an interview with Dirty Glove Bastard in March 2021, the DMV-based rapper explained the origin of his stage name:\n\nI was watching this movie The Omen and there was this white boy named Damian, and he was like the bad kid, and <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/KA$HDAMI\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Népal',77892,6231204,'Nekfeu','Népal, whose real name is Clement Di Fiore, was a French rapper and beatmaker born the 12th of October 1990 in the 14th arrondissement of Paris. He was also known by the names KLM and GrandMaster Splinter. Member of the collective 75th Session, he formed with Doums the duo 2Fingz. He was also close to the collective L\'Entourage. Népal attached great importance to anonymity, showing himself only masked with a hood or make-up.\n\nOn August 23, 2019 <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/N%C3%A9pal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jaura Phagwara',6369,53549,'Varinder Brar',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jaura+Phagwara\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Métricas Frías',20754,807060,'Mañas Ru-Fino','Santiago Marín Villa (Envigado, 22 de julio de 1994 - Manizales, 26 de agosto de 2022) más conocido como Métricas Frías o Sadman fue un compositor y rapero colombiano. Fue uno de los artistas más influyentes del género del país.\n\nNació en Envigado. Desde su adolescencia se radicó en Medellín. Empezó a componer rap. Se inició en 2010 como freestyler y asistiendo a batallas del Freestyle local.​ En 2011, con Mañas Ru-Fino, formaría el grupo musical Doble Porción <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/M%C3%A9tricas+Fr%C3%ADas\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mañas Ru-Fino',10577,288383,'Métricas Frías',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ma%C3%B1as+Ru-Fino\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Crudo Means Raw',29596,1290896,'granuja','Crudo Means Raw (nombre real: Fernando Bustamante) es un productor musical, rapero y cantante colombiano nacido en Medellín. Se ha destacado por su estilo versátil, que mezcla el hip hop clásico con sonidos latinos como el funk, el jazz, el bolero, la salsa y el reguetón. Su propuesta musical se caracteriza por la fusión de lo vintage con lo moderno, y por letras que reflejan vivencias personales, reflexiones sociales y una estética callejera y elegante al mismo tiempo. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Crudo+Means+Raw\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Logic',1712761,103587767,'Cordae','Sir Robert Bryson Hall II (born January 22, 1990), known by his stage name Logic, is an American rapper, producer, and author.  Raised in Gaithersburg, Maryland, Logic developed an interest in music as a teenager and ventured into a musical career in early 2009 releasing Logic: The Mixtape under the name \"Psychological\", and releasing a mixtape titled Young, Broke & Infamous in 2010. He signed with Visionary Music Group, before releasing three more mixtapes over three years. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Logic\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ziak',63970,6013000,'Kerchak','Ziak est un artiste rappeur français, originaire de l\'Essonne, qui a commencé à se faire connaître au début de l\'année 2020 grâce à divers morceaux clippés. En 2021, il rejoint le label Millenium, avec lequel il sort son premier projet et album intitulé Akimbo, le 12 novembre de la même année, qui finira disque d\'or le 12 décembre de la même année.\n\nC\'est grâce à l\'essor de la musique drill en France que Ziak a attiré l\'attention, grâce à son succès \"Raspoutine\", notamment. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ziak\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oscar Lee',4980,92246,'DRVGS',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oscar+Lee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Freeze Corleone',89510,8074698,'Osirus Jack','Issa Lorenzo Diakhaté (born 6 June 1992 in Les Lilas, Seine-Saint-Denis), better known as Freeze Corleone, is a French rapper, singer-songwriter and record producer. He is also the founder of the collective 667, and CFR (with Norsacce and Osirus Jack). He lives in Dakar, Senegal.[1][2][3] \n\nCorleone was born in Les Lilas in Seine-Saint-Denis to a Senegalese father and an Italian mother.[4] In an interview with Les Inrocks, he claims to have spent his early years in Pantin, before attending high school in Dakar, Senegal.[5] <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Freeze+Corleone\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alpha Wann',77366,6408552,'Népal','Alpha Omar Wann, dit Alpha Wann, né le 2 juillet 1989 dans le 14e arrondissement de Paris, est un rappeur (auteur-interprète) français. Il est membre de l\'ancien groupe 1995 et du collectif L\'Entourage.\n\nMembre fondateur de 1995, Alpha Wann est un pilier du groupe avec Nekfeu. Après s\'être lancé dans une carrière en solo, il sort trois EP successifs, la trilogie Alph Lauren. Le 21 septembre 2018, Wann publie son premier album, Une main lave l’autre (UMLA) qui sera certifié disque d\'or plus d\'un an après. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Alpha+Wann\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Zxmyr',18101,274315,'Toser One',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Zxmyr\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lefty SM',60583,1322525,'Santa Fe Klan','Juan Carlos Sauceda Vásquez (San Luis Río Colorado, Sonora; 22 de abril de 1992- Zapopan, Jalisco; 2 de septiembre de 2023), conocido como Lefty SM, fue un rapero y cantante mexicano. Su canción por mi México se considera un himno para los mexicanos residentes fuera del país <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lefty+SM\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jay Romero',4907,40428,'Neto Peña',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jay+Romero\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Durk',1068426,63277852,'Only The Family','Durk Derrick Banks (born October 19, 1992), better known as Lil Durk, is a rapper, singer, and songwriter from Chicago, Illinois. Durk is best known for his involvement in the drill wave that took the music world by storm in the 2010s. He is the founder of his own record label, Only the Family (OTF).\n\nDurk’s early career was, like many drill artists, plagued with legal issues and accusations of violence. These issues eventually led to his shows being canceled. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Durk\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dinos',86398,8277525,'Josman','Dinos, anciennement Dinos Punchlinović, né le 30 novembre 1993 à Douala, est un rappeur français originaire de La Courneuve, en Seine-Saint-Denis. Il est considéré par beaucoup comme l\'un des meilleurs lyricistes de la nouvelle génération du rap français. \n\nDinos naît le 30 novembre 1993 à Douala, au Cameroun, et arrive en France à l\'âge de 4 ans avec sa famille où ils s\'installent dans la cité des 4000 à La Courneuve, en Seine-Saint-Denis. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dinos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Marie Plassard',6729,100226,'Népal',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Marie+Plassard\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ninho',174483,12333842,'Gazo','Ninho, pseudonyme de William Nzobazola, est un rappeur, chanteur et auteur-compositeur français né le 2 avril 1996 à Longjumeau dans l\'Essonne.\n\nAvec plus de 1,2 million d\'albums écoulés, il est en 2020, le douzième rappeur à avoir vendu le plus de disques en France avec ses cinq projets (sans prise en compte des mixtapes gratuites) en moins de cinq ans d\'activité. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ninho\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Santino Le Saint',106450,1550721,'Always Never','Santino Le Saint is the vibrant, young model and artist setting himself apart in the South London music scene. Drawing on influences across a number of genres, such as RnB, soul, trap, rock and even heavy metal, Le Saint is quickly gaining recognition for his amalgam of unique sounds that challenge any musical preconceptions. While these in uences dating back to childhood are undoubtedly present, each of Le Saint’s songs feels entirely new as his soulful vocals overlay a hazy fusion of synths and well placed guitar solos. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Santino+Le+Saint\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rucorap',75,398,'Hip Hop Peruano Mas Na',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rucorap\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Austin Fox 狐',1181,8534,'Adé Hakim',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Austin+Fox+%E7%8B%90\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Codewalkers',91,281,'Melllo',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Codewalkers\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rucorap',75,398,'Hip Hop Peruano Mas Na',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rucorap\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sarafa',523,6806,'MD Beddah',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sarafa\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('10cellphones',32366,350932,'BoofBoiIcy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/10cellphones\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Louie Ray',25679,243958,'Rio Da Yung OG','Orraccious Quainte Tucker-Brown, professionaly known as Louie Ray, is a rapper from Flint, Michigan who has established himself as a respected figure in the city’s rap scene. He and fellow Flint rapper Rio Da Yung OG are half-brothers. His appearance on Lil Yachty’s Michigan Boy Boat album provided a larger platform for him to showcase his musical talent. Louie Ray is also known for frequently collaborating with rapper YN Jay. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Louie+Ray\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Omg Oumy Gueye',278,1563,'Viviane Chidid',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Omg+Oumy+Gueye\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('St1m',58187,1149298,'ST','ST1M is a German/Russian rapper and the former WiStation member. He is best known for the songs like \"I am Rap\", \"Take A Look At My Eyes\", \"Der Krieg\", and many others. With his former group WiStation, ST1M traveled all over Switzerland, Germany and Austria. He made a great influence in modern hip hop culture.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/St1m\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nicko',10140,73181,'Nikos Ganos','This is the incorrect tag for Nikos Ganos.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nΝίκος Γκάνος (Nikos Ganos) or simply Nicko, is a new pop  gay-idol. Of Greek origin, was born in Athens where he is today.\n\nIn 2004 he was a participant in the talent show Super Idol, which was the first Greek edition of the British television hit Pop Idol. Where he came third.\nHe has worked in the past with Καίτη Γαρμπή and Γιώργος Μαζωνάκης. Then he produced his super hit \'Poso Akoma\' with a sound perfectly modern for what Greeks usually listen to <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nicko\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Wes',166871,1818184,'Skye Riley','Wes Madiko first saw the light of day under the baobab tree in Moutaba, Cameroon which lies some hundred miles away from the city of Douala. From the tender age of two, his grandfather taught him about healing music and how to play the kalimba instrument. The pair soon became inseparable. His grandfather taught him his love of Bantu history and the wisdom of the elephant of animist bantou philosophy. This was responsible for an important part of his <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Wes\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kikky Badass',233,2013,'Voltz JT',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kikky+Badass\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('MIKS',388,2450,'Misho',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/MIKS\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Optic Bloom',411,1648,'Qhairo',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Optic+Bloom\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('The Lazy Jesus',10350,31183,'kraymira',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/The+Lazy+Jesus\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dozie',1862,6879,'Trinidadian Deep','Dozie is a hip-hop/afro-pop artist from the west coast of Canada.\n\nInspired by artists from around the world like Burna Boy, J. Cole, Davido, Dave and many more. Starting his music career at the age of 15 with talent show covers, Dozie has grown and developed his own contemporary style that breaks away from the traditional hip hop and afro pop sounds in todays music. Dozie is also talented in sound-engineering, producing and directing his own music videos, constantly pushing his creative abilities. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dozie\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tori Fixx',1493,12170,'Anye Elite','Tori is one of those rare artists who push the envelope. With darkly political and sexually driven lyrics, he brings you hit after hit. His main audience is in the underground gay hip hop/r&b scene. Making statements and producing song after song for people in the industry, Tori continues to amaze new fans and keep seasoned fans happy. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tori+Fixx\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rucorap',75,398,'Hip Hop Peruano Mas Na',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rucorap\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Козачок',764,7943,'Джон Дір',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/%D0%9A%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%BE%D0%BA\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Speller',94,512,'Lisa Howard, Celia Keenan-Bolger, Derrick Baskin','from http://www.jeremywade.de/speller/\n\nSpeller is made up mostly of Jeremy Wade and Brendan Dougherty. Members have been and may still include Loren Dempster, Miguel Gutierrez, Keith O\'Brien, Aaron Meicht, Fred Bigot and Jeremy Woodruff.\n\nSpeller is currently touring South America (oct \'07), after having recently performed in Germany, France, Holland and NYC.\n\nThe group is in the process of recording its first album, alongside their ongoing collaboration as Choreagrapher (Wade) and Composer (Dougherty).  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Speller\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Arnav',162,826,'Garvit - Priyansh',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Arnav\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bruce Banna',382,3194,'Shady Nate',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bruce+Banna\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Шеff',4769,52440,'Мастер Шеff','Vlad Valov (Влад Валов), alson known as ШЕFF, Мастер ШЕFF is a Russian MC, producer, promoter. He is a member of the legendary Russian Hip-Hop pioneers Bad Balance. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/%D0%A8%D0%B5ff\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Мойша Эскобар',64,168,'Словетский & Dj Nik One',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/%D0%9C%D0%BE%D0%B9%D1%88%D0%B0+%D0%AD%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%80\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ye\' Lay',1143,13603,'Hlwan Paing',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ye%27+Lay\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oualid',22471,271825,'Cravata',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oualid\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ozel',3012,44534,'Noroz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ozel\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Scoot Da Kidd',1337,6675,'42 Twinz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Scoot+Da+Kidd\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Atila',3823,93045,'Gòtic','The Spanish band ATILA was formed in \'73 by Eduardo Biebla (guitar), Joan Punyet (drums) and Paco Ortega (keyboards), soon several personnel changes followed. This legendary and highly acclaimed progrock band made three LP\'s: \"The Beginning Of The End\" (\'75), \"Intencion\" (\'76) and \"Reviure\" (\'77). At the end of \'78 the band dissolves but in \'99 they reformed with Joan Punyet (drums), Benet Nogue (keyboards), Ignasi Bosch (guitar), Pere Martinez (bass) and Joan Cardoner (guitar). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Atila\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nazar',48192,886181,'DJ Haram','There are two artists named Nazar:\n\n1) Nazar is a 26-year-old Angolan producer who grew up in Belgium until his late teens, when he returned after the civil war and is now based in Manchester. \n\nHe is signed to Kode9\'s Hyperdub records and released his debut solo album Guerilla in March 2020.\n\n2) Nazar (civil name; Ardalan Afshar) was born on the 20th september of 1984 in Therean, Iran.  He\'s a austrian rapper and musicvideo producer currently living in Vienna.\n\nHe released his first studio album \"Kinder des Himmels\" in july 2008. \n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nazar\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Joeelg',195,1608,'Loxell',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Joeelg\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('1458',46,586,'Lawrii',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/1458\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Pridenyyy',913,11264,'DOKKEYTINO',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Pridenyyy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Maye Star',414,2035,'Nate Nics',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Maye+Star\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Malice',75,323,'khmer1jivit',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Malice\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kongsted',39606,273713,'Vild $mith',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kongsted\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Silentó',270464,1028625,'will.i.am','Richard Lamar Hawk (born January 22, 1998), better known by his stage name Silentó, is an American rapper and felon. He is best known for his debut single \"Watch Me (Whip/Nae Nae)\", which reached number 3 on the Billboard Hot 100.\n\nSilentó\'s debut single \"Watch Me (Whip/Nae Nae)\", made with Bolo Da Producer, was released on his YouTube channel on June 25, 2015. Over the course of one week, it gained over 2.5 million views. In April 2015, Silentó was signed to Capitol Records <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Silent%C3%B3\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mad Dogg',166,352,'casper loc',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mad+Dogg\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lady J',728,3428,'Rich Ken','Lady J is a rapper from Detroit, Michigan who is signed to Drop Muzik.\n\nHer debut mixtape \"The People\'s Choice\" was released in 2009.  The mixtape featured mainstream rap artists such as Gucci Mane, Plies & Trey Songz as well as Detroit rap artists such as Chedda Boy Malik, Big Herk & Nefu Da Boss of The ABF.\n\nThe People\'s Choice was relased on Datpiff.com for a free download and released an offical video for her single \"Rain Money\". <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lady+J\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Pungwe Sessions',42,668,'Simba Tagz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Pungwe+Sessions\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rymez',11259,60220,'The James Arthur Band',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rymez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Austin Fox 狐',1181,8534,'Adé Hakim',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Austin+Fox+%E7%8B%90\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dope Boys Bapele',142,1244,'Y Celeb',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dope+Boys+Bapele\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Micall Parknsun',10671,86289,'Asaviour','Micall Parknsun is a British rapper/producer. He has been quietly involved in the UK hip-hop scene for a while, yet he only has a small number of releases to his name.\n\nHe was first noticed on the scene as a duo with fellow rapper R.A.M, under the name \"2Halves\", with tracks such as \"Freedom Fighters\". The duo then later split up & with Micall focusing on a solo career, released the highly acclaimed 12\" vinyl \"Tha Shit/Da Struggle\", 2004 which featured rapper Jehst. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Micall+Parknsun\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('munch lauren',10048,57860,'Cerop',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/munch+lauren\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('TBF',18931,746422,'Dječaci','There are at least two bands named TBF:\n\n1) TBF (The Beat Fleet) is a Croatian hip/hop band from Split,Croatia. The band was founded in 1990. Members of the band are: Mladen Badovinac (vocal, samples), Luka Barbić (vocals, keyboards, samples), Aleksandar Antić (vocals, lyrics, samples, harmonica), Ognjen Pavlović (bass guitar), Nikša Mandalinić, (electric guitar), Janko Novoselić (drums).\n\nThey are heavily influenced by reggae, the British trip-hop scene, electronic and experimental music. They have 6 albums. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/TBF\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Eedris Abdulkareem',4262,20476,'Tony Tetuila','Eedris Turayo Abdulkareem Ajenifuja was born in Kano, northern Nigeria, to Yoruba parents from south-western Nigeria.  His mother left the family home in Lagos while heavily pregnant due to her husband taking another wife.\n\nEedris discovered rap music while he was a student at the Army Day Secondary school and has been writing songs ever since.  He came to public attention as part of The Remedies, together with Tony Tetuila and Eddy Montana.  The group broke up acrimoniously, with the members taking up solo careers. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Eedris+Abdulkareem\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Виталий Артист',910,8482,'Shuma','Виталий Артист уже давно известен как успешный композитор, работающий в самых разных жанрах: от фолка до трип-хопа. Среди его работ музыкальные произведения для кинофильмов, телесериалов, театральных постановок, телепроектов, мультфильмов и рекламы. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/%D0%92%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B9+%D0%90%D1%80%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Craic Boi Mental',20732,256773,'Arik Ancelin','Irish hip-hop artist/producer, based in Cork. Pioneer of the $quick movement. One half of Whip Mental (with Whip Girl). AKA Oscar Benso, Yung Gowl, Dudewithswag and King Flora.\n\n\"rapper, producer and online agent provocateur from Cork City, with a knack for lo-fi production, and an innate ear for an inescapable hook\" - Mike McGrath Bryan, Nialler9\n\n\"There’s something incredibly punk about Craic Boi Mental\" - Eric Davidson, District Magazine\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Craic+Boi+Mental\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rich the Factor',5666,74956,'J-Diggs And Rich The Factor','The self proclaimed \"ghetto Russel Simmons\", Rich The Factor is a Kansas City legend. Putting out mixtapes and Cd\'s for well over a decade now he\'s arguably the most popular in the KC rap scene(among locals at least, while tech n9ne gains more national attention). He reps the dime block which is the Northside of KCMO. The C.E.O of Major Factor Records (M.F.R.) and has also done a lot of collabos with Bay Area rap vets like Mac Dre, Messy Marv, and more. Don\'t listen to him unless you\'re ready for a triple shot of thick game!!!\n\n\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rich+the+Factor\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('TOYOTOMI HIDEYOSHI',716,13861,'Max Black',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/TOYOTOMI+HIDEYOSHI\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bad Balance',37661,784787,'Detsl aka Le Truk','Bad Balance is a Russian rap group considered to be one of the first rap acts in USSR. The group maintained a devoted underground following during 1990\'s.\nBad Balance was formed as a breakdance crew in 1980\'s in Saint-Petersburg by students from Donetsk named Vlad Valov (SheFF) and Sergey Krutikov (Михей). Group switched to rapping and recorded the debut album \"Vishe Zakona\" in 1989 for Gala Records.\n\nThe band toured France and US. Classic Bad Balance albums \"Naletchiki Bad B. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bad+Balance\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('KC Ortiz',1016,4548,'Shea Diamond',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/KC+Ortiz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Subliminal',21697,319498,'Karl Runau','If you are looking for the Israeli rap artist סאבלימינל  (real name Kobi Shimoni), your music is incorrectly tagged. You will find him here: סאבלימינל \n\nThere are at least ten artists known as Subliminal.\n\n1) Subliminal  is a german power electronics project by Albert Fisch. The typical sound of his work is one of the characteristic features of Haus Arafna\'s infamous  \'Galakthorrö\' label on which he released the albums \'Gracebudd\' (2000) and \'Coping\'(2006). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Subliminal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('The Shadow',4505,28847,'Suspense','                        The Shadow is an American Grunge Rock band who first formed in 1993 as A.O.S. in Beaumont CA. The  original members  consisted of school mates, James \"Shadow\" Quinn-Mangum- Bass/Vocalist, Ryan Bartholomew- Guitar and Jake Downing- Drums. They continued writing  original songs and playing the club circuit as A.O.S. and opening for such acts as The Skelitones up until 2003. In 2003 Jake Downing left the band and it was renamed The Shadow. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/The+Shadow\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oriole',1995,201759,'Dudu Pukwana, Bob Stuckey, Phil Lee, John Marshall, Terry Smith, Martin Hart','A sensory banquet of soaring melodies, colourful South American folklore, lively dances and emotional ballads of longing. Music that creates a rich, emotionally disquieting world that is at once familiar and dreamlike. A world of freedom, of movement, of dusty roads and traveling musicians in shaded market squares whose journey will never end. These are songs of magical realism mingling elements of fantasy, myth, desire and wanderlust in renderings that blur traditional distinctions between what is serious or trivial, melancholic or joyous. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oriole\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jaya',36232,311760,'Regine Velasquez','Jaya refers to three recording artists:\n\n1.) Jaya is known in the Philippines as the Queen of Soul or Soul Diva (Soul Goddess). Born Maria Luisa Ramsey on March 21, 1969 in Manila, Philippines, the name Jaya came from an American producer when he signed her to a record deal in the U.S. in 1989. Her mother is comedienne-singer (Queen of Comedy and Queen of Rock&Roll) Elizabeth Ramsey, who is of Afro-Jamaican. She has three siblings: Ike, Anna, and Susan. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jaya\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Libretto',5367,23513,'Mr. Complex','There are multiple artists named Libretto:\n\n1)One of the most important developments in Portland music has been the local and national success of Libretto and Lifesavas. They\'re longtime Portlanders steady grindin\' with their crew, Misfit Massive, since the mid-\'90s. But their 2003 release, Spirit in Stone (Quannum), put them in the worldwide underground, and exposed them to parts of the city that might not have known their music otherwise (aka much of white Portland). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Libretto\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('BusCrates',9687,45792,'Jeriko Jackson',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/BusCrates\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ricca Razor Sharp',213,1205,'Planit','Ricca Razor Sharp is a thinking man’s MC, delivering rhymes that are honest and insightful, yet entertaining, clever and witty. His debut album, ’12 Steps to a Deffer You’, available now on Neferiu Records, has been embraced by the press, college radio, and both mainstream and underground hip-hop audiences. With a host of different styles, Ricca keeps the listener enthralled, whether rhyming on disc, or commanding the stage.\n\nRicca grasp of the MC position results from 7 years of performances <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ricca+Razor+Sharp\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Wyzaker',49,529,'Ricca Razor Sharp',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Wyzaker\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Omg Oumy Gueye',278,1563,'Viviane Chidid',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Omg+Oumy+Gueye\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Elemental',43300,913261,'Detour','There are multiple artists using the name Elemental:\n1) A Croatian hip-hop band, founded in 1998.\n2) A hip-hop MC from Brighton\n3) A British dubstep producer.\n4) D&B/autonomic producer from Bristol / London, Britain (UK). Signed to Runtime Records.\n5) Psybient/psychill producer from Romania\n6. A groove metal band from Quito, Ecuador.\n7. A black metal band from Finland.\n\n1)\nElemental is a Croatian hip-hop band, founded in 1998. It consisted of three MCs. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Elemental\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Quessswho',2880,20778,'Mpes',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Quessswho\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Omg Oumy Gueye',278,1563,'Viviane Chidid',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Omg+Oumy+Gueye\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Чакір',403,1566,'Valentine Lawrence',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/%D0%A7%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%96%D1%80\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('$ean Wire',1184,9633,'Luke Bar$',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/$ean+Wire\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('blake rules',19939,155339,'Bohdi',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/blake+rules\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Levi Parker',625,4310,'Corey Wise',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Levi+Parker\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kidday',1287,8980,'Thank Jordan',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kidday\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Brighty',489,2588,'Chris Bullen',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Brighty\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('B.D. Foxmoor',1092,19343,'Active Member','please B.D. Foxmoor and B.D.Foxmoor its the same artist (last fm and spotify what the fuck happens)...sorry\nB.D. Foxmoor (born Michalis Mytakidis; Greek: Μιχάλης Μυτακίδης, on August 21, 1967) is a Greek rapper and hip hop producer. In 1992 he founded Active Member and released the first Greek hip hop album, Diamartyria (Protest), in 1993. In 1995 when Active Member signed to a major label, Warner, and released To megalo kolpo, B.D. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/B.D.+Foxmoor\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('D Knowledge',92,396,'Samantha Jayne','Derrick I. M. Gilbert (a.k.a. D-Knowledge) is a Ph.D. graduate in Sociology from UCLA. His essays have appeared in the National Black Law Journal, Educational Policy, Encyclopedia of African American Education, Tough Love, and a variety of other publications.\n\nHe has appeared in such films as Higher Learning and Panther, as well as on shows like the NAACP Image Awards, the Arsenio Hall Show, and the Apollo Comedy Hour. Derrick has performed his poetry with such artsits as Me’Shell Ndege’Ocello <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/D+Knowledge\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('BFD',893,7827,'About Face','Brothers For Decades. Hardcore band from Niagara Falls, Ontario. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/BFD\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dave B.',87222,720831,'femdot.','Dave B. is a rapper and producer from Seattle, WA.. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dave+B.\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('D-Weez',70,465,'H2MG AR',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/D-Weez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('MMP Family',56,454,'A.T.I',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/MMP+Family\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('TNO',1209,6541,'The Flexican',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/TNO\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Шеff',4769,52440,'Мастер Шеff','Vlad Valov (Влад Валов), alson known as ШЕFF, Мастер ШЕFF is a Russian MC, producer, promoter. He is a member of the legendary Russian Hip-Hop pioneers Bad Balance. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/%D0%A8%D0%B5ff\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sirius',41307,422709,'Vargrav','1) Symphonic Black Metal from Portugal.  2) 80\'s German symphonic prog band.\n\n2) 	 Japanese Female Metal Band, Formed in:2022 - Genre:Power Metal\nCurrent label: Zillion Mode Production\nYears active: 2022 (as Midnight Secret), 2022-present\nVocals Miwa\nGuitar あにゃ\nGuitar 菫\nBass みさ\nDrums Ami\n(As of January 2026)\n\n3) Sirius is a French sound engineer, producer, director and rapper.\n\n4) Very successful dance project in 1994 from together musician of legendary Еx \"Technotronic\" performer \"MC Eric\" and UK establish dance producer. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sirius\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nazar',48192,886181,'DJ Haram','There are two artists named Nazar:\n\n1) Nazar is a 26-year-old Angolan producer who grew up in Belgium until his late teens, when he returned after the civil war and is now based in Manchester. \n\nHe is signed to Kode9\'s Hyperdub records and released his debut solo album Guerilla in March 2020.\n\n2) Nazar (civil name; Ardalan Afshar) was born on the 20th september of 1984 in Therean, Iran.  He\'s a austrian rapper and musicvideo producer currently living in Vienna.\n\nHe released his first studio album \"Kinder des Himmels\" in july 2008. \n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nazar\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Cha\'keeta B',254,552,'Jenna Marbles',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Cha%27keeta+B\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Eedris Abdulkareem',4262,20476,'Tony Tetuila','Eedris Turayo Abdulkareem Ajenifuja was born in Kano, northern Nigeria, to Yoruba parents from south-western Nigeria.  His mother left the family home in Lagos while heavily pregnant due to her husband taking another wife.\n\nEedris discovered rap music while he was a student at the Army Day Secondary school and has been writing songs ever since.  He came to public attention as part of The Remedies, together with Tony Tetuila and Eddy Montana.  The group broke up acrimoniously, with the members taking up solo careers. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Eedris+Abdulkareem\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('RaYkA',547,5673,'Capaz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/RaYkA\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Fygeludi',297,5675,'Webba',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Fygeludi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C-Rayz Walz',66376,658553,'Hangar 18','C-Rayz Walz is a rapper from New York. He is a former member of New York hip hop alliance Stronghold along with L.I.F.E. Long. He left the underground record label Definitive Jux in June 2006 and is rumored to be on Uncle Howie record co. As well as releasing four LPs and one EP, he has appeared on many other rappers\' records, including Aesop Rock and Immortal Technique, and has done work with such artists as Percee P. Immortal Technique is reputed <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C-Rayz+Walz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ice One',2197,17628,'Cor Veleno','Ice One aka Sebi is one of the top artistic forces in the Italian Hip Hop scene, renowned for his MCing, DJing, and production work. Raised in Rome, Ice One started in the early 1980s DJing for different venues in his city. Around that time he became involved in graf & break dancing performing with the Special Breakin\' Crew. \n\nIce One joined forces with a variety of groups, including 24-7 Crew, MC Shark\'s Raptional Scream, and the Mad DJ\'s Band. In the late 1980s, he performed with Ice T and Afrika Bambataa during their Italian tours.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ice+One\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('AN TY',502,4810,'Mantrablu','Producer, DJ, and musician AN TY debuted in 2016 with his first single \"Chroma\". The Virginia native has set out on a mission to expand the horizons of listeners trapped in today\'s genre paradigm by blending influences from the past and present into a style of his own. AN TY has turned his passion and influences into a style he likens to sitting on a Comet hurdling through the galaxy, absorbing all the vibes of the universe. \n\nIn 2018, AN TY looks to build on the momentum of his debut project, Gravity. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/AN+TY\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Шеff',4769,52440,'Мастер Шеff','Vlad Valov (Влад Валов), alson known as ШЕFF, Мастер ШЕFF is a Russian MC, producer, promoter. He is a member of the legendary Russian Hip-Hop pioneers Bad Balance. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/%D0%A8%D0%B5ff\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Буян',68,368,'Mazie Smirdīgie Kociņi',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/%D0%91%D1%83%D1%8F%D0%BD\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Такер',3785,55917,'StaFFорд63',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/%D0%A2%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B5%D1%80\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('BAD ROYALE',20186,96399,'Party Thieves',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/BAD+ROYALE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bruce Banna',382,3194,'Shady Nate',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bruce+Banna\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tiggo',45,83,'VNS Vinyll',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tiggo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('G-rdz',582,4308,'Jayx',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/G-rdz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bigg Nugg',352,1846,'John Ashfield','Based out of Ohio and representing the gay “Bear” community, Bigg Nugg mixes it up with his thumping beats and spit fire lyrics on all types of things ranging from personal issues to government policies. A musician since his teenage years, the metamorphosis and transition into the artist known as Bigg Nugg was a natural evolution of talent. His lyrics are filled with reflection, passion, and a yearning for the balance of power in a homophobic society. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bigg+Nugg\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Smoke DZA',397971,3500160,'Curren$y','\nSean Pompey (Born in Harlem, New York NY, United States), better known by his stage name Smoke DZA, is an American rapper who first gained recognition in 2009 with the release of his first mixtape Substance Abuse. He followed it with the release of his 2010 mixtape George Kush Da Button, his release in 2011, Rolling Stoned, and his 2012 release, Rugby Thompson (prod. Harry Fraud). Smoke DZA often references movies and marijuana with a slow, laidback style of rap. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Smoke+DZA\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dope Boys Bapele',142,1244,'Y Celeb',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dope+Boys+Bapele\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mr. Turner',114,543,'Petko Turner',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mr.+Turner\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('B.Glenn',7,36,'Last of the Horsemen',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/B.Glenn\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('AN TY',502,4810,'Mantrablu','Producer, DJ, and musician AN TY debuted in 2016 with his first single \"Chroma\". The Virginia native has set out on a mission to expand the horizons of listeners trapped in today\'s genre paradigm by blending influences from the past and present into a style of his own. AN TY has turned his passion and influences into a style he likens to sitting on a Comet hurdling through the galaxy, absorbing all the vibes of the universe. \n\nIn 2018, AN TY looks to build on the momentum of his debut project, Gravity. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/AN+TY\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Isaac DaBom',1557,10304,'Amit Ulman',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Isaac+DaBom\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Malice',75,323,'khmer1jivit',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Malice\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Uknwn',7952,61723,'Sam Wise',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Uknwn\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jay Cinema',2189,36822,'Adé Hakim',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jay+Cinema\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Blackface',3509,15676,'Scrill','Blackface is a rapper from the Brightmoor neighborhood located in Detroit, MI. He is a member of the super group Rock Bottom, with a solo album on the way. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Blackface\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Malice',75,323,'khmer1jivit',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Malice\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dosh',142343,2002335,'The Books','Dosh grew up in the Twin Cities, Minneapolis, Minnesota. At a young age he also took piano lessons and then discovered FM radio in the early \'80s. Dosh began drumming at age 15. By the time he left home for Simon\'s Rock College at age 16, he had decided music would likely be his profession, however, he subsequently got a degree in creative writing.\n\nThroughout the \'90s, he played with a number of bands on the East Coast. When he moved back to Minneapolis in 1997, he started his own band, as he had begun to compose his own music. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dosh\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lucky Paul',7544,34889,'Eliphino',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lucky+Paul\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('TSYP',947,5197,'Хиро',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/TSYP\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Craic Boi Mental',20732,256773,'Arik Ancelin','Irish hip-hop artist/producer, based in Cork. Pioneer of the $quick movement. One half of Whip Mental (with Whip Girl). AKA Oscar Benso, Yung Gowl, Dudewithswag and King Flora.\n\n\"rapper, producer and online agent provocateur from Cork City, with a knack for lo-fi production, and an innate ear for an inescapable hook\" - Mike McGrath Bryan, Nialler9\n\n\"There’s something incredibly punk about Craic Boi Mental\" - Eric Davidson, District Magazine\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Craic+Boi+Mental\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yung Cat',1466,10175,'FIGG NEWTON',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yung+Cat\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Сiроп',814,4728,'Ресторатор',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/%D0%A1i%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BF\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Elemental',43300,913261,'Detour','There are multiple artists using the name Elemental:\n1) A Croatian hip-hop band, founded in 1998.\n2) A hip-hop MC from Brighton\n3) A British dubstep producer.\n4) D&B/autonomic producer from Bristol / London, Britain (UK). Signed to Runtime Records.\n5) Psybient/psychill producer from Romania\n6. A groove metal band from Quito, Ecuador.\n7. A black metal band from Finland.\n\n1)\nElemental is a Croatian hip-hop band, founded in 1998. It consisted of three MCs. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Elemental\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Omg Oumy Gueye',278,1563,'Viviane Chidid',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Omg+Oumy+Gueye\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Isaiah Toothtaker',3178,78557,'CadaLAck Ron','Isaiah Toothtaker is a Two-time felon and polymathic artist from Tucson Arizona. He’s released over 9 albums, edited and directed multiple videos, regularly produces paintings in several mediums and recently had a book of emoji designs published. Approximately 13 years ago he learned his primary profession of tattooing, under the tutelage of then Tucson chapter president of the Hell’s Angels. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Isaiah+Toothtaker\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Depakote',22239,249472,'Aeed','All music here http://depakotebeats.bandcamp.com/\nhttp://twitter.com/depakote\nPersonal page\nhttp://www.facebook.com/depakotemusic#!/erik.d.lopez\nFan Page\nhttp://www.facebook.com/depakotemusic\n\nBy growing up during The “Golden age” of Hip-Hop, Depakote whose birth name is Erik Lopez was heavily influenced by one of the greatest eras in Hip-Hop History. At a young age, Depakote was intrigued by the sound and impact that the Hip-Hop culture had on society. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Depakote\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Malice',75,323,'khmer1jivit',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Malice\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('P-Jae',27,263,'POLO JAFFA',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/P-Jae\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Groovy Jo',114,615,'Asum Garvey',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Groovy+Jo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Vigos',50,279,'Tankeone',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Vigos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Malice',75,323,'khmer1jivit',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Malice\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('B.Glenn',7,36,'Last of the Horsemen',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/B.Glenn\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ALTERVERS',49,326,'Bishal Karim',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ALTERVERS\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Shahrukh Masnad',13,78,'Jon Kabir',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Shahrukh+Masnad\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dyyo',601,4668,'Nostrum Grocers',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dyyo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Hudson Mohawke',564566,8405317,'Rustie','Hudson Mohawke, (b. Ross Birchard), also known as Hud Mo, is an Electronic music producer/DJ from Glasgow, Scotland, affiliated with the LuckyMe collective of musicians and artists. He is signed to Warp Records and G.O.O.D. Music. Hudson released his debut album Butter in October 2009.\n\nAt the age of 15, Birchard, under the name DJ Itchy, was the youngest ever UK DMC finalist. His earliest gigs as a club DJ were with Glasgow Uni\'s Subcity Radio where <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Hudson+Mohawke\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Csaba',214,822,'Maddy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Csaba\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('D-Weez',70,465,'H2MG AR',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/D-Weez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Scoot Da Kidd',1337,6675,'42 Twinz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Scoot+Da+Kidd\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Chey Dolla',223,1280,'T-Nutty',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Chey+Dolla\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Marrice Anthony',407,2136,'logan.jpg',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Marrice+Anthony\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oriole',1995,201759,'Dudu Pukwana, Bob Stuckey, Phil Lee, John Marshall, Terry Smith, Martin Hart','A sensory banquet of soaring melodies, colourful South American folklore, lively dances and emotional ballads of longing. Music that creates a rich, emotionally disquieting world that is at once familiar and dreamlike. A world of freedom, of movement, of dusty roads and traveling musicians in shaded market squares whose journey will never end. These are songs of magical realism mingling elements of fantasy, myth, desire and wanderlust in renderings that blur traditional distinctions between what is serious or trivial, melancholic or joyous. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oriole\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Steeezy',930,6955,'Boshy B',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Steeezy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('King Macarella',530,3229,'ABBBOSE',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/King+Macarella\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Milly',100508,774790,'Narrow Head','Milly was a queer alternative rock/shoegaze band from Los Angeles, California. Vocalist-guitarist Brendan Dryer is originally from Connecticut and began his career there, initially starting out as a solo bedroom pop musician. Upon meeting bassist Yarden Erez at an Alex G show, the pair moved to Los Angeles and expanded Milly into a full group. They have cited Sebadoh and the Foo Fighters as musical influences. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Milly\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Uknwn',7952,61723,'Sam Wise',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Uknwn\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ice One',2197,17628,'Cor Veleno','Ice One aka Sebi is one of the top artistic forces in the Italian Hip Hop scene, renowned for his MCing, DJing, and production work. Raised in Rome, Ice One started in the early 1980s DJing for different venues in his city. Around that time he became involved in graf & break dancing performing with the Special Breakin\' Crew. \n\nIce One joined forces with a variety of groups, including 24-7 Crew, MC Shark\'s Raptional Scream, and the Mad DJ\'s Band. In the late 1980s, he performed with Ice T and Afrika Bambataa during their Italian tours.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ice+One\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Malice',75,323,'khmer1jivit',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Malice\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lucativa',94,710,'PISTOLPOSSE',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lucativa\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Pyoot',21,122,'Joey Stylez',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Pyoot\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Free Radicals',3706,25622,'Alex Bilo & Wit','##More than one artist with this name##\n(1)Breaks/Ambient group: Andy Page, Ivan Gough & Phil Krokodis\n(2)Free Radicals is a modern American big band that blends jazz, ska, latin, funk and a number of other styles into their music. They have released three cd\'s since their foundation in 1996. Their website is www.freerads.com.\n(3)Free Radicals was a live electronic collaboration between New Zealand composers Ross Harris and Jonathan Besser <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Free+Radicals\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sunno Music',388,2984,'Hashim Nawaz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sunno+Music\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Malice',75,323,'khmer1jivit',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Malice\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Theophilus London',566413,7682634,'GoldLink','Theophilus London is a Brooklyn, USA based hip hop artist with heavy electro influences.\n\nLondon released his debut mixtape JAM! in 2008. In 2009 he collaborated with MachineDrum for his second mixtape This Charming Mixtape which brought London to a wider audience. In 2010 London released the mixtape I Want You which features covers of classic songs. \n\nLondon\'s track Flying Overseas (featuring Devonté Hynes and Solange Knowles) enjoyed popularity with music bloggers in November 2010.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Theophilus+London\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Harm Franklin',5142,12885,'Levi Bent-Lee',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Harm+Franklin\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Slimm',1896,10195,'Reef Project','“Once upon a time... ...when we were young, there was the World filled with the marvellous.” My name is Jacob Skógursson. Slimm. While I was growing up there was always two things that inspired me: music and architecture. The way I have to combine artistic and technical way to make my architectural projects is the same when it comes to compose, play and mix my music. To make forms and loops a perfect shape - you have to fly high and stay strong in the ground at the same time. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Slimm\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('D-Weez',70,465,'H2MG AR',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/D-Weez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kilo',17132,126545,'MVSTAFA','There are at least five artist(s) known as Kilo.\n\n1) Kilo is an Keflavik, Iceland based rapper. Born in 1982. Does solo rap, and has also been on track with the likes of Spaceman & Cheese, Marvel The Jeweler, Basic-B and more. Opened shows for a lot of artists, one of them being The Pharcyde.\n\n2) Kilo is Florian Bogner and Markus Urban.\n\n3) Kilo is Hugh Pescod also known as Clipz the Bristol based drum and bass producer and DJ.\n\n4) Kilo Ali (born 1972), also known as Kilo, is a rap music artist from Atlanta, Georgia, in the United States. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kilo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Petersen',1404,5883,'DJ huang hao','Petersen is a mysterious tropical-pop project based in Brooklyn.\n\nhttp://petersen.bandcamp.com/\n\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Petersen\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dylan Raw',113,995,'Shane Reis',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dylan+Raw\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ricca Razor Sharp',213,1205,'Planit','Ricca Razor Sharp is a thinking man’s MC, delivering rhymes that are honest and insightful, yet entertaining, clever and witty. His debut album, ’12 Steps to a Deffer You’, available now on Neferiu Records, has been embraced by the press, college radio, and both mainstream and underground hip-hop audiences. With a host of different styles, Ricca keeps the listener enthralled, whether rhyming on disc, or commanding the stage.\n\nRicca grasp of the MC position results from 7 years of performances <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ricca+Razor+Sharp\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('King Lou',599,2184,'Jen de Melo',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/King+Lou\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('2t',22938,198491,'Chris Beats Zn','There are multiple artists with this name:\n1) 2T, a Blackmore\'s Night inspired band\n2) A Polish rapper(?)\n\n\n1)\nTormod Tørresdal and Tor Moen Tønnesen (known from Han innante) are two of the members of this project. 2T is Blackmore\'s Night inspired folk-prog. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/2t\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Atila',3823,93045,'Gòtic','The Spanish band ATILA was formed in \'73 by Eduardo Biebla (guitar), Joan Punyet (drums) and Paco Ortega (keyboards), soon several personnel changes followed. This legendary and highly acclaimed progrock band made three LP\'s: \"The Beginning Of The End\" (\'75), \"Intencion\" (\'76) and \"Reviure\" (\'77). At the end of \'78 the band dissolves but in \'99 they reformed with Joan Punyet (drums), Benet Nogue (keyboards), Ignasi Bosch (guitar), Pere Martinez (bass) and Joan Cardoner (guitar). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Atila\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oriole',1995,201759,'Dudu Pukwana, Bob Stuckey, Phil Lee, John Marshall, Terry Smith, Martin Hart','A sensory banquet of soaring melodies, colourful South American folklore, lively dances and emotional ballads of longing. Music that creates a rich, emotionally disquieting world that is at once familiar and dreamlike. A world of freedom, of movement, of dusty roads and traveling musicians in shaded market squares whose journey will never end. These are songs of magical realism mingling elements of fantasy, myth, desire and wanderlust in renderings that blur traditional distinctions between what is serious or trivial, melancholic or joyous. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oriole\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dwalk',3761,23117,'Kye Colors',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dwalk\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Spectacular Diagnostics',58372,250428,'Boldy James',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Spectacular+Diagnostics\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ben Jones',11079,58969,'Jo Russell','Ben Jones was the singer and songwriter for The Lovedays. He has produced The Soundcasters, Scott Brunger and Rich Clark independently, and is a multi instrumentalist. \nHe released his first solo album, \"Echobox\" in 2010, swiftly followed by his second, \"Kaleidoscope\" in 2011.\nBoth were met with critical acclaim. He is currently writing the \"difficult\" third album, and also co-writing an album with Maxine Kerr. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ben+Jones\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Blake G',4201,14362,'Sick Stop','Blake G is a young, unconventional rapper from Jacksonville, Alabama. Growing up and moving place to place with little contact with his father until his later years, he molded himself into an independent and determined artist. When writing he always attempts to portray what he is feeling inside. As a self-proclaimed renaissance man, enough will simply never be good enough to this young man. He always says, \"You know something\'s wrong when your satisfied\". <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Blake+G\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Da Youngsta\'s',35973,293928,'Artifacts','Da Youngstas is a hip-hop trio consisting of two brothers, Taji \"Taj Mahal\" Goodman and Qu\'ran Goodman, and their cousin Tarik Dawson, hailing from Philadelphia.\n\nSimilar to Shyheim (aka The Rugged Child), Da Youngsta\'s were the definition of raw talent back in 1993. However unlike shyheim who carried on as a Wu Affiliate, Da Youngsta\'s disappeared into thin air, shortly after their last album \"I\'ll make you famous\" dropped. It\'s such a shame, as Taji, Qur\'an & Tarik were some of Philly\'s best MC\'s regardless of their age. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Da+Youngsta%27s\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ricca Razor Sharp',213,1205,'Planit','Ricca Razor Sharp is a thinking man’s MC, delivering rhymes that are honest and insightful, yet entertaining, clever and witty. His debut album, ’12 Steps to a Deffer You’, available now on Neferiu Records, has been embraced by the press, college radio, and both mainstream and underground hip-hop audiences. With a host of different styles, Ricca keeps the listener enthralled, whether rhyming on disc, or commanding the stage.\n\nRicca grasp of the MC position results from 7 years of performances <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ricca+Razor+Sharp\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nazar',48192,886181,'DJ Haram','There are two artists named Nazar:\n\n1) Nazar is a 26-year-old Angolan producer who grew up in Belgium until his late teens, when he returned after the civil war and is now based in Manchester. \n\nHe is signed to Kode9\'s Hyperdub records and released his debut solo album Guerilla in March 2020.\n\n2) Nazar (civil name; Ardalan Afshar) was born on the 20th september of 1984 in Therean, Iran.  He\'s a austrian rapper and musicvideo producer currently living in Vienna.\n\nHe released his first studio album \"Kinder des Himmels\" in july 2008. \n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nazar\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('D-Weez',70,465,'H2MG AR',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/D-Weez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Micall Parknsun',10671,86289,'Asaviour','Micall Parknsun is a British rapper/producer. He has been quietly involved in the UK hip-hop scene for a while, yet he only has a small number of releases to his name.\n\nHe was first noticed on the scene as a duo with fellow rapper R.A.M, under the name \"2Halves\", with tracks such as \"Freedom Fighters\". The duo then later split up & with Micall focusing on a solo career, released the highly acclaimed 12\" vinyl \"Tha Shit/Da Struggle\", 2004 which featured rapper Jehst. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Micall+Parknsun\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bigg Nugg',352,1846,'John Ashfield','Based out of Ohio and representing the gay “Bear” community, Bigg Nugg mixes it up with his thumping beats and spit fire lyrics on all types of things ranging from personal issues to government policies. A musician since his teenage years, the metamorphosis and transition into the artist known as Bigg Nugg was a natural evolution of talent. His lyrics are filled with reflection, passion, and a yearning for the balance of power in a homophobic society. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bigg+Nugg\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Duckman',2029,8901,'Fuego Base',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Duckman\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Young Ellens',19915,432776,'Chivv','Young Ellens van god los <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Young+Ellens\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Austin Fox 狐',1181,8534,'Adé Hakim',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Austin+Fox+%E7%8B%90\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('B.Glenn',7,36,'Last of the Horsemen',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/B.Glenn\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tori Fixx',1493,12170,'Anye Elite','Tori is one of those rare artists who push the envelope. With darkly political and sexually driven lyrics, he brings you hit after hit. His main audience is in the underground gay hip hop/r&b scene. Making statements and producing song after song for people in the industry, Tori continues to amaze new fans and keep seasoned fans happy. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tori+Fixx\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Frankie Simone',3879,16518,'Maddie Ross',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Frankie+Simone\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ShrekDiMC',2089,46222,'Chen Porati',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ShrekDiMC\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tzukush',2106,47512,'Vibe Ish',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tzukush\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nazar',48192,886181,'DJ Haram','There are two artists named Nazar:\n\n1) Nazar is a 26-year-old Angolan producer who grew up in Belgium until his late teens, when he returned after the civil war and is now based in Manchester. \n\nHe is signed to Kode9\'s Hyperdub records and released his debut solo album Guerilla in March 2020.\n\n2) Nazar (civil name; Ardalan Afshar) was born on the 20th september of 1984 in Therean, Iran.  He\'s a austrian rapper and musicvideo producer currently living in Vienna.\n\nHe released his first studio album \"Kinder des Himmels\" in july 2008. \n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nazar\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nati Hassid',831,8368,'Produx',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nati+Hassid\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('GoldenB',91,636,'Danisen',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/GoldenB\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Wes',166871,1818184,'Skye Riley','Wes Madiko first saw the light of day under the baobab tree in Moutaba, Cameroon which lies some hundred miles away from the city of Douala. From the tender age of two, his grandfather taught him about healing music and how to play the kalimba instrument. The pair soon became inseparable. His grandfather taught him his love of Bantu history and the wisdom of the elephant of animist bantou philosophy. This was responsible for an important part of his <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Wes\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bucky Dolla',168,535,'Bucky Dolla/M-Burb',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bucky+Dolla\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Connis',2097,10965,'Caev','If you’re seeking that one iconic image to represent Sint Maarten’s ebullient music scene, the dread-locked silhouette of saxophonist Connis Vanterpool can’t be far from mind.\n\n“Me, icon?” laughs the veteran horn-player, rolling his prominent eyes and flashing a wide grin. “I’m just a regular guy trying to make things happen.”\n\nBorn and raised in Sint Maarten, Connis graduated from Boston’s Berklee College of Music and built a career in jazz performance and production in the U.S. before returning to his native island in 2001. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Connis\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Young Ellens',19915,432776,'Chivv','Young Ellens van god los <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Young+Ellens\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Cam Meekins',54080,874523,'Skizzy Mars','Cam Meekins started rapping at a young age. He was making beats by 6th grade and when high school came around he began to excel in production and engineering. His Junior year he started rapping on his beats that he produced, and with the help of his friend Armand Menegay put out a mixtape. After high school Cam moved to L.A. to continue recording with producer Matty Trump. Since then Cam has been striving to improve his skills and make an impact in the hip hop game. He released his debut album, Lamp City, in November 2012. He\'s dope as f**k. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Cam+Meekins\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ramson Badbonez',19114,211668,'Contact Play','Ramson Badbonez is a british MC from London who is associated with the rap crew Task Force.\n\nIn 2013 he signed to UK record label High Focus Records and released the acclaimed LP \"A Year In The Life Of Oscar The Slouch\". He followed this up in 2018 with \"Jason Bonez\", and \"Mic Day The 13th\" in 2019.\n\nMany of his mixtapes are available for free download via his official Bandcamp page: http://ramsonbadbones.bandcamp.com/ <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ramson+Badbonez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Vneumicky',593,17039,'BELXCH',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Vneumicky\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gil Scott-Heron',812215,14628494,'Black & Blues','Gil Scott-Heron (born April 1, 1949 in Chicago, died May 27, 2011 in New York City) was an American poet and musician, known primarily for his late 1960s and early 1970s work as a spoken word performer, associated with African American militant activists. Heron is perhaps most well known for his poems/songs \"The Revolution Will Not Be Televised\" and \"What\'s the Word - Johannesburg\" a movement hit during the 1980\'s South Africa college and national divestment movement in the United States of America. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gil+Scott-Heron\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Spectacular Diagnostics',58372,250428,'Boldy James',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Spectacular+Diagnostics\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Optic Bloom',411,1648,'Qhairo',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Optic+Bloom\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Steph Kapela',477,2818,'Breeder LW',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Steph+Kapela\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gwamba',423,3822,'Namadingo','Duncan Zgambo (born November 4, 1990), professionally known as Gwamba, is a Malawi-born rapper and philanthropist.\n\nGwamba is the youngest of four siblings. He spent most of his childhood in area 18, Lilongwe. In 2005 he started his music career; he and 3 friends formed a rap grouped called the Pittie Boiz. Gwamba\'s rap career was inspired by US rapper 50 Cent and local musician The Basement. He released a single with the Pittie Boiz called \"Work That Thing\", which got airplay on FM 101 radio\'s Gowelo Beatz in 2008. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gwamba\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lulu',279718,1741475,'Sandie Shaw','There are at least two artists called Lulu:\n\n1) Marie McDonald McLaughlin Lawrie OBE (born 3 November 1948), best known by her stage name Lulu, is a Scottish singer and songwriter most known for the 1960s international hit record To Sir With Love.\n\nA native of Glasgow, Lulu shot to fame at the age of fifteen with her version of Shout, delivered in a raucous and extremely mature voice. Her backing group were called The Luvvers, but after several more British hits she left the group to become a solo artist. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lulu\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Malice',75,323,'khmer1jivit',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Malice\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kydd Jones',5460,16204,'Avi Jay D',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kydd+Jones\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rucorap',75,398,'Hip Hop Peruano Mas Na',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rucorap\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('bame',82,407,'Habson',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/bame\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Subliminal',21697,319498,'Karl Runau','If you are looking for the Israeli rap artist סאבלימינל  (real name Kobi Shimoni), your music is incorrectly tagged. You will find him here: סאבלימינל \n\nThere are at least ten artists known as Subliminal.\n\n1) Subliminal  is a german power electronics project by Albert Fisch. The typical sound of his work is one of the characteristic features of Haus Arafna\'s infamous  \'Galakthorrö\' label on which he released the albums \'Gracebudd\' (2000) and \'Coping\'(2006). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Subliminal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Malice',75,323,'khmer1jivit',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Malice\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('The Blackson',64,345,'Petty','The BlackSon, is the stage name of Mateo Pérez, a Spanish electronic music producer and percussionist from Petrer, Spain. Pérez is best known as one half of the electronic music duo Green Broth, where he collaborates with Nakata7. In addition to his work with Green Broth, Pérez released two solo tracks in 2020, titled \"Screible\" and \"Ice Cream,\" as a double single. The release also featured a remix of \"Screible\" by Nakata7. \n\nPérez\'s contributions to the music industry extend beyond his solo work and collaborations with Green Broth. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/The+Blackson\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Csaba',214,822,'Maddy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Csaba\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('D-Weez',70,465,'H2MG AR',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/D-Weez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Scoot Da Kidd',1337,6675,'42 Twinz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Scoot+Da+Kidd\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nytt',197,2398,'Seaduskuulekus & Wertigal',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nytt\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Theophilus London',566413,7682634,'GoldLink','Theophilus London is a Brooklyn, USA based hip hop artist with heavy electro influences.\n\nLondon released his debut mixtape JAM! in 2008. In 2009 he collaborated with MachineDrum for his second mixtape This Charming Mixtape which brought London to a wider audience. In 2010 London released the mixtape I Want You which features covers of classic songs. \n\nLondon\'s track Flying Overseas (featuring Devonté Hynes and Solange Knowles) enjoyed popularity with music bloggers in November 2010.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Theophilus+London\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('AK-47',40853,542463,'Pro-Pain','There are 12 artists with this name:\n\n1) AK-47 are an industrial/nu metal band from Beijing, China.\n \n2) AK47 are a crust punk band from Croatia\n\n3) AK-47 was a punk band from Houston, TX.  Their classic first and only single \"The Badge Means You Suck / Kiss My Machine\" was released in 1980; the whole Houston police dept when ape-shit over this song and it was on the local newspapers and TV. They brilliantly channeled their rage into a 4-minute tirade <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/AK-47\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Westwood Sound',101,690,'Llojd',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Westwood+Sound\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ghostown',5697,82601,'Art District','Ghostown is the project of Rael, originally from Scotland and now based in Montpellier.\n(NB NOT TO BE CONFUSED WITH THE AMERICAN GHOSTOWN (mixtape, my boo etc) \nHaving undergone many guises over the years since his first trip hoppy excursions way back in 98, Rael / Dr Rael-skinn / El - Ra / Dr Vorillon. For the last year Ghostown have been stirring up a fuss in the south of france.\n\nBuilding on influences such as traditional eastern gypsy and klezmzer music <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ghostown\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('D-Weez',70,465,'H2MG AR',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/D-Weez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nati Hassid',831,8368,'Produx',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nati+Hassid\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lukach',1726,24602,'Peled',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lukach\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Brown_buddha',353,4474,'FFamily',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Brown_buddha\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Duckman',2029,8901,'Fuego Base',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Duckman\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ricca Razor Sharp',213,1205,'Planit','Ricca Razor Sharp is a thinking man’s MC, delivering rhymes that are honest and insightful, yet entertaining, clever and witty. His debut album, ’12 Steps to a Deffer You’, available now on Neferiu Records, has been embraced by the press, college radio, and both mainstream and underground hip-hop audiences. With a host of different styles, Ricca keeps the listener enthralled, whether rhyming on disc, or commanding the stage.\n\nRicca grasp of the MC position results from 7 years of performances <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ricca+Razor+Sharp\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Brianna Perry',3747,35292,'Nyemiah Supreme','Brianna Perry (born January 11, 1992), also known as Lil\' Brianna, is an American female rapper from Miami-Dade County, Florida. She was the youngest act signed to Missy Elliott\'s label The Goldmind Inc. and affiliated with Slip-N-Slide Records, home to rappers Trina and Rick Ross. Perry made her debut on Trina\'s album Diamond Princess on the track \"Kandi\". Since then, she has released six mixtapes, four mainstream singles and various viral freestyles.\n\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Brianna+Perry\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tayla Parx',123700,1202445,'Kiana Ledé','Taylor Monet Parks (born September 16, 1993), also known by the stage name Tayla Parx, is an American singer-songwriter, and actress. In 2018, Parks was credited as a co-writer on four Billboard Hot 100 top 10 singles;  \"Love Lies\" by Khalid and Normani, \"Thank U, Next\" and \"7 Rings\" by Ariana Grande, and \"High Hopes\" by Panic! at the Disco. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tayla+Parx\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Moody Kablawi',266,707,'Mahmood Jrere','Arab Palestinian musician, Moody Kablawi, has been working his way through the music scene since his early teens. Starting with writing poems, sitting them on top of beats and creating his own sound in rap, a shift occurred, bringing this 24-year-old musician into a more colourful world of sound and music production. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Moody+Kablawi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ShrekDiMC',2089,46222,'Chen Porati',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ShrekDiMC\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tzukush',2106,47512,'Vibe Ish',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tzukush\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('AN TY',502,4810,'Mantrablu','Producer, DJ, and musician AN TY debuted in 2016 with his first single \"Chroma\". The Virginia native has set out on a mission to expand the horizons of listeners trapped in today\'s genre paradigm by blending influences from the past and present into a style of his own. AN TY has turned his passion and influences into a style he likens to sitting on a Comet hurdling through the galaxy, absorbing all the vibes of the universe. \n\nIn 2018, AN TY looks to build on the momentum of his debut project, Gravity. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/AN+TY\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mad Dogg',166,352,'casper loc',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mad+Dogg\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DintleOnTheTrack',92,342,'Ban-T',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/DintleOnTheTrack\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lord T',164,1260,'Lord T & Eloise',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lord+T\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Shitao',15729,277379,'Son of A Bricklayer','Shitao is a french beatsmith,  from a project called ASP along with akabrownsugar & Pi-Pol. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Shitao\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Hudson Mohawke',564566,8405317,'Rustie','Hudson Mohawke, (b. Ross Birchard), also known as Hud Mo, is an Electronic music producer/DJ from Glasgow, Scotland, affiliated with the LuckyMe collective of musicians and artists. He is signed to Warp Records and G.O.O.D. Music. Hudson released his debut album Butter in October 2009.\n\nAt the age of 15, Birchard, under the name DJ Itchy, was the youngest ever UK DMC finalist. His earliest gigs as a club DJ were with Glasgow Uni\'s Subcity Radio where <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Hudson+Mohawke\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Шеff',4769,52440,'Мастер Шеff','Vlad Valov (Влад Валов), alson known as ШЕFF, Мастер ШЕFF is a Russian MC, producer, promoter. He is a member of the legendary Russian Hip-Hop pioneers Bad Balance. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/%D0%A8%D0%B5ff\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Мойша Эскобар',64,168,'Словетский & Dj Nik One',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/%D0%9C%D0%BE%D0%B9%D1%88%D0%B0+%D0%AD%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%80\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Malice',75,323,'khmer1jivit',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Malice\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Vigos',50,279,'Tankeone',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Vigos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Pce Bj',2945,35449,'Lilqua 50',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Pce+Bj\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yung Verbal',26,93,'Scott',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yung+Verbal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Boity',1300,6303,'Audiomarc','Boitumelo Thulo (born April 28, 1990), professionally known as \"Boity\", is a South African Television personality, rapper, actor and model. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Boity\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Killarmy',78761,764329,'Sunz of Man','Killarmy (pronounced Killa Army) is an American hip hop group, most well-known through their affiliation with the Wu-Tang Clan. They are one of the earliest and most successful of the many Wu-Tang affiliates that emerged in the mid-to-late 1990\'s. Originally consisting of New York rappers 9th Prince (RZA\'s younger brother), Islord, Dom Pachino, Killa Sin and Ohio producer 4th Disciple, they added Beretta 9 and ShoGun Assasson to the roster in 1996, also from Ohio. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Killarmy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yung Verbal',26,93,'Scott',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yung+Verbal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('BFD',893,7827,'About Face','Brothers For Decades. Hardcore band from Niagara Falls, Ontario. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/BFD\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('2t',22938,198491,'Chris Beats Zn','There are multiple artists with this name:\n1) 2T, a Blackmore\'s Night inspired band\n2) A Polish rapper(?)\n\n\n1)\nTormod Tørresdal and Tor Moen Tønnesen (known from Han innante) are two of the members of this project. 2T is Blackmore\'s Night inspired folk-prog. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/2t\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nigma',4792,23833,'Melisses',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nigma\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Slimm',1896,10195,'Reef Project','“Once upon a time... ...when we were young, there was the World filled with the marvellous.” My name is Jacob Skógursson. Slimm. While I was growing up there was always two things that inspired me: music and architecture. The way I have to combine artistic and technical way to make my architectural projects is the same when it comes to compose, play and mix my music. To make forms and loops a perfect shape - you have to fly high and stay strong in the ground at the same time. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Slimm\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Subliminal',21697,319498,'Karl Runau','If you are looking for the Israeli rap artist סאבלימינל  (real name Kobi Shimoni), your music is incorrectly tagged. You will find him here: סאבלימינל \n\nThere are at least ten artists known as Subliminal.\n\n1) Subliminal  is a german power electronics project by Albert Fisch. The typical sound of his work is one of the characteristic features of Haus Arafna\'s infamous  \'Galakthorrö\' label on which he released the albums \'Gracebudd\' (2000) and \'Coping\'(2006). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Subliminal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DOLLAR SELMOUNI',13885,205923,'Juancho Marqués',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/DOLLAR+SELMOUNI\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lucas Otero',564,2178,'Aissa',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lucas+Otero\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Recycled J',43627,2353384,'DeLaOssa','Jorge Escorial Moreno, popularmente conocido como Recycled J, es un rapero español​ que se nutre tanto del reguetón, el R&B y el trap como de la electrónica.​En sus inicios fue conocido como Cool pero, tras retirarse por un tiempo de la escena musical, volvió con un nuevo seudónimo <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Recycled+J\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Hijos de la ruina',42,519,'Adrian Koslov',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Hijos+de+la+ruina\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Recycled J',43627,2353384,'DeLaOssa','Jorge Escorial Moreno, popularmente conocido como Recycled J, es un rapero español​ que se nutre tanto del reguetón, el R&B y el trap como de la electrónica.​En sus inicios fue conocido como Cool pero, tras retirarse por un tiempo de la escena musical, volvió con un nuevo seudónimo <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Recycled+J\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Hijos de la ruina',42,519,'Adrian Koslov',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Hijos+de+la+ruina\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bandido',51171,625670,'Xenon','Bandido is an Italian-Spanish eurodance project produced and arranged by Mauro Farina and Factory Team\'s members and Spanish producers Carlos Garcia Puche, Carlos Garcia, Manuel Gonzalez and Stefano Ghilardi.\nThe project appeared with the release of the single \"I Drove All Night\" with Annerley Gordon as vocalist.\nThe follow up singles were \"Like The Way I Do\", \"Touch Me 95\", \"California Dream\", \"I Wanna Dance With Somebody\" \"Wouldn\'t It Be Good\" and \"For Sale\" in 1999. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bandido\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('SoSAD',4908,79749,'Sosad.97',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/SoSAD\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Al Safir',18610,1140064,'Hard GZ',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Al+Safir\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('GARZI',90091,954525,'POORSTACY','Christopher Garzon (b. May 24, 1997), better known by the stage name GARZI (formerly Yung Garzi), is a musical artist from Miami, Florida.\n\nHis youth influences include Paramore, Fall Out Boy, Sleeping with Sirens, and other rock artists, but he didn’t listen to rap until he came upon the likes of artists like Yung Simmie and Denzel Curry.\n\nOn April 5, 2019, GARZI released his debut EP, nothing to something.\n\nOn May 31, 2019, GARZI signed to the major record label, Capitol Records. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/GARZI\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nickzzy',20974,393147,'Aiman JR',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nickzzy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Snow Tha Product',143899,2590468,'Tech N9ne','Claudia Alexandra Madriz Meza (born June 24, 1987) known professionally as Snow Tha Product, is an American rapper, singer, actress, YouTuber, and podcaster. She was signed to Atlantic Records from 2012 until November 2018. Since then, she has been an independent artist. Her most well-known projects are her 2013 mixtape Good Nights & Bad Mornings 2: The Hangover and the 2018 compilation album VIBEHIGHER. On April 28, 2021, Snow collaborated with Bizarrap on \"BZRP Music Sessions #39\". <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Snow+Tha+Product\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Recycled J',43627,2353384,'DeLaOssa','Jorge Escorial Moreno, popularmente conocido como Recycled J, es un rapero español​ que se nutre tanto del reguetón, el R&B y el trap como de la electrónica.​En sus inicios fue conocido como Cool pero, tras retirarse por un tiempo de la escena musical, volvió con un nuevo seudónimo <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Recycled+J\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Hijos de la ruina',42,519,'Adrian Koslov',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Hijos+de+la+ruina\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lowlight',13446,115417,'Un Titico','There are multiple artists with this name.\n\n1. A rock band from New Jersey whose debut album \"Where Do We Go From Here\" released in August 2016. https://www.facebook.com/lowlightnj/\n\n2. A group formed in late 2012 by Matt Miller and Stephen Green, incorporating elements of shoegaze, new wave, goth rock and post punk. https://www.facebook.com/lowlightSA\n\n3. A duo of spanish producers that have worked with some of the most important urban artists in Spain,\n such as Yung Beef and Bad Gyal. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lowlight\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Wise',34840,453920,'NERDHEAD','There are at least 2 artists named Wise:\n\n1. Seiji Kameyama (亀山晴児, Kameyama Seiji?), born in 1979 to a Japanese father and American mother, is a Japanese hip hop musician who raps in both Japanese and English under the name WISE. During high school he lived in the United States. He is affiliated with the creative group KAZENOHITO. In 2005, he formed the groups WISE`N\'SONPUB with beatmaker SONPUB, and TERIYAKI BOYZ with RYO-Z and ILMARI from RIP SLYME and VERBAL from m-flo. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Wise\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Central Cee',1290186,56719250,'SR','Oakley Neil H T \"Cench\" Caesar-Su (born 4 June 1998), known professionally as Central Cee, is a British rapper and songwriter from Shepherd\'s Bush, London. He saw success in 2020 with the release of the singles \"Day in the Life\" and \"Loading\". His first mixtape Wild West was released on 12 March 2021, which debuted at number two on the UK Albums Chart. His second mixtape 23 was released on 25 February 2022 and debuted atop the UK Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Central+Cee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Recycled J',43627,2353384,'DeLaOssa','Jorge Escorial Moreno, popularmente conocido como Recycled J, es un rapero español​ que se nutre tanto del reguetón, el R&B y el trap como de la electrónica.​En sus inicios fue conocido como Cool pero, tras retirarse por un tiempo de la escena musical, volvió con un nuevo seudónimo <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Recycled+J\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lacrim',100348,3486701,'Niro','Karim Zenoud (born 19 April 1985), better known by his stage name  Lacrim, is a French rapper of Algerian descent. After collaborations with various rap artists, he released his album \"Faites entrer Lacrim\" on May 14, 2012 followed by a mixtape \"Toujours le même\" in Dec 17, 2012. The following two albums, \"Corleone\" in 2014 and \"Force et Honneur\" in 2017 both topped the French Albums Chart. He also released three successive mixtapes under the R.I.P.R.O series; two in 2015 and a third in 2017. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lacrim\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Chucky73',44262,554818,'Dowba Montana',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Chucky73\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DOLLAR SELMOUNI',13885,205923,'Juancho Marqués',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/DOLLAR+SELMOUNI\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Castro28002',3157,46844,'DukeeMdz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Castro28002\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lopes',6784,113752,'Dirty Porko',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lopes\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('SoSAD',4908,79749,'Sosad.97',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/SoSAD\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Antony Z',6204,81532,'Shoda Monkas',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Antony+Z\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lane',37516,236337,'City Feels','1) A Swedish shoegaze/rock band.\n\n2) An Australian alternative band.\n\n1) Lane’s self-titled debut album described as a trip through a mystical and dreamy musical landscape was recorded 2005 by Erik Danielsson and Robin Spurrier in Soylent Green studio, the home of South Ambulance and Sickoakes. In Swedish ”news” paper Expressen comparisons were made to the Concretes and Moe Tucker, but also names as Sundays and Slowdive has been mentioned.\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lane\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Al Safir',18610,1140064,'Hard GZ',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Al+Safir\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Central Cee',1290186,56719250,'SR','Oakley Neil H T \"Cench\" Caesar-Su (born 4 June 1998), known professionally as Central Cee, is a British rapper and songwriter from Shepherd\'s Bush, London. He saw success in 2020 with the release of the singles \"Day in the Life\" and \"Loading\". His first mixtape Wild West was released on 12 March 2021, which debuted at number two on the UK Albums Chart. His second mixtape 23 was released on 25 February 2022 and debuted atop the UK Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Central+Cee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Wos',187849,15540001,'Trueno','\nValentín Oliva, (Buenos Aires, Argentina; 23 de enero de 1998) conocido artísticamente como Wos, es un rapero, freestyler argentino. Es conocido por ser el actual campeón en el torneo internacional de Red Bull Batalla de los Gallos.\n\nCarrera\n\nWos arrancó desde muy pequeño rapeando en las plazas y participando en competencias como El Quinto Escalón, donde ya demostraba un gran potencial y sobre todo mucho coraje. Pero fue en 2016 cuando demostró que su nivel estaba para mucho más que una plaza <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Wos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tensei One',32,41,'kilvertz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tensei+One\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Wöyza',1785,23934,'Flavio Rodríguez',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/W%C3%B6yza\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Eazyboi',5543,106154,'Easy-S','Eazyboi, cuyo nombre real es Isidro Ramos, es un rapero malagueño perteneciente al colectivo Space Hammurabi. Conocido anteriormente como Easy-S, lanza con su nuevo pseudónimo un debut titulado \"Ascari\" en febrero de 2025. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Eazyboi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('J.Moods',1055,4774,'Space Hammu',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/J.Moods\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Recycled J',43627,2353384,'DeLaOssa','Jorge Escorial Moreno, popularmente conocido como Recycled J, es un rapero español​ que se nutre tanto del reguetón, el R&B y el trap como de la electrónica.​En sus inicios fue conocido como Cool pero, tras retirarse por un tiempo de la escena musical, volvió con un nuevo seudónimo <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Recycled+J\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Hijos de la ruina',42,519,'Adrian Koslov',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Hijos+de+la+ruina\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Central Cee',1290186,56719250,'SR','Oakley Neil H T \"Cench\" Caesar-Su (born 4 June 1998), known professionally as Central Cee, is a British rapper and songwriter from Shepherd\'s Bush, London. He saw success in 2020 with the release of the singles \"Day in the Life\" and \"Loading\". His first mixtape Wild West was released on 12 March 2021, which debuted at number two on the UK Albums Chart. His second mixtape 23 was released on 25 February 2022 and debuted atop the UK Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Central+Cee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Central Cee',1290186,56719250,'SR','Oakley Neil H T \"Cench\" Caesar-Su (born 4 June 1998), known professionally as Central Cee, is a British rapper and songwriter from Shepherd\'s Bush, London. He saw success in 2020 with the release of the singles \"Day in the Life\" and \"Loading\". His first mixtape Wild West was released on 12 March 2021, which debuted at number two on the UK Albums Chart. His second mixtape 23 was released on 25 February 2022 and debuted atop the UK Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Central+Cee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('PLK',137654,10879066,'Josman','PLK (born 1997 in Paris) is a French rapper and member of the rap group Panama Bende. He began writing songs at a young age. He released his first solo EP in 2015 followed by a second in 2016. His first album, Ténébreux was released in 2017. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/PLK\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oboy',104923,5206870,'Josman','Mihaja Ramiarinarivo (born 6 January 1997), better known by the stage name OBOY, is a Malagasy-born French rapper. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oboy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Titó',2240,21076,'SD KONG',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/Tit%C3%B3\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('OTP',105425,1356126,'SR','There is more than one artist by the name OTP.\n\n1. OTP a UK Drill collective from Haringey, London. Their members with the most success are Sava, BM, Mini and Rambizz. They saw a lot of success after their song ” BM (London View)” blew up on TikTok in 2021.\n\n2.  A folk punk 3-piece from Somerville, MA.\n\n3.  An alternative rock band, formed in PA in 2003. https://otp1.bandcamp.com/album/grow-its-teeth <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/OTP\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alemán',201633,4812659,'Gera MX','Erick Raúl Alemán Ramírez was born on February 20, 1990, in Cabo San Lucas, Baja California Sur.\n\nHe began exploring rap at the age of 14 alongside his childhood friend MC King, with whom he formed a group called “2 Rimas.” A year later, they met DJ Phat, who joined the group, prompting them to change their name to “Doble Rima.” In 2009, they released an album titled Click Clack Punto Exacto.\n\nIn 2010, MC King decided to take a break, leaving DJ Phat and Alemán to continue the project. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/Alem%C3%A1n\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Siaka',12233,107293,'R2',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Siaka\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Russ Millions',302742,6890281,'Fumez the Engineer','Shylo Batchelor Ashby Milwood (born 20 March 1996), known professionally as Russ Millions (formerly Russ or Russ Splash), is a British rapper. In December 2018 he released his single \"Gun Lean\" on Virgin Records. The track peaked at number 9 on the UK Singles Chart, becoming the first UK drill track to reach the top 10. The dance that Russ performs in the music video became a \"dance craze\" and was mimicked by footballers including Jesse Lingard. It was ranked by The Guardian at number 10 on their list of \"greatest pop music dance crazes\". <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Russ+Millions\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Capo Plaza',86426,5773512,'Sfera Ebbasta','Luca D\'Orso (born 20 April 1998), better known by his stage name Capo Plaza, is an Italian rapper. He has achieved three number one albums and four number one singles in Italy. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Capo+Plaza\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rondodasosa',67145,3335297,'SIMBA LA RUE',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rondodasosa\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dillom',167331,18228673,'ODD MAMI','Dillom, cuyo nombre real es Dylan León Masa, es un rapero y cantante argentino nacido el 5 de diciembre de 2000 en Buenos Aires. Reconocido por su estilo provocador y su habilidad para fusionar géneros como el trap, el rock alternativo y el horrorcore, ha logrado posicionarse como una de las figuras más influyentes de la escena urbana argentina.\n\nSu carrera despegó con el lanzamiento de su álbum debut, Post Mortem (2021), un trabajo conceptual que aborda temas como la muerte <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dillom\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yeruza',19942,559253,'Yampi',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yeruza\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Stormy',23558,761505,'ElGrandeToto','Stormy is a Moroccan rapper. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Stormy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Inkonnu',7127,399707,'7ARI','Ahmed Allali aléas Inkonnu est un rappeur populaire dans le sens noble du terme. La scène marocaine l’a découvert en 2015 dans A6 Gang, ensuite il a choisi de se lancer une carrière en solo. Son image est construite sur le mystère, il laisse donc son talent parle de lui.\n\nComme son nom l’indique, il est étranger par son RAP et bien encore il se considère un Alien, un extraterrestre. Pour ses fans, il suffit de prononcer le mot Alien afin que tout le monde se manifeste. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Inkonnu\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ankhal',29535,526538,'Yeruza',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ankhal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('347aidan',459947,6936593,'Powfu','Aidan Fuller, professionally known as 347aidan, is a Canadian rapper originating from Cambridge, Ontario. Born on June 8, 2003, Fuller embarked on his musical journey in 2017, dedicating himself to crafting music as a central pursuit. His passion for music led him to release numerous singles and EPs on platforms such as SoundCloud and YouTube between 2017 and 2019, gradually establishing a modest fanbase from these early recordings. In June 2019, he transitioned his SoundCloud music to mainstream streaming services. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/347aidan\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dillom',167331,18228673,'ODD MAMI','Dillom, cuyo nombre real es Dylan León Masa, es un rapero y cantante argentino nacido el 5 de diciembre de 2000 en Buenos Aires. Reconocido por su estilo provocador y su habilidad para fusionar géneros como el trap, el rock alternativo y el horrorcore, ha logrado posicionarse como una de las figuras más influyentes de la escena urbana argentina.\n\nSu carrera despegó con el lanzamiento de su álbum debut, Post Mortem (2021), un trabajo conceptual que aborda temas como la muerte <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dillom\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oblivion\'s Mighty Trash',27379,1457740,'granuja','Juan Sebastián Álvarez, mejor conocido como Oblivion\'s Mighty Trash es un rapero MC de la ciudad de Medellín, Colombia. Nació en Bello, Antioquia en el 2003 y empezó su carrera artística en el 2020 influenciado por el rap estadounidense y el rap colombiano con exponentes como Doble Porción y que en su trayectoria ha logrado posicionarse como uno de los mayores exponentes del género en la actualidad así como un estandarte de la música independiente en la escena colombiana. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oblivion%27s+Mighty+Trash\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Central Cee',1290186,56719250,'SR','Oakley Neil H T \"Cench\" Caesar-Su (born 4 June 1998), known professionally as Central Cee, is a British rapper and songwriter from Shepherd\'s Bush, London. He saw success in 2020 with the release of the singles \"Day in the Life\" and \"Loading\". His first mixtape Wild West was released on 12 March 2021, which debuted at number two on the UK Albums Chart. His second mixtape 23 was released on 25 February 2022 and debuted atop the UK Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Central+Cee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Capo Plaza',86426,5773512,'Sfera Ebbasta','Luca D\'Orso (born 20 April 1998), better known by his stage name Capo Plaza, is an Italian rapper. He has achieved three number one albums and four number one singles in Italy. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Capo+Plaza\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DPR LIVE',456301,25529833,'DPR IAN','Hong Dabin (Hangul: 홍다빈; born January 1, 1993), better known by his stage names DPR Live (Hangul: 디피알 라이브) and Dabin.kr, is a South Korean rapper and singer. DPR stands for \"Dream Perfect Regime\". He released his debut album, Coming to You Live, on March 15, 2017. He then released his second album, Her, on December 7, 2017. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/DPR+LIVE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Beenzino',77024,1714237,'Jazzyfact','Beenzino (Korean: 빈지노) a.k.a Isshoman, real name Lim Sungbin (임성빈), is a South Korean hip-hop musician under the label BANA (signed since 2021).  He is widely known as a signee of now-defunct label Illionaire Records (alongside Dok2 and The Quiett), of which he was signed from 2011 to the label\'s closing in 2020. Born on September 12, 1987, he is one of the most influential rappers in the underground scene at a young age. Emcee of Jazzyfact (prod. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Beenzino\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lacrim',100348,3486701,'Niro','Karim Zenoud (born 19 April 1985), better known by his stage name  Lacrim, is a French rapper of Algerian descent. After collaborations with various rap artists, he released his album \"Faites entrer Lacrim\" on May 14, 2012 followed by a mixtape \"Toujours le même\" in Dec 17, 2012. The following two albums, \"Corleone\" in 2014 and \"Force et Honneur\" in 2017 both topped the French Albums Chart. He also released three successive mixtapes under the R.I.P.R.O series; two in 2015 and a third in 2017. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lacrim\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ankhal',29535,526538,'Yeruza',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ankhal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alcolirykoz',32403,2067504,'granuja','Alcolirykoz es un dúo de rap colombiano, integrado por Juan Carlos Fonnegra (Gambeta) y Carlos Andrés (Kaztro), ambos nacidos en Medellín. Se iniciaron en el hip hop a finales de los años 90, participando en batallas de freestyle y grabando sus primeras maquetas. En 2005, adoptaron el nombre de Alcolirykoz, que hace referencia a su estilo de vida bohemio y rebelde.\n\nSu música se caracteriza por su originalidad, su humor negro, su crítica social y su uso de expresiones locales. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Alcolirykoz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('JBEE',220212,3421459,'SwitchOTR',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/JBEE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Neto Peña',34320,610083,'Toser One',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Neto+Pe%C3%B1a\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Wos',187849,15540001,'Trueno','\nValentín Oliva, (Buenos Aires, Argentina; 23 de enero de 1998) conocido artísticamente como Wos, es un rapero, freestyler argentino. Es conocido por ser el actual campeón en el torneo internacional de Red Bull Batalla de los Gallos.\n\nCarrera\n\nWos arrancó desde muy pequeño rapeando en las plazas y participando en competencias como El Quinto Escalón, donde ya demostraba un gran potencial y sobre todo mucho coraje. Pero fue en 2016 cuando demostró que su nivel estaba para mucho más que una plaza <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Wos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('WeRenoi',105890,7956793,'Ninho',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/WeRenoi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oblivion\'s Mighty Trash',27379,1457740,'granuja','Juan Sebastián Álvarez, mejor conocido como Oblivion\'s Mighty Trash es un rapero MC de la ciudad de Medellín, Colombia. Nació en Bello, Antioquia en el 2003 y empezó su carrera artística en el 2020 influenciado por el rap estadounidense y el rap colombiano con exponentes como Doble Porción y que en su trayectoria ha logrado posicionarse como uno de los mayores exponentes del género en la actualidad así como un estandarte de la música independiente en la escena colombiana. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oblivion%27s+Mighty+Trash\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Isaiah Rashad',1263658,79259003,'Smino','Isaiah Rashad McClain (born May 16, 1991) is a rapper hailing from Chattanooga, Tennessee. He is signed to Top Dawg Entertainment. Isaiah Rashad first began rapping seriously in the tenth grade and after high school, he lived wherever he could record. He began getting industry connects in 2010 from which point his music begun getting passed around to various A&R\'s. In 2012, Isaiah Rashad toured with Juicy J, Joey Bada$$ and Smoke DZA among others, on the Smoker\'s Club Tour. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Isaiah+Rashad\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lithe',496607,10506217,'M Huncho','Josiah Ramel, professionally known as Lithe, is an Australian rapper, singer-songwriter, and record producer. Lithe gained mainstream attention from his 2024 single, \"Fall Back\", which received two remixes—one featuring Canadian rapper Nav and another featuring American rapper Lil Tjay. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lithe\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Young Miko',356138,12896505,'Rauw Alejandro','Young Miko, como se conoce artísticamente, nació en Añasco, Puerto Rico. Es una talentosa artista con sonido propio que, con tan solo 28 años, se ha catalogado como una de las artistas femeninas con más potencial dentro de la escena musical actual, en Latinoamérica. La artista irrumpió en la escena al lanzar “105 Freestyle”, su primer sencillo, en colaboración con el reconocido productor Caleb Calloway. Abriendo camino propio dentro de la escena urbana <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Young+Miko\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bhavi',130899,6210723,'Duki','Bhavi es un cantante de trap nacido como Indra Bhalavan en Bélgica, el 22 de octubre de 1997, y radicado en Argentina. En 2017 comenzó a grabar y al poco tiempo se conectó con Mueva Records, la productora con la cual trabaja. \n\nEn 2018 volvió a Bélgica a probar suerte, donde comenzó una gira con Coely y Dvtch Norris, presentándose en distintos festivales. Lanzó varios singles junto a otros artistas reconocidos: “Mojaa”, el 30 de enero <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bhavi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Midel',37904,833023,'Santoz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Midel\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Zecca',12477,56970,'Los Sufridos',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Zecca\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Hamza',142667,14225328,'Josman','Hamza Al-Farissi (Arabic: حمزة الفارسي‎; born 1 August 1994), better known by the mononym Hamza, is a francophone Belgian rapper, singer and beatmaker. Hamza is signed to Rec. 118 and Warner Music.\nBorn in Laeken to parents of Moroccan origin, he formed the hip hop band Kilogramme Gang as an adolescent with his friends Triton and MK. He also used the logo \"Saucegod\". The band released the urban project Gotham City Vol. 1. Hamza composed the beats used by the band. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Hamza\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Morray',117479,1457579,'Joyner Lucas','Morae Ruffin (born. September 9, 1992), known professionally as Morray, is an American rapper, singer, and songwriter. Best known for his combinations of rapping and singing, Morray’s days as the lead singer of his church choir heavily influenced his melodic and unique style. \n\nGrowing up in Fayetteville, NC and getting in trouble, Morray turned to music as his escape. He was raised on R&B and gospel music at the age of four. He then moved to Lebanon <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Morray\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ElReghosg',4411,45116,'Johan Chavando',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ElReghosg\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mickey Ojo Rojo Sg',20,69,'Jauría Santa',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mickey+Ojo+Rojo+Sg\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Russ Millions',302742,6890281,'Fumez the Engineer','Shylo Batchelor Ashby Milwood (born 20 March 1996), known professionally as Russ Millions (formerly Russ or Russ Splash), is a British rapper. In December 2018 he released his single \"Gun Lean\" on Virgin Records. The track peaked at number 9 on the UK Singles Chart, becoming the first UK drill track to reach the top 10. The dance that Russ performs in the music video became a \"dance craze\" and was mimicked by footballers including Jesse Lingard. It was ranked by The Guardian at number 10 on their list of \"greatest pop music dance crazes\". <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Russ+Millions\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Charles Ans',45861,2107570,'Gera MX',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Charles+Ans\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dillom',167331,18228673,'ODD MAMI','Dillom, cuyo nombre real es Dylan León Masa, es un rapero y cantante argentino nacido el 5 de diciembre de 2000 en Buenos Aires. Reconocido por su estilo provocador y su habilidad para fusionar géneros como el trap, el rock alternativo y el horrorcore, ha logrado posicionarse como una de las figuras más influyentes de la escena urbana argentina.\n\nSu carrera despegó con el lanzamiento de su álbum debut, Post Mortem (2021), un trabajo conceptual que aborda temas como la muerte <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dillom\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Punga',1270,31529,'Панга',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Punga\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Santa RM',25142,459928,'Tiro Loko','Santa RM is a Rapper from Sonora, Mexico who has grown to be Mexicos Great Hip Hop Hope. With over 200,000 likes on his Facebook page (www.facebook.com/Santa.RM.Official)and millions of views on youtube, Santa RM has finally found a home with JJEntertainmentPv. Currently working on his next album to be released by March 2012 via Itunes and all other digital avenues, Santa RM is sure to deliver his best work to date. Working with producers such as Anno Domini <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Santa+RM\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Franco Escamilla',8732,145611,'Aníbal El Muerto',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Franco+Escamilla\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alka Produce',765,3666,'realidad mental','Alka Produce es un productor colombiano. Sus trabajos publicados como solista se remiten a los instrumentales de Hip-Hop con influencias de soul, trip-hop, electrónica y chillwave. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Alka+Produce\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Central Cee',1290186,56719250,'SR','Oakley Neil H T \"Cench\" Caesar-Su (born 4 June 1998), known professionally as Central Cee, is a British rapper and songwriter from Shepherd\'s Bush, London. He saw success in 2020 with the release of the singles \"Day in the Life\" and \"Loading\". His first mixtape Wild West was released on 12 March 2021, which debuted at number two on the UK Albums Chart. His second mixtape 23 was released on 25 February 2022 and debuted atop the UK Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Central+Cee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Chucky73',44262,554818,'Dowba Montana',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Chucky73\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nake',3182,26645,'70bow',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nake\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('West Dubai',5652,48630,'WE$T DUBAI',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/West+Dubai\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Moonkey',23101,405830,'YUNG SARRIA','Moonkey is based in Minneapolis, MN.  The vocalist, pianist, and composer is Tamara K.  The bassist is Joe V., and the drummer is Beth V.  our influences include Bjork, Chopin, Radiohead, Portishead, and many more....... <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Moonkey\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Central Cee',1290186,56719250,'SR','Oakley Neil H T \"Cench\" Caesar-Su (born 4 June 1998), known professionally as Central Cee, is a British rapper and songwriter from Shepherd\'s Bush, London. He saw success in 2020 with the release of the singles \"Day in the Life\" and \"Loading\". His first mixtape Wild West was released on 12 March 2021, which debuted at number two on the UK Albums Chart. His second mixtape 23 was released on 25 February 2022 and debuted atop the UK Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Central+Cee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('F.HERO',169116,2382355,'Timethai','F.HERO, real name is Nattawut Srimok (nicknamed Golf) is a Thai rapper, songwriter, and actor. He is currently under his own label, Hi Cloud Entertainment. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/F.HERO\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Milli',70021,957176,'Tilly Birds','Danupha Khanatheerakul (Thai: ดนุภา คณาธีรกุล; born November 13, 2002), better known by her stage name MILLI (Thai: มิลลิ) is a Thai rapper, singer, songwriter  and actress under YUPP! Entertainment. She was a member of the project girl groups MINUS and 2021 Ratri. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Milli\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rick Ross',2438381,36476450,'Young Jeezy','\nWilliam Leonard Roberts II (born January 28, 1976), better known by his stage name Rick Ross, is an American rapper. He derived his stage name from the drug trafficker \"Freeway\" Ricky Ross. Ross founded the record label Maybach Music Group, on which he released his studio albums Deeper Than Rap ,Teflon Don, God Forgives, I Don\'t, Mastermind, Hood Billionaire, Black Market, Rather You Than Me, and most recently Port of Miami 2. \n\nWilliam Leonard Roberts II was born in Coahoma County <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rick+Ross\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('MadeinTYO',701932,10631311,'Ugly God','\nMalcolm Jamaal Davis (born April 12, 1992), known professionally as Madeintyo (stands for Made In Tokyo), is an American hip hop recording artist from Atlanta, Georgia He is best known for his debut single, \"Uber Everywhere\" from his mixtape \"You Are Forgiven\".\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/MadeinTYO\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rick Ross',2438381,36476450,'Young Jeezy','\nWilliam Leonard Roberts II (born January 28, 1976), better known by his stage name Rick Ross, is an American rapper. He derived his stage name from the drug trafficker \"Freeway\" Ricky Ross. Ross founded the record label Maybach Music Group, on which he released his studio albums Deeper Than Rap ,Teflon Don, God Forgives, I Don\'t, Mastermind, Hood Billionaire, Black Market, Rather You Than Me, and most recently Port of Miami 2. \n\nWilliam Leonard Roberts II was born in Coahoma County <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rick+Ross\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gazo',129477,7908816,'Ninho','Gazo is a rapper of Guinean origin based in France. Originally from Saint-Denis (93), he has been rapping since a young age and currently has his own label, BSB. According to some sources, he is part of a gang to which he often refers in his songs, the MaLaGangX. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gazo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jorja Smith',1325910,42938220,'Mahalia','\nJorja Smith is an English singer from Walsall, UK. Smith impressed many and earned attention with her hip-hop and R&B-inspired debut single \"Blue Lights\" and has taken the rest of the year to deliver songs that fuse soul, blues, and even classical. She spent much of 2016 getting people very excited about her effortless, informed, and deeply soulful pop with a trio of eclectic singles. Her first EP Project 11 arrives so perfectly formed it almost feels like showing off. Many songs mark Smith out as her hero Amy Winehouse’s truest successor. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jorja+Smith\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oboy',104923,5206870,'Josman','Mihaja Ramiarinarivo (born 6 January 1997), better known by the stage name OBOY, is a Malagasy-born French rapper. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oboy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ashafar',40315,1227144,'Henkie T',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ashafar\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mula B',38842,1905303,'Sevn Alias','Mula B (real name: Hicham Hendrik Mulasi Gieskes, born 18 May 1991 in The Hague[/placefprmed], The Netherlands) is a Dutch rapper of Moroccan and Congolese descent, best known for making a Dutch blend of trap music. Hailing from The Hague\'s Schilderswijk neighborhood, he is a member of Wilde Westen and signed to Wilde Westen Records. Mula B raps in Dutch. His début album, 8-9-17, came out in 2017. As of May 2024, he has released four studio albums in total. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mula+B\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Josylvio',51836,3139941,'Sevn Alias','Joost Theo Sylvio Yussef Abdel Galil Dowib (Naarden, 14 april 1992), bekend onder zijn artiestennaam Josylvio, is een Nederlands rapper.\n\nBiografie\nJosylvio werd geboren in Naarden als de zoon van een Nederlandse moeder en een Egyptische vader. In 2015 deed hij een Zonamo-sessie onder de naam Jaybay. In 2015 bracht hij de single Le7nesh uit (met Sevn Alias). Het was de aanleiding voor het album Ma3seb, dat hij samen met hiphopproducent en jeugdvriend[1] Esko uitbracht. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Josylvio\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('3Robi',35547,919677,'Mula B','Anass Haouam (born 24 January 1995), known professionally as 3robi, is a Dutch rapper of Moroccan origin. Born in Amsterdam, he started his musical career in 2013. His debut studio album, Jonge jongen naar de top, was released in 2017 and reached at number-one on the Dutch Album Top 100. In 2019, 3robi founded his own record label Spow Business and released his second album in the next year. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/3Robi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('JoeyAK',21917,1193959,'Henkie T','Joèl Hoop (The Netherlands, October 10, 1992), better known professionally by his stage name Joey AK, is a rapper from The Netherlands and has a Surinamese heritage. He is the brother of rapper Drechter and started making music because of him. In 2017, Joey released the track “Luitenant” and began to make a name for himself in the music industry. Following this, he appeared in a session at 101-Barz for the first time a year later. Joey scored many hits in recent years by working with major Dutch artists. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/JoeyAK\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Wos',187849,15540001,'Trueno','\nValentín Oliva, (Buenos Aires, Argentina; 23 de enero de 1998) conocido artísticamente como Wos, es un rapero, freestyler argentino. Es conocido por ser el actual campeón en el torneo internacional de Red Bull Batalla de los Gallos.\n\nCarrera\n\nWos arrancó desde muy pequeño rapeando en las plazas y participando en competencias como El Quinto Escalón, donde ya demostraba un gran potencial y sobre todo mucho coraje. Pero fue en 2016 cuando demostró que su nivel estaba para mucho más que una plaza <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Wos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alcolirykoz',32403,2067504,'granuja','Alcolirykoz es un dúo de rap colombiano, integrado por Juan Carlos Fonnegra (Gambeta) y Carlos Andrés (Kaztro), ambos nacidos en Medellín. Se iniciaron en el hip hop a finales de los años 90, participando en batallas de freestyle y grabando sus primeras maquetas. En 2005, adoptaron el nombre de Alcolirykoz, que hace referencia a su estilo de vida bohemio y rebelde.\n\nSu música se caracteriza por su originalidad, su humor negro, su crítica social y su uso de expresiones locales. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Alcolirykoz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alonzo',91555,1605132,'Jul','There is more than one artist with this name:\n\n1) French hip hop artist\n\n2) Swedish heavy rock trio (http://alonzo.bandcamp.com)\n\n3) American electro artist (http://www.myspace.com/alonzo902)\n\n4) Swedish punk rock singer Michael Alonzo, who\'s played in notable bands KSMB, Stockholms Negrer and Alonzo & Fas 3. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Alonzo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('véløma',34367,96791,'2 Of The Crew',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/v%C3%A9l%C3%B8ma\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Cordae',786623,23007367,'Bas','Cordae Amari Dunston (born August 26, 1997), known mononymously as Cordae (formerly known as YBN Cordae and Entendre is an American rapper, singer, and songwriter. \n\nDunston gained popularity by releasing remixes of popular songs, such as \"My Name Is\" by Eminem, and \"Old N***as\" which was a response to the song \"1985\" by J. Cole. Videos to both remixes were uploaded to the WorldStarHipHop\'s YouTube channel, which led to an immense and immediate positive response from both mainstream media and the online rap community. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Cordae\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lupillo Rivera',61956,422839,'Sergio Vega','Guadalupe Rivera (born January 30, 1972 in La Barca, Jalisco, Mexico) is a Mexican banda singer.\n\nAs a youngster, Lupillo, his sister Jenni Rivera and the rest of the Rivera family moved to Long Beach California, where Lupillo graduated from Long Beach Polytechnic High School in 1990 (he was in the same graduating class as Snoop Dogg.)\n\nRivera wanted to be a restaurant owner. His father, however, was a recording studio owner. Wanting to give his son a hands-on business experience, Mr. Rivera hired his son Lupillo to work at the studio. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lupillo+Rivera\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alemán',201633,4812659,'Gera MX','Erick Raúl Alemán Ramírez was born on February 20, 1990, in Cabo San Lucas, Baja California Sur.\n\nHe began exploring rap at the age of 14 alongside his childhood friend MC King, with whom he formed a group called “2 Rimas.” A year later, they met DJ Phat, who joined the group, prompting them to change their name to “Doble Rima.” In 2009, they released an album titled Click Clack Punto Exacto.\n\nIn 2010, MC King decided to take a break, leaving DJ Phat and Alemán to continue the project. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/Alem%C3%A1n\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('B-Real',88455,888183,'Snowgoons','B-Real (born Louis Freese on June 2, 1970) is a Latin rapper of Cuban and Mexican heritage. He is best known for being the lead rapper in hip-hop group Cypress Hill, who made their debut with their self-titled album in 1991.\n\nBorn to a Mexican father and an Afro-Cuban mother, B-Real\'s moved with his sister and mother out of his father\'s home and moved to South Gate before ending up in South Central Los Angeles. Before dropping out of Bell High School <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/B-Real\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Russ',1216781,37443623,'Joyner Lucas','Russell Vitale (born September 26, 1992), known by his stage name Russ, is an American hip hop recording artist, singer-songwriter and record producer.\n\nThere is also a UK drill artist called Russ. Now known as Russ Millions. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Russ\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Balti',26708,280361,'Rohff','Balti is one of the best-known rappers in Tunisia and one of the founding fathers of hip-hop music in the country.\n\nHis most popular videos have reached 350,000 hits on YouTube and he\'s performed to audiences of over 50,000, sharing the stage with such Western rap idols as Method Man.\n\nCNN reports that Tunisia\'s rappers have long made a point of speaking their minds, their lyrics often bringing them into conflict with the old political regime. According to Balti <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Balti\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Métricas Frías',20754,807060,'Mañas Ru-Fino','Santiago Marín Villa (Envigado, 22 de julio de 1994 - Manizales, 26 de agosto de 2022) más conocido como Métricas Frías o Sadman fue un compositor y rapero colombiano. Fue uno de los artistas más influyentes del género del país.\n\nNació en Envigado. Desde su adolescencia se radicó en Medellín. Empezó a componer rap. Se inició en 2010 como freestyler y asistiendo a batallas del Freestyle local.​ En 2011, con Mañas Ru-Fino, formaría el grupo musical Doble Porción <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/M%C3%A9tricas+Fr%C3%ADas\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('COQE',3788,21165,'El Clooy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/COQE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dillom',167331,18228673,'ODD MAMI','Dillom, cuyo nombre real es Dylan León Masa, es un rapero y cantante argentino nacido el 5 de diciembre de 2000 en Buenos Aires. Reconocido por su estilo provocador y su habilidad para fusionar géneros como el trap, el rock alternativo y el horrorcore, ha logrado posicionarse como una de las figuras más influyentes de la escena urbana argentina.\n\nSu carrera despegó con el lanzamiento de su álbum debut, Post Mortem (2021), un trabajo conceptual que aborda temas como la muerte <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dillom\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alex Zurdo',19588,542620,'Christine D\'Clario',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Alex+Zurdo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Funky',29624,448025,'Naujieji Lietuviai','There are at least two artists known as Funky:\n\n1) A Christian reggaeton artist from Puerto Rico\n2) A Lithuanian pop group <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Funky\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Redimi2',23847,495991,'MaDiel LaRa','Nace el 3 de junio del 1979, en la cuidad de Santo Domingo, Republica Dominicana. Su verdadero nombre Willy González Cruz. En su crecimiento se desarrollo en las artes como el dibujo, danza, pintura y teatro. \nLlego a ser uno de los más brillantes estudiantes de su escuela primaria y ya a sus 12 años siente la inclinación por la música Rap. A sus 15 años este estilo de música se convierte en su favorita. Ya a los 17 y 18 años Willy pasaba la mayor parte de su tiempo en fiestas y discotecas <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Redimi2\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Freeze Corleone',89510,8074698,'Osirus Jack','Issa Lorenzo Diakhaté (born 6 June 1992 in Les Lilas, Seine-Saint-Denis), better known as Freeze Corleone, is a French rapper, singer-songwriter and record producer. He is also the founder of the collective 667, and CFR (with Norsacce and Osirus Jack). He lives in Dakar, Senegal.[1][2][3] \n\nCorleone was born in Les Lilas in Seine-Saint-Denis to a Senegalese father and an Italian mother.[4] In an interview with Les Inrocks, he claims to have spent his early years in Pantin, before attending high school in Dakar, Senegal.[5] <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Freeze+Corleone\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Central Cee',1290186,56719250,'SR','Oakley Neil H T \"Cench\" Caesar-Su (born 4 June 1998), known professionally as Central Cee, is a British rapper and songwriter from Shepherd\'s Bush, London. He saw success in 2020 with the release of the singles \"Day in the Life\" and \"Loading\". His first mixtape Wild West was released on 12 March 2021, which debuted at number two on the UK Albums Chart. His second mixtape 23 was released on 25 February 2022 and debuted atop the UK Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Central+Cee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('A1 x J1',179873,2790948,'SwitchOTR','A1 x J1 (real names Phineas Waweru and Joshua Somerkun) are a British hip hop duo. They released their debut single \"Latest Trends\" in February 2020, which charted at number 2 in the UK and was remixed by Aitch and A Boogie wit da Hoodie. Their second single \"Baby\" featured British singer and rapper Deno. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/A1+x+J1\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Calibre 50',159600,4252706,'Gerardo Ortiz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Calibre+50\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Beto Sierra',5719,42167,'Tony Aguirre',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Beto+Sierra\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ALI aka MIND',13931,217155,'Frank Takuma','Rapero Colombiano actualmente radicado en Buenos Aires Argentina, cuenta con una larga trayectoria en la cual ha plasmado su propia realidad y ha dejado en cada uno de sus tracks un mensaje de conciencia social basado en la realidad que tenemos que afrontar los pueblos de América latina hoy en día.\n\nHa llevado siempre como firme propósito dejar un legado para un cambio mental positivo y en pro de la libertad de expresión aportando desde su posición un granito de arena para la cultura del hip hop. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ALI+aka+MIND\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Elias Wallace',1373,7772,'Tunico Da Vila',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Elias+Wallace\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Wos',187849,15540001,'Trueno','\nValentín Oliva, (Buenos Aires, Argentina; 23 de enero de 1998) conocido artísticamente como Wos, es un rapero, freestyler argentino. Es conocido por ser el actual campeón en el torneo internacional de Red Bull Batalla de los Gallos.\n\nCarrera\n\nWos arrancó desde muy pequeño rapeando en las plazas y participando en competencias como El Quinto Escalón, donde ya demostraba un gran potencial y sobre todo mucho coraje. Pero fue en 2016 cuando demostró que su nivel estaba para mucho más que una plaza <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Wos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dillom',167331,18228673,'ODD MAMI','Dillom, cuyo nombre real es Dylan León Masa, es un rapero y cantante argentino nacido el 5 de diciembre de 2000 en Buenos Aires. Reconocido por su estilo provocador y su habilidad para fusionar géneros como el trap, el rock alternativo y el horrorcore, ha logrado posicionarse como una de las figuras más influyentes de la escena urbana argentina.\n\nSu carrera despegó con el lanzamiento de su álbum debut, Post Mortem (2021), un trabajo conceptual que aborda temas como la muerte <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dillom\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Benab',22753,626172,'GLK',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Benab\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sfera Ebbasta',124504,11023893,'Capo Plaza','Italian rapper Gionata Boschetti (aka Sfera Ebbasta), born in 1992 in Sesto San Giovanni, was raised in Cinisello Balsamo, a fact that he often referenced in his music. At the young age of 13, his father passed away, leaving Boschetti responsible for his mother and sister - a responsibility he coped with by writing rhymes. Although he dropped out of school, it wasn\'t long before he found the means to forge a successful rap career in Italy. Alongside close friend and producer Charlie Charles <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sfera+Ebbasta\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Buhodermia 夜',20722,985175,'Doble Porcion',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Buhodermia+%E5%A4%9C\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Garabato Beats',3801,19946,'Norick',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Garabato+Beats\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sfera Ebbasta',124504,11023893,'Capo Plaza','Italian rapper Gionata Boschetti (aka Sfera Ebbasta), born in 1992 in Sesto San Giovanni, was raised in Cinisello Balsamo, a fact that he often referenced in his music. At the young age of 13, his father passed away, leaving Boschetti responsible for his mother and sister - a responsibility he coped with by writing rhymes. Although he dropped out of school, it wasn\'t long before he found the means to forge a successful rap career in Italy. Alongside close friend and producer Charlie Charles <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sfera+Ebbasta\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('That Mexican OT',361866,9045034,'BigXthaPlug','Virgil Rene Gazca, better known as That Mexican OT (short for That Mexican Outta Texas) is a rapper from Bay City, Texas. Deeply connected within the Texas hip-hop scene, he achieved mainstream success in 2023 with his single \"Johnny Dang\", featuring Paul Wall and DRODi. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/That+Mexican+OT\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bhavi',130899,6210723,'Duki','Bhavi es un cantante de trap nacido como Indra Bhalavan en Bélgica, el 22 de octubre de 1997, y radicado en Argentina. En 2017 comenzó a grabar y al poco tiempo se conectó con Mueva Records, la productora con la cual trabaja. \n\nEn 2018 volvió a Bélgica a probar suerte, donde comenzó una gira con Coely y Dvtch Norris, presentándose en distintos festivales. Lanzó varios singles junto a otros artistas reconocidos: “Mojaa”, el 30 de enero <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bhavi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Club Hats',4165,142760,'enzocerobulto',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Club+Hats\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('SPONSOR DIOS',4463,39269,'Sixto Yegros',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/SPONSOR+DIOS\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Baby Gang',118128,6385865,'SIMBA LA RUE','Zaccaria Mouhib (Arabic: زَكَريا موهيب, romanized: Zakariyaa Mouhyb; born 26 June 2001), known professionally as Baby Gang, is an Italian-Moroccan rapper. He began his musical career in 2018 and released his debut EP \"EP1\" in 2021.\n\nBaby Gang released his first single \"Street\" in 2018 in Calolziocorte, followed by \"Education\" and \"Cella 1\" in 2019, songs inspired by his experiences in prison. In May 2021 he released the EP \"EP1\", which peaked at number 15 on the FIMI Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Baby+Gang\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('BoBo',23115,212540,'李圣杰','There are 5 artists and 3 bands with the name Bobo.\n\n1)  BoBo is a Croatian music performer born in 1978. in Sinj, Croatia. His full name is Bobo Knežević. BoBo lives and works in Zagreb, the capital of Croatia as a gym trainer. His music is well known as funny and melodic. Untill now BoBo produced one studio album in 2007 named \"BoBotomija\". Some of the most famous songs from that album are \"Co to maš\", \"Muha\", \"Dominik\" and many others.\nBoBo\'s web site: http://www.boboknezevic.net/ <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/BoBo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Koba LaD',72257,3579444,'Ninho','Koba LaD, de son vrai nom Marcel Junior Loutarila, est un rappeur français né le 3 avril 2000, Koba LaD est originaire d\'Évry, en Essonne. D\'ascendance congolaise, il réside, avec sa mère et ses dix frères et sœurs, au quartier du Bois-Sauvage avant d\'emménager au quartier du Parc aux lièvres aux alentours de ses dix ans. Il commence à rapper à l\'âge de quinze ans et forme le groupe Seven Binks avec ses amis Kaflo et Shotas. Le groupe se dissout rapidement pour permettre à chacun de poursuivre une voie en solo. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Koba+LaD\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gazo',129477,7908816,'Ninho','Gazo is a rapper of Guinean origin based in France. Originally from Saint-Denis (93), he has been rapping since a young age and currently has his own label, BSB. According to some sources, he is part of a gang to which he often refers in his songs, the MaLaGangX. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gazo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Charles Ans',45861,2107570,'Gera MX',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Charles+Ans\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('SIMBA LA RUE',43340,4132862,'Baby Gang','italian drill rapper of tunisian descent <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/SIMBA+LA+RUE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Escomar',11775,273998,'Zefe',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Escomar\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mister You',41280,911675,'Lacrim','Younes Latifi (born 5 February 1984), better known by his stage name Mister You, is a French rapper of Moroccan origin and known for his freestyles and big collaborations with other rap and urban artists.\nBorn in Paris, he was raised in the Belleville area of the capital. He had a troubled youth and held in juvenile prison for brief periods on three occasions. But he was condemned for trafficking drugs to a 5-year term in 2007. But he escaped justice <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mister+You\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('SCH',107720,15296593,'Laylow','There are multiple artists by the name of SCH.\n\n1) Sch (from Schwarzer, his real family name) is a French rapper from Marseille, of German descent. He blew up in 2015, after releasing his debut mixtape A7, reaching 30\'000 sales by the end of the year. His first studio album, Anarchie, was released in 2016. THe second one, Deo Favente, came out in 2017. In january 2018 he created his own label Maison Baron Rouge. Later in 2018 he released a third album JVLIVS. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/SCH\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Wos',187849,15540001,'Trueno','\nValentín Oliva, (Buenos Aires, Argentina; 23 de enero de 1998) conocido artísticamente como Wos, es un rapero, freestyler argentino. Es conocido por ser el actual campeón en el torneo internacional de Red Bull Batalla de los Gallos.\n\nCarrera\n\nWos arrancó desde muy pequeño rapeando en las plazas y participando en competencias como El Quinto Escalón, donde ya demostraba un gran potencial y sobre todo mucho coraje. Pero fue en 2016 cuando demostró que su nivel estaba para mucho más que una plaza <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Wos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Buhodermia 夜',20722,985175,'Doble Porcion',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Buhodermia+%E5%A4%9C\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kiño',8024,60903,'Mañas Ru-Fino',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/Ki%C3%B1o\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Iziou',38,237,'Mañas Ru-Fino',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Iziou\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dj Dmoe',4,10,'Max Tau',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dj+Dmoe\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oboy',104923,5206870,'Josman','Mihaja Ramiarinarivo (born 6 January 1997), better known by the stage name OBOY, is a Malagasy-born French rapper. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oboy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ChysteMc',30323,1743213,'Movimiento Original',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ChysteMc\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Macrodee',866,7459,'LEY 20MIL',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Macrodee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Maes',106953,6477063,'Ninho','1.) Maes, de son vrai nom Walid Georgey, né le 10 janvier 1995 à Villepinte en Seine-Saint-Denis, est un rappeur français originaire de Sevran. \n\nMaes naît le 10 janvier 1995 à Villepinte en Seine-Saint-Denis. Il grandit à la cité des Beaudottes à Sevran avec ses deux parents, ses cinq frères et ses deux sœurs. Maes commence à rapper à l\'âge de 14 ans ; avec ses amis Radmo et SY, ils forment le groupe MSR. Après le lycée, il effectue un séjour de 18 mois à la maison d\'arrêt de Villepinte de début 2016 à fin 2017.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Maes\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Young Stoner Life',632033,20080767,'Young Thug','YSL Records (also known as Young Stoner Life and Young Slime/Slatt Life) is an Atlanta-based record label imprint founded by the Atlanta-based rapper Young Thug. The company is a label imprint of 300 Entertainment. Its artists include Gunna, Lil Keed and more. Several contemporary rappers, such as Lil Uzi Vert, Lil Baby, YoungBoy Never Broke Again, Drake, and Lil Gotit have expressed allegiance to YSL, but are not contractually signed. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Young+Stoner+Life\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gunna',1777718,176214335,'Lil Baby','Sergio Giavanni Kitchens (born June 14, 1993), known professionally as Gunna, is an American rapper, singer and songwriter. Best known for his collaborations with Young Thug and Lil Baby, he is signed to Thug\'s record label, YSL Records, as well as 300 Entertainment and Atlantic Records.[2] He released his debut studio album, Drip or Drown 2 on February 22, 2019 and followed it up with his second studio album Wunna on May 22, 2020, which debuted atop the Billboard 200.[3] <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gunna\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('42 Dugg',384030,12972306,'EST Gee','Dion Marquise Hayes, better known by his stage name 42 Dugg, is an American rapper from Detroit, Michigan. He is jointly signed to rappers Lil Baby and Yo Gotti\'s respective labels 4 Pockets Full (4PF) and Collective Music Group (CMG), in conjunction with Interscope Records. Hayes was raised in the Outer-Drive Hayes neighborhood on the east side of Detroit, and grew up listening to Yo Gotti and Jeezy. Hayes first gained traction for tracks \"The Streets\" and \"STFU\". <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/42+Dugg\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Métricas Frías',20754,807060,'Mañas Ru-Fino','Santiago Marín Villa (Envigado, 22 de julio de 1994 - Manizales, 26 de agosto de 2022) más conocido como Métricas Frías o Sadman fue un compositor y rapero colombiano. Fue uno de los artistas más influyentes del género del país.\n\nNació en Envigado. Desde su adolescencia se radicó en Medellín. Empezó a componer rap. Se inició en 2010 como freestyler y asistiendo a batallas del Freestyle local.​ En 2011, con Mañas Ru-Fino, formaría el grupo musical Doble Porción <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/M%C3%A9tricas+Fr%C3%ADas\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('COQE',3788,21165,'El Clooy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/COQE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rhove',54256,2307876,'Sfera Ebbasta',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rhove\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Central Cee',1290186,56719250,'SR','Oakley Neil H T \"Cench\" Caesar-Su (born 4 June 1998), known professionally as Central Cee, is a British rapper and songwriter from Shepherd\'s Bush, London. He saw success in 2020 with the release of the singles \"Day in the Life\" and \"Loading\". His first mixtape Wild West was released on 12 March 2021, which debuted at number two on the UK Albums Chart. His second mixtape 23 was released on 25 February 2022 and debuted atop the UK Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Central+Cee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oblivion\'s Mighty Trash',27379,1457740,'granuja','Juan Sebastián Álvarez, mejor conocido como Oblivion\'s Mighty Trash es un rapero MC de la ciudad de Medellín, Colombia. Nació en Bello, Antioquia en el 2003 y empezó su carrera artística en el 2020 influenciado por el rap estadounidense y el rap colombiano con exponentes como Doble Porción y que en su trayectoria ha logrado posicionarse como uno de los mayores exponentes del género en la actualidad así como un estandarte de la música independiente en la escena colombiana. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oblivion%27s+Mighty+Trash\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Central Cee',1290186,56719250,'SR','Oakley Neil H T \"Cench\" Caesar-Su (born 4 June 1998), known professionally as Central Cee, is a British rapper and songwriter from Shepherd\'s Bush, London. He saw success in 2020 with the release of the singles \"Day in the Life\" and \"Loading\". His first mixtape Wild West was released on 12 March 2021, which debuted at number two on the UK Albums Chart. His second mixtape 23 was released on 25 February 2022 and debuted atop the UK Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Central+Cee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alcolirykoz',32403,2067504,'granuja','Alcolirykoz es un dúo de rap colombiano, integrado por Juan Carlos Fonnegra (Gambeta) y Carlos Andrés (Kaztro), ambos nacidos en Medellín. Se iniciaron en el hip hop a finales de los años 90, participando en batallas de freestyle y grabando sus primeras maquetas. En 2005, adoptaron el nombre de Alcolirykoz, que hace referencia a su estilo de vida bohemio y rebelde.\n\nSu música se caracteriza por su originalidad, su humor negro, su crítica social y su uso de expresiones locales. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Alcolirykoz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Westside Gunn',1041917,83663745,'Benny the Butcher','Alvin Lamar Worthy (born July 27, 1982), known professionally as Westside Gunn, is an American rapper. He is the paternal half-brother of fellow rapper Conway The Machine, with whom he forms the duo Hall N Nash, and the cousin of fellow Buffalo native rapper Benny the Butcher. In 2014, he founded the record label Griselda Records, as well as clothing brand Fashion Rebels.\n\nIn 2016, he released his first commercial album, Flygod. On March 3, 2017, Griselda Records signed a deal with Eminem\'s Shady Records <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Westside+Gunn\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mach-Hommy',509068,23293403,'Tha God Fahim','Mach-Hommy is a Haitian-American rapper from Newark, New Jersey. He has drawn attention for the high prices he charges for his work (between US$300 and $3000), as well as his anonymity and reclusiveness.\n\nWhile he does produce solo material, he works closely and extensively with Tha God Fahim heavily using the moniker \"Dump Gawd\". Hommy is credited as executive producer on Fahim\'s \"TGIF\" project from 2016, among others, as well as more recently Your Old Droog\'s 2019 album \"Jewelry\". <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mach-Hommy\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yoss Bones',16329,162020,'Rich Vagos',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yoss+Bones\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Akapellah',52922,992789,'Neutro Shorty','Akapellah es un MC y freestyler venezolano de destacado impacto internacional. El artista empezó a darse a conocer a través de videos de freestyles y batallas. Akapellah ha lanzado ya 2 discos: en 2012 aparece \"Como antes\" y en año 2014 le sigue \"Como siempre\". <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Akapellah\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Che',420265,61812855,'OsamaSon','Chase Shaun Mitchell, known professionally as Che (alternatively known as Cheromani or cheRomani+), is an emerging talent in the American music scene, hailing from Atlanta, Georgia. Born on August 29, 2006, he has rapidly gained attention with his unique blend of genres and sounds that include trap, Southern hip hop, and Chicago drill. Che began his musical journey in 2020 under the alias “murkio!” and has since been active in reshaping the boundaries of contemporary music with his innovative approach and engaging releases. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Che\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Charles Ans',45861,2107570,'Gera MX',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Charles+Ans\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('SCH',107720,15296593,'Laylow','There are multiple artists by the name of SCH.\n\n1) Sch (from Schwarzer, his real family name) is a French rapper from Marseille, of German descent. He blew up in 2015, after releasing his debut mixtape A7, reaching 30\'000 sales by the end of the year. His first studio album, Anarchie, was released in 2016. THe second one, Deo Favente, came out in 2017. In january 2018 he created his own label Maison Baron Rouge. Later in 2018 he released a third album JVLIVS. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/SCH\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Chief Keef',1713785,137308898,'Ballout','Keith Farrelle Cozart (born August 15, 1995), known professionally as Chief Keef, is an American rapper and record producer. Born and raised on the South Side of Chicago, he began his recording career as a teenager and gained early regional recognition for his mixtapes in the early 2010s. Chief Keef is widely credited with popularising the hip hop subgenre drill among mainstream audiences and is regarded as one of its originators.\n\nHis fifth mixtape <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Chief+Keef\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Zxmyr',18101,274315,'Toser One',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Zxmyr\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('La loquera',15106,187441,'Neto Peña',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/La+loquera\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Charles Ans',45861,2107570,'Gera MX',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Charles+Ans\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Neto Peña',34320,610083,'Toser One',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Neto+Pe%C3%B1a\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yoss Bones',16329,162020,'Rich Vagos',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yoss+Bones\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ninho',174483,12333842,'Gazo','Ninho, pseudonyme de William Nzobazola, est un rappeur, chanteur et auteur-compositeur français né le 2 avril 1996 à Longjumeau dans l\'Essonne.\n\nAvec plus de 1,2 million d\'albums écoulés, il est en 2020, le douzième rappeur à avoir vendu le plus de disques en France avec ses cinq projets (sans prise en compte des mixtapes gratuites) en moins de cinq ans d\'activité. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ninho\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Marracash',94763,9646118,'Guè','Fabio Rizzo (b. Nicosia, May 22, 1979), better known by his stage name Marracash, is an Italian rapper of Sicilian origin. He is also a member of the Milan-based rap group Dogo Gang. He launched his musical career at the \"Muretto\", a popular Milanese location frequented by Italian hip hop groups. His first album with Dogo Gang was released in 2004. Marracash released his self-titled debut solo album in 2008. To date, Marracash has released four albums, three of which were with Dogo Gang. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Marracash\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Durk',1068426,63277852,'Only The Family','Durk Derrick Banks (born October 19, 1992), better known as Lil Durk, is a rapper, singer, and songwriter from Chicago, Illinois. Durk is best known for his involvement in the drill wave that took the music world by storm in the 2010s. He is the founder of his own record label, Only the Family (OTF).\n\nDurk’s early career was, like many drill artists, plagued with legal issues and accusations of violence. These issues eventually led to his shows being canceled. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Durk\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Akwid',64220,729788,'Cartel de Santa','Akwid is a Mexican-American Hip Hop group, combining hip hop-style vocals with regional Mexican music. An earlier incarnation of the group was known as Juvenile Style. Rappers Sergio \"Wikid\" Gómez and Francisco \"AK\" Gómez, who make up Akwid, are two brothers originally from Jiquilpan, Michoacán, who live in Los Angeles, California.\n\nAkwid is very similar to Kinto Sol, El Chivo, Dyablo, Crooked Stilo, Jae-P, David Rolas, Flakiss, La Sinfonia, Gramatiko <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Akwid\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Timal',41739,1788833,'GLK',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Timal\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gazo',129477,7908816,'Ninho','Gazo is a rapper of Guinean origin based in France. Originally from Saint-Denis (93), he has been rapping since a young age and currently has his own label, BSB. According to some sources, he is part of a gang to which he often refers in his songs, the MaLaGangX. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gazo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alemán',201633,4812659,'Gera MX','Erick Raúl Alemán Ramírez was born on February 20, 1990, in Cabo San Lucas, Baja California Sur.\n\nHe began exploring rap at the age of 14 alongside his childhood friend MC King, with whom he formed a group called “2 Rimas.” A year later, they met DJ Phat, who joined the group, prompting them to change their name to “Doble Rima.” In 2009, they released an album titled Click Clack Punto Exacto.\n\nIn 2010, MC King decided to take a break, leaving DJ Phat and Alemán to continue the project. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/Alem%C3%A1n\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bhavi',130899,6210723,'Duki','Bhavi es un cantante de trap nacido como Indra Bhalavan en Bélgica, el 22 de octubre de 1997, y radicado en Argentina. En 2017 comenzó a grabar y al poco tiempo se conectó con Mueva Records, la productora con la cual trabaja. \n\nEn 2018 volvió a Bélgica a probar suerte, donde comenzó una gira con Coely y Dvtch Norris, presentándose en distintos festivales. Lanzó varios singles junto a otros artistas reconocidos: “Mojaa”, el 30 de enero <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bhavi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Akasha',101341,654974,'Murmur','There are multiple artists using this name.\n\n1. Akasha is a Costarican Hard Rock Band.Their name, Akasha  comes from ancient celt - meaning the source of energy that keeps beings alive.\nThe Band was born in the year 2000 by guitarrist Emmanuel Sotela and ex-singer singer Leonardo Barboza, and has had a long and positive evolution throughout the years, exploring from alternative rock, to grunge, metal and progresive styles to the current style, which is their definite sound, that lingers from Alternative Metal, to Hard Rock. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Akasha\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Cozy Cuz',1022,9606,'La Plebada',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Cozy+Cuz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jauria Santa',22282,862534,'La Santa Grifa',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jauria+Santa\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ArrDee',224297,4125166,'Aitch','Brighton-born and raised Riley Davies, known by his stage name ArrDee has exploded onto the scene with his unique flow; venting the real relatable issues wrapped up in his signature “cheeky chappy” sound. He blew up in 2021 with his feature on  Tion Wayne\'s & Russ Millions\'s \'Body\' remix, where his verse took off on TikTok. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ArrDee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('PASHANIM',162986,21081635,'Symba','Can David Bayram, better known under the stage name Pashanim, (born in 2000 in Berlin, Germany) is a German rapper and filmmaker of Turkish descent. Bayram was born in Berlin and grew up in the Kreuzberg area. He started rapping when he was twelve years old, and in 2017, he founded the rap collective Playboysmafia alongside fellow rappers Symba, Abuglitsch, and RB 030. In 2018, he released his first songs via the online distribution site SoundCloud. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/PASHANIM\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kore',44908,733941,'Khali','There\'s two bands called Kore. A Californian Goth band and a French Metal band:\n\n1. From a passionate encounter with Esperanto in 1997, Kris Spitzer, a Frenchman born in the Loire Valley, created Kore (cordially). He spent several years studying and singing the language with an initial group of musicians, which gave birth to a first album, Kia viv’ (what a life) edited by the French production label from Toulouse, Vinilkosmo in 2000. The group played for festivals in Toulouse, Strasbourg, and Angoulême in France. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kore\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ninho',174483,12333842,'Gazo','Ninho, pseudonyme de William Nzobazola, est un rappeur, chanteur et auteur-compositeur français né le 2 avril 1996 à Longjumeau dans l\'Essonne.\n\nAvec plus de 1,2 million d\'albums écoulés, il est en 2020, le douzième rappeur à avoir vendu le plus de disques en France avec ses cinq projets (sans prise en compte des mixtapes gratuites) en moins de cinq ans d\'activité. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ninho\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Djadja & Dinaz',55163,3088576,'Ninho',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Djadja+&+Dinaz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Durk',1068426,63277852,'Only The Family','Durk Derrick Banks (born October 19, 1992), better known as Lil Durk, is a rapper, singer, and songwriter from Chicago, Illinois. Durk is best known for his involvement in the drill wave that took the music world by storm in the 2010s. He is the founder of his own record label, Only the Family (OTF).\n\nDurk’s early career was, like many drill artists, plagued with legal issues and accusations of violence. These issues eventually led to his shows being canceled. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Durk\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('MINUR',10126,162828,'SPOOKYPBL',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/MINUR\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('SIMBA LA RUE',43340,4132862,'Baby Gang','italian drill rapper of tunisian descent <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/SIMBA+LA+RUE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tiakola',83513,5432021,'Gazo','William Mundala (born December 4, 1999, in Trizay-lès-Bonneval, France), known professionally as Tiakola, is a French rapper and singer, and a former member of the group 4Keus before his solo career. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tiakola\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Booska-p',19922,352942,'Raplume',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Booska-p\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jauria Santa',22282,862534,'La Santa Grifa',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jauria+Santa\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lacrim',100348,3486701,'Niro','Karim Zenoud (born 19 April 1985), better known by his stage name  Lacrim, is a French rapper of Algerian descent. After collaborations with various rap artists, he released his album \"Faites entrer Lacrim\" on May 14, 2012 followed by a mixtape \"Toujours le même\" in Dec 17, 2012. The following two albums, \"Corleone\" in 2014 and \"Force et Honneur\" in 2017 both topped the French Albums Chart. He also released three successive mixtapes under the R.I.P.R.O series; two in 2015 and a third in 2017. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lacrim\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mister You',41280,911675,'Lacrim','Younes Latifi (born 5 February 1984), better known by his stage name Mister You, is a French rapper of Moroccan origin and known for his freestyles and big collaborations with other rap and urban artists.\nBorn in Paris, he was raised in the Belleville area of the capital. He had a troubled youth and held in juvenile prison for brief periods on three occasions. But he was condemned for trafficking drugs to a 5-year term in 2007. But he escaped justice <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mister+You\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Koba LaD',72257,3579444,'Ninho','Koba LaD, de son vrai nom Marcel Junior Loutarila, est un rappeur français né le 3 avril 2000, Koba LaD est originaire d\'Évry, en Essonne. D\'ascendance congolaise, il réside, avec sa mère et ses dix frères et sœurs, au quartier du Bois-Sauvage avant d\'emménager au quartier du Parc aux lièvres aux alentours de ses dix ans. Il commence à rapper à l\'âge de quinze ans et forme le groupe Seven Binks avec ses amis Kaflo et Shotas. Le groupe se dissout rapidement pour permettre à chacun de poursuivre une voie en solo. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Koba+LaD\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Niro',60810,2180952,'Lacrim','Niro is a french rapper under the independant Street lourd label. He has worked on various projects such as, TALENTS FACHES 4, GHETTOYOUSS FM, LA PAS N3T TAP3 DE JEFF LE NERF, CHABODO LA DEL1KANCE, LES RATS D\'EGOUT , STREET LOURD 2, AUTOPSIE 4 de Booba and much more.\n\nHis latest release is the 2012 album, Paraplegique which has been re-released with some bonus tracks a bit later.\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Niro\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Le Rat Luciano',13613,133533,'Chiens De Paille','Le Rat Luciano (real name Christophe Carmona, born April 9, 1976) is a French rapper from Marseille (city of the Panier). His father is of Spanish origin and his mother comes from Martinique. He got noticed as a rapper in 1994 when he was part of the group Fonky Family. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Le+Rat+Luciano\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('PLK',137654,10879066,'Josman','PLK (born 1997 in Paris) is a French rapper and member of the rap group Panama Bende. He began writing songs at a young age. He released his first solo EP in 2015 followed by a second in 2016. His first album, Ténébreux was released in 2017. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/PLK\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bas',599925,12643965,'Cozz','Abbas Hamad (born May 27, 1987), known professionally as Bas, is an American rapper. He is signed to J. Cole\'s Dreamville Records via Interscope Records. His first studio album Last Winter, was released on April 29, 2014, followed by his second studio album, Too High to Riot, which was released on March 4, 2016. Bas\' third album, Milky Way, was released on August 24, 2018.\n\nBas was born in Paris, France, in 1987, to Sudanese parents. At the age of 8, his family moved to New York City. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bas\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('6LACK',990123,38217893,'Bryson Tiller','Ricardo Valdez Valentine Jr. (born June 24, 1992), known professionally as 6lack (stylized as 6LACK, pronounced \"black\"), is an American singer, rapper, and songwriter. He initially gained notable recognition following the release of his single, \"Prblms\", taken from his debut album, Free 6lack, which was released in November 2016.[5] He released his second album, East Atlanta Love Letter in September 2018, which peaked at number three on the Billboard 200 chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/6LACK\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Koba LaD',72257,3579444,'Ninho','Koba LaD, de son vrai nom Marcel Junior Loutarila, est un rappeur français né le 3 avril 2000, Koba LaD est originaire d\'Évry, en Essonne. D\'ascendance congolaise, il réside, avec sa mère et ses dix frères et sœurs, au quartier du Bois-Sauvage avant d\'emménager au quartier du Parc aux lièvres aux alentours de ses dix ans. Il commence à rapper à l\'âge de quinze ans et forme le groupe Seven Binks avec ses amis Kaflo et Shotas. Le groupe se dissout rapidement pour permettre à chacun de poursuivre une voie en solo. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Koba+LaD\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Baby Gang',118128,6385865,'SIMBA LA RUE','Zaccaria Mouhib (Arabic: زَكَريا موهيب, romanized: Zakariyaa Mouhyb; born 26 June 2001), known professionally as Baby Gang, is an Italian-Moroccan rapper. He began his musical career in 2018 and released his debut EP \"EP1\" in 2021.\n\nBaby Gang released his first single \"Street\" in 2018 in Calolziocorte, followed by \"Education\" and \"Cella 1\" in 2019, songs inspired by his experiences in prison. In May 2021 he released the EP \"EP1\", which peaked at number 15 on the FIMI Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Baby+Gang\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alcolirykoz',32403,2067504,'granuja','Alcolirykoz es un dúo de rap colombiano, integrado por Juan Carlos Fonnegra (Gambeta) y Carlos Andrés (Kaztro), ambos nacidos en Medellín. Se iniciaron en el hip hop a finales de los años 90, participando en batallas de freestyle y grabando sus primeras maquetas. En 2005, adoptaron el nombre de Alcolirykoz, que hace referencia a su estilo de vida bohemio y rebelde.\n\nSu música se caracteriza por su originalidad, su humor negro, su crítica social y su uso de expresiones locales. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Alcolirykoz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Métricas Frías',20754,807060,'Mañas Ru-Fino','Santiago Marín Villa (Envigado, 22 de julio de 1994 - Manizales, 26 de agosto de 2022) más conocido como Métricas Frías o Sadman fue un compositor y rapero colombiano. Fue uno de los artistas más influyentes del género del país.\n\nNació en Envigado. Desde su adolescencia se radicó en Medellín. Empezó a componer rap. Se inició en 2010 como freestyler y asistiendo a batallas del Freestyle local.​ En 2011, con Mañas Ru-Fino, formaría el grupo musical Doble Porción <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/M%C3%A9tricas+Fr%C3%ADas\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('COQE',3788,21165,'El Clooy',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/COQE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Leto',70605,4356838,'Gazo','1.French rock/metal band\nGo visit their french website at : \nhttp://www.leto-land.com\nor their myspace page at :\nhttp://www.myspace.com/letomusic\n\n2. Czech dream-pop band / Leto  http://www.silver-rocket.org/kapely/leto \n\n3.  Indie-Punk Band from Hamburg / Germany. \n   Their Debut Album is called \"Vor die Hunde\". https://letohamburg.bandcamp.com/album/vor-die-hunde\n\n4. French rapper and part of the duo PSO Thug, a French hip-hop duo from the 17th arrondissement of Paris. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Leto\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Tiakola',83513,5432021,'Gazo','William Mundala (born December 4, 1999, in Trizay-lès-Bonneval, France), known professionally as Tiakola, is a French rapper and singer, and a former member of the group 4Keus before his solo career. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Tiakola\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Meek Mill',1756793,47242749,'Rick Ross','Robert Williams (born May 6, 1987), better known by his stage name Meek Mill, is an American rapper from Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. He was briefly signed to T.I.\'s label Grand Hustle Records and in February 2011 signed to Rick Ross\' Maybach Music Group. He adopted the rap name “Meek Mill” after family and friends from his neighborhood kept referencing him by his middle name. Meek is coined as the latest rap phenomenon to come out of the city of Philadelphia. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Meek+Mill\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Durk',1068426,63277852,'Only The Family','Durk Derrick Banks (born October 19, 1992), better known as Lil Durk, is a rapper, singer, and songwriter from Chicago, Illinois. Durk is best known for his involvement in the drill wave that took the music world by storm in the 2010s. He is the founder of his own record label, Only the Family (OTF).\n\nDurk’s early career was, like many drill artists, plagued with legal issues and accusations of violence. These issues eventually led to his shows being canceled. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Durk\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('BigXthaPlug',925878,31819421,'Ro$ama','Xavier Landum (born May 12, 1998) in Dallas, Texas, better known by his stage name BigXthaPlug, is an American rapper. He is currently signed to UnitedMasters and is best known for his songs \"Texas,\" \"Mmhmm,\" \"Climate,\" \"Levels,\" and \"Whip It.\" His debut album, Amar, was released in February 2023 and includes the single \"Texas,\" which was certified gold by the RIAA. He also launched his own label, 600 Entertainment, in 2023, signing rappers Ro$ama and Yung Hood. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/BigXthaPlug\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ro$ama',48744,422270,'BigXthaPlug',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ro$ama\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Orelsan',213318,13759602,'Casseurs Flowters','Orelsan is the stage name of Aurélien Cotentin (born August 1, 1982), a French hip hop and rap artist.\nHis music is often described as conscious rap.\nHe started getting famous by posting videos on his Myspace. The song “St valentin” is one of the songs that made him known then followed by other bangers like “Changement”(=change) in 2008. His first album \"Perdu d\'avance\" (=lost in advance) was published in 2009 but at the same he had a controversial follow-up to his song \"Sale pute\" (=dirty whore). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Orelsan\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Orelsan',213318,13759602,'Casseurs Flowters','Orelsan is the stage name of Aurélien Cotentin (born August 1, 1982), a French hip hop and rap artist.\nHis music is often described as conscious rap.\nHe started getting famous by posting videos on his Myspace. The song “St valentin” is one of the songs that made him known then followed by other bangers like “Changement”(=change) in 2008. His first album \"Perdu d\'avance\" (=lost in advance) was published in 2009 but at the same he had a controversial follow-up to his song \"Sale pute\" (=dirty whore). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Orelsan\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Error 999',4111,40928,'Mañas Ru-Fino',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Error+999\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Métricas Frías',20754,807060,'Mañas Ru-Fino','Santiago Marín Villa (Envigado, 22 de julio de 1994 - Manizales, 26 de agosto de 2022) más conocido como Métricas Frías o Sadman fue un compositor y rapero colombiano. Fue uno de los artistas más influyentes del género del país.\n\nNació en Envigado. Desde su adolescencia se radicó en Medellín. Empezó a componer rap. Se inició en 2010 como freestyler y asistiendo a batallas del Freestyle local.​ En 2011, con Mañas Ru-Fino, formaría el grupo musical Doble Porción <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/M%C3%A9tricas+Fr%C3%ADas\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Doble Porcion',22526,1330549,'granuja','\"Doble Porción\" was a boom bap/ rap duo formed by Santiago Marín Villa (Métricas Frías) and Julián Cañas Molina (Mañas Ru-Fino) in 2011 in Medellín, Colombia. At first, they recorded at Moebiuz Studio, a recording studio created by Sebastián Álvarez (Zof Ziro) in 2009. There, they worked on their first group projects, as well as solo projects and collaborations with other artists from the studio, such as the \"La Gra$a\" project and constant collaborations with Zof-Ziro, Granuja and Crudo Means Raw. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Doble+Porcion\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Murder',33387,606589,'Gonzalo Genek','Several bands are named Murder:\n\n1) Murder are a d-beat/melodic crust band from Kiev, Ukraine. Formed in 2007 by the Shurik (guitar/vocal), Dasha (bass) and Dima (drums), band released the first CD \"Back To Hell\" in 2008, when change line-up Sjava (guitar/vocals), Dasha (bass) and Dima (drums). In 2012 Shurik back on guitar, and Dasha leave band, Sjava goes on bass/vocal, with this line-up Murder release second CD \"Our Last Battlefield\". In 2015 Sjava leave band, when Sasha(bass), and Artem (vocal) joine the band. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Murder\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oblivion\'s Mighty Trash',27379,1457740,'granuja','Juan Sebastián Álvarez, mejor conocido como Oblivion\'s Mighty Trash es un rapero MC de la ciudad de Medellín, Colombia. Nació en Bello, Antioquia en el 2003 y empezó su carrera artística en el 2020 influenciado por el rap estadounidense y el rap colombiano con exponentes como Doble Porción y que en su trayectoria ha logrado posicionarse como uno de los mayores exponentes del género en la actualidad así como un estandarte de la música independiente en la escena colombiana. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oblivion%27s+Mighty+Trash\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bas',599925,12643965,'Cozz','Abbas Hamad (born May 27, 1987), known professionally as Bas, is an American rapper. He is signed to J. Cole\'s Dreamville Records via Interscope Records. His first studio album Last Winter, was released on April 29, 2014, followed by his second studio album, Too High to Riot, which was released on March 4, 2016. Bas\' third album, Milky Way, was released on August 24, 2018.\n\nBas was born in Paris, France, in 1987, to Sudanese parents. At the age of 8, his family moved to New York City. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bas\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Capo Plaza',86426,5773512,'Sfera Ebbasta','Luca D\'Orso (born 20 April 1998), better known by his stage name Capo Plaza, is an Italian rapper. He has achieved three number one albums and four number one singles in Italy. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Capo+Plaza\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gunna',1777718,176214335,'Lil Baby','Sergio Giavanni Kitchens (born June 14, 1993), known professionally as Gunna, is an American rapper, singer and songwriter. Best known for his collaborations with Young Thug and Lil Baby, he is signed to Thug\'s record label, YSL Records, as well as 300 Entertainment and Atlantic Records.[2] He released his debut studio album, Drip or Drown 2 on February 22, 2019 and followed it up with his second studio album Wunna on May 22, 2020, which debuted atop the Billboard 200.[3] <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gunna\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nardo Wick',578021,20840643,'Lil Baby','Horace Bernard Walls III (born December 30, 2001), known most notably by his stage name Nardo Wick, is an American rapper, singer, and songwriter who emerged from Jacksonville, Florida.\n\nDuring the rapper’s rise, he went viral on the video-sharing platform TikTok for his chorus on “Who Want Smoke?”. After the large recognition from the track, Nardo obtained features from rappers such as Lil Durk, G Herbo, and 21 Savage for the “Who Want Smoke? (Remix).” <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nardo+Wick\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('G Herbo',555077,19494235,'Lil Durk','Herbert Randall Wright (born October 8, 1995),[1] better known by his stage name G Herbo (formerly known as Lil Herb) is an American rapper and songwriter from Chicago, Illinois. Herb released his debut mixtape, Welcome to Fazoland, to critical acclaim in February 2014, followed by a second mixtape Pistol P Project in December 2014. In September 2015, Herb signed a deal with Cinematic Music Group & Sony Music.[2] His third mixtape, Ballin Like I\'m Kobe, was released on September 29, 2015. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/G+Herbo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil Durk',1068426,63277852,'Only The Family','Durk Derrick Banks (born October 19, 1992), better known as Lil Durk, is a rapper, singer, and songwriter from Chicago, Illinois. Durk is best known for his involvement in the drill wave that took the music world by storm in the 2010s. He is the founder of his own record label, Only the Family (OTF).\n\nDurk’s early career was, like many drill artists, plagued with legal issues and accusations of violence. These issues eventually led to his shows being canceled. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+Durk\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('AJ Tracey',500551,16728608,'Headie One','AJ Tracey (born Ché Wolton Grant on March 4 1994, in Ladbroke Grove, West London, United Kingdom) is a British rapper, singer, songwriter, and record producer. His dad’s a former rapper from Trinidad, and his mum is a Welsh former drum and bass DJ. Based in Ladbroke Grove, West London (although he was raised in the south just like FT and true say, his dad lived in Tottenham), AJ started making waves in the pirate radio scene in 2014, although his songs under the name Looney date back to 2011. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/AJ+Tracey\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('MOSTACK',76375,1389577,'Kojo Funds',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/MOSTACK\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Niska',128135,6194253,'Ninho','Stanislas Dinga Pinto (born 6 April 1994), better known by the artistic name Niska, is a French rapper from Évry, Essonne. His parents are from the Republic of the Congo. He is signed to Universal Music France and Barclay Records. He was initially in the rap group Negro Deep before going solo. Niska is a derivative of his nickname Stany in reverse (Nista), with the \"t\" changed into a \"k\". Niska has released two albums, Charo Life (2015) and Zifukoro (2016), with both reaching number 3 on SNEP, the official French Albums chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Niska\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kore',44908,733941,'Khali','There\'s two bands called Kore. A Californian Goth band and a French Metal band:\n\n1. From a passionate encounter with Esperanto in 1997, Kris Spitzer, a Frenchman born in the Loire Valley, created Kore (cordially). He spent several years studying and singing the language with an initial group of musicians, which gave birth to a first album, Kia viv’ (what a life) edited by the French production label from Toulouse, Vinilkosmo in 2000. The group played for festivals in Toulouse, Strasbourg, and Angoulême in France. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kore\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('WeRenoi',105890,7956793,'Ninho',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/WeRenoi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gazo',129477,7908816,'Ninho','Gazo is a rapper of Guinean origin based in France. Originally from Saint-Denis (93), he has been rapping since a young age and currently has his own label, BSB. According to some sources, he is part of a gang to which he often refers in his songs, the MaLaGangX. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gazo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Migos',1847781,70676546,'Quavo','Migos was an American hip hop group formed in Lawrenceville, Georgia, in 2008. The group consisted of Quavo, his nephew Takeoff, and their friend Offset. Quavo was from Athens, Georgia, while Offset and Takeoff were born and raised in Lawrenceville. The group was managed by Coach K and frequently worked with producers DJ Durel, Murda Beatz, Zaytoven, and Buddah Bless. Migos were associated with the development of trap music in the 2010s and were noted for bringing elements of North Atlanta culture into mainstream music. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Migos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alex Zurdo',19588,542620,'Christine D\'Clario',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Alex+Zurdo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Funky',29624,448025,'Naujieji Lietuviai','There are at least two artists known as Funky:\n\n1) A Christian reggaeton artist from Puerto Rico\n2) A Lithuanian pop group <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Funky\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Redimi2',23847,495991,'MaDiel LaRa','Nace el 3 de junio del 1979, en la cuidad de Santo Domingo, Republica Dominicana. Su verdadero nombre Willy González Cruz. En su crecimiento se desarrollo en las artes como el dibujo, danza, pintura y teatro. \nLlego a ser uno de los más brillantes estudiantes de su escuela primaria y ya a sus 12 años siente la inclinación por la música Rap. A sus 15 años este estilo de música se convierte en su favorita. Ya a los 17 y 18 años Willy pasaba la mayor parte de su tiempo en fiestas y discotecas <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Redimi2\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ander Bock',1589,19797,'Gabriel EMC',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ander+Bock\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('BAD ROYALE',20186,96399,'Party Thieves',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/BAD+ROYALE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sarafa',523,6806,'MD Beddah',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sarafa\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alex P.',1121,12192,'Dim4ou',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Alex+P.\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Cincere',1459,10342,'Brian Seo','NEW YEAR...NEW SOUND... Are you ready for,\"Me,\" this 2009...new Cincere album is about to be launched and more videos are coming soon! Check back shortly for new songs, \"My Way Home,\" and \"Number One Fan...\" Spread the love and give a shout out and share with your friends! Simply....Cincere!\n\nIt’s all in the name!  Cincere’s more than a gifted artist, he is a humble soft spoken young man on a musical mission and the formula is magic wherever he goes. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Cincere\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('A.M. Breakups',1025,11567,'Steel Tipped Dove','A.M. Breakups (born Gordon Ox April 20, 1979 in Centralia, PA) is an underground hip-hop producer, polaroid artist, and occasional MC.  His earliest work, 2001\'s \"Coal Mind,\" featured jerky rhythms, 60s garage rock samples, and plenty of acid-washed 70s instrumental bits that would become his trademark.  By 2005, Breakups had moved to NY, self-releasing \"Riding Between Cars With Noise,\" a full-length effort that began attracting new faces, including emcee Eleven. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/A.M.+Breakups\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Pfv',11881,97440,'Kvng Moses','Matt PFV is an independent hip hop artist out of Akron, OH with a passion for creating music with heart and originality. With a keen ear for detail and a strong motivation to continuously progress, PFV is entirely self sustaining as he records, mixes,  and masters all of his own music. Matt is best known for his role in creating the official #SuplexCityBitch song for WWE Superstar Brock Lesnar with (Paul) Heyman Hustle.\n \nOver the last two years, PFV has opened for and associated with a handful of acts including Royce Da 5\'9\" <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Pfv\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('KmoneyBeats',108,1219,'Ponae',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/KmoneyBeats\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Allstar JR',27122,367003,'Drego & Beno',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Allstar+JR\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Common Grackle',3750,61973,'David Ramos','The Lone Pine Field Guide to Birds describes the Common Grackle as a \"poor but spirited singer who, despite his lack of musical talent, remains smug and proud, posing with his bill held high\". It seemed like a fitting name to adopt for the communion between indie pop wunderkind Gregory Pepper and hyper-prolific hip-hop producer Factor on their full length album The Great Depression (Fake Four Inc). Behind the domineering beats and countless overdubs of reedy vocals <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Common+Grackle\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Factor Chandelier',7110,55091,'Paranoid Castle','Starting out his early career as a DJ, Factor Chandelier (FKA Factor) has evolved into one of Western Canada’s busiest producers. He is continuously working and touring with high caliber artists including: Ceschi, AWOL One, Myka 9, Kay The Aquanaut, Astronautalis, Paranoid Castle and more. He is known for continuously dropping top-notch production out of Saskatoon since the early 2000s. He is the founder, owner and operator of Side Road Records and now working with Fake Four Inc. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Factor+Chandelier\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gregory Pepper and his Problems',6536,97999,'Gregory Pepper','Gregory Pepper is an indie pop artist based in Guelph, Ontario and signed to Fake Four Inc.\n\n-wikipedia\n\nDiscography:\n\n    Gregory Pepper & His Problems (2007)\n    With Trumpets Flaring (2009)\n    The Great Depression (2010) (with Factor, as Common Grackle)\n    The Great Repression (2011)\n    Escape from Crystal Skull Mountain (2012)\n    Big Huge Truck (with MadadaM) (2013)\n\ncome visit us at www.camppepper.com\nbe a friend - www.facebook.com/gregorypepperandhisproblems <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gregory+Pepper+and+his+Problems\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kidd Peko',147,1213,'Claver Gold',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kidd+Peko\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Early Bird',840,5383,'Gruenstreifen','Upbeat, almost Twee pop, with melodies, harmonies, and guitars with the reverb turned all the way up (as all guitars should be).  Early Bird sets this all against a background of clean drumming and earnest vocals, and manages to  avoid the usual cliches of Twee bands with more varied songwriting.  Early Bird seems to be \"Nac\" an ordinary young man from Ehime, Japan on Shikoku.  \n\nThe little blurb on the website describing their CDR says they are Stardust Pop, Shooting Guitar Pop, and Magical Pop. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Early+Bird\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mr Macee',192,984,'Forest11',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mr+Macee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('CamB',1677,6138,'Freedom Stratton','CamB is a great, smaller Band from Erfurt :) <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/CamB\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ben Jones',11079,58969,'Jo Russell','Ben Jones was the singer and songwriter for The Lovedays. He has produced The Soundcasters, Scott Brunger and Rich Clark independently, and is a multi instrumentalist. \nHe released his first solo album, \"Echobox\" in 2010, swiftly followed by his second, \"Kaleidoscope\" in 2011.\nBoth were met with critical acclaim. He is currently writing the \"difficult\" third album, and also co-writing an album with Maxine Kerr. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ben+Jones\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Groovy Jo',114,615,'Asum Garvey',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Groovy+Jo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Brandy Maina',1152,12894,'Mutoriah',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Brandy+Maina\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Louie Ray',25679,243958,'Rio Da Yung OG','Orraccious Quainte Tucker-Brown, professionaly known as Louie Ray, is a rapper from Flint, Michigan who has established himself as a respected figure in the city’s rap scene. He and fellow Flint rapper Rio Da Yung OG are half-brothers. His appearance on Lil Yachty’s Michigan Boy Boat album provided a larger platform for him to showcase his musical talent. Louie Ray is also known for frequently collaborating with rapper YN Jay. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Louie+Ray\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rio Da Yung OG',305369,18295296,'Babyface Ray','Da\'mario Donshay Horne-McCullough (born May 11, 1994), better known by his stage name Rio Da Yung OG, is an American rapper and songwriter from Flint, Michigan. He is signed to #Boyz Entertainment LLC.\n\nRio Da Yung OG started making music with RMC Mike as a teenager, recording songs on a karaoke machine for him and his friends to listen to. Rio didn’t take rap seriously until his idol Team Eastside Peezy encouraged him to and proved that rap made money, he said in an interview with No Jumper. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rio+Da+Yung+OG\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('RMC Mike',82199,2267750,'KrispyLife Kidd','RMC Mike is a rapper from Flint, Michigan born on Feburary 14, 1994, who is known for frequently collaborating with rappers Rio Da Yung OG and KrispyLife Kidd. In 2021 Rio Da Yung OG and RMC Mike dropped a collab album called Dum N Dumbber 3 which was very successful. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/RMC+Mike\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jarv Dee',14279,71662,'Brothers from Another','JARV DEE’s distinctive gift of melodic, smoked-out lyricism has already made him a household name in his native Seattle, where fans rap along word for word with the Moor Gang General. Jarv’s passport stamps are just putting miles on his rep and an international twist on his vibe. His BlakHouse EP is the beginning, the breakfast blunt, the wake-up alert for the Earth amongst a pandemic.\n\nIrrepressible energy, an unmistakable voice and OG-sticky hooks are his trademark—but it’s his down to earth <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jarv+Dee\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bad Colours',19348,73068,'Hadiya George','Bad Colours is the moniker of London-born, Maryland-raised, Brooklyn-based DJ, songwriter, producer, and instrumentalist Ibe Soliman. The new project came about while isolating at home in Flatbush during the COVID-19 pandemic. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bad+Colours\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('pe2ny',3140,72938,'TBNY','Pe2ny is a korean hiphop-artist. he is mainly a producer, but also a good rapper.\n\nIn 2007, Tablo of Epik High and Korea\'s leading hip-hop master Pe2ny who produced all of Epik High\'s albums formed a project group called Eternal Morning and released Soundtrack To A Lost Film, an instrumental album which sold more than 10,000 copies (an unprecedented record for an album of its kind). This time, Pe2ny crafts major buzz in the industry by presenting Alive Soul Cuts <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/pe2ny\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Vince The Messenger',554,2023,'Fozzi Fresh',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Vince+The+Messenger\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Violent Ground',133,272,'Kanen',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Violent+Ground\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Q052',416,2099,'Anachnid',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Q052\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Cincere',1459,10342,'Brian Seo','NEW YEAR...NEW SOUND... Are you ready for,\"Me,\" this 2009...new Cincere album is about to be launched and more videos are coming soon! Check back shortly for new songs, \"My Way Home,\" and \"Number One Fan...\" Spread the love and give a shout out and share with your friends! Simply....Cincere!\n\nIt’s all in the name!  Cincere’s more than a gifted artist, he is a humble soft spoken young man on a musical mission and the formula is magic wherever he goes. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Cincere\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Баястан',331,3199,'Бегиш','Баястан also written as Bayastan (born 1993), is a hip hop artist from Kyrgyzstan, noted for rapping in the Kyrgyz language. Originally from Balykchy, on Lake Issyk-Kul, he know lives and works in Bishkek. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/%D0%91%D0%B0%D1%8F%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('G-Voo',126,650,'Ния',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/G-Voo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nigma',4792,23833,'Melisses',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nigma\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Síntese',43587,1516038,'Kamau','Originalmente, uma dupla vindo de  São José dos Campos, São Paulo , e formada por Leonardo Irian e Gestério Neto, conhecidos como Leo e Neto. A dupla do Vale ganhou muita atenção após o web-vídeo da faixa \"4:20\" e posteriormente pela aclamada mixtape dupla \"Sem Cortesia\", dividida entre os CD’s “Vagando Na Babilônia” e “Em Busca de Canaã”.\n\nApós o lançamento de \"Sem Cortesia\", Leo deixa a dupla e, desde então, Neto permanece representando a, como ele mesmo chama, “instituição” Síntese. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/S%C3%ADntese\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('2t',22938,198491,'Chris Beats Zn','There are multiple artists with this name:\n1) 2T, a Blackmore\'s Night inspired band\n2) A Polish rapper(?)\n\n\n1)\nTormod Tørresdal and Tor Moen Tønnesen (known from Han innante) are two of the members of this project. 2T is Blackmore\'s Night inspired folk-prog. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/2t\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Pirmin',95,570,'Mo Cess',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Pirmin\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('M7',1868,15699,'Isolated Incident','1. French rapper.\n\n2. Portuguese rapper from Porto. Associated with the Syzygy act, recorded the \"Martataca\" mixtape in 2008.\n\n2. OYA? was formed with ,the leader of a PUROGURE animation community, and Mr. Raiden Yuzawa of RX, and Mark which should be pursuing progressive rock woke up to POPS suddenly, and formed m7. He who sold simultaneously with a maniac fusion lock route from his school days in fact, and was pursuing Line POPS once stopped musical activities of the self of the 90s which was swaying to Rock considerably <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/M7\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Preme Dibiasi',438,1750,'Rootabang',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Preme+Dibiasi\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Aminé',1470636,62551784,'Smino','Adam Aminé Daniel, better known as Aminé, is an American rapper. He was born and raised in Portland, Oregon. He released his debut album Good for You on July 28th, 2017.\n\nOn January 17, 2014, Aminé released his debut mixtape, Odyssey to Me. On September 4, 2014, Aminé released his debut extended play (EP), En Vogue. On August 31, 2015, Aminé released his second mixtape, Calling Brío. \nOn March 9, 2016, Aminé released his debut single, called \"Caroline\". <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Amin%C3%A9\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DJ Mzenga Man',100,825,'Jae cash',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/DJ+Mzenga+Man\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jean',42187,367359,'天音','Jean, a future Brazilian popstar who is about to debut his first hit single \"Entornar Você\" late 2020 or early 2021 (or as soon as the Covid-19 vaccine drops). \n\nHe is currently working on his first EP who is on the earlier stages of writing but is already shapping up to be a blockbuster, with songs spanning from brazilian-inspired rhythms such as axé and funk to 80s style Glam Rock and Heavy Metal, 90s hip-hop, R&B and synth-pop.\n\nHis biggest influences are: Madonna <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jean\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Groovy Jo',114,615,'Asum Garvey',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Groovy+Jo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Козачок',764,7943,'Джон Дір',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/+noredirect/%D0%9A%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%BE%D0%BA\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Flex D\'Paper',20,146,'Tungi',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Flex+D%27Paper\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Chase Manhattan',1320,5161,'Say Nothing',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Chase+Manhattan\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bruce Banna',382,3194,'Shady Nate',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bruce+Banna\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mr Phormula',583,4255,'Sŵnami','Mr Phormula is Welsh beat-boxer and rap artist Ed Holden (born in 1984) from  Llanfrothen, Gwynedd.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mr+Phormula\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('J Scope',471,1323,'Luis Elba',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/J+Scope\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('King Macarella',530,3229,'ABBBOSE',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/King+Macarella\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dj Myke',3536,32725,'DJ Fastcut','DJ Myke (Marco Micheloni), attivo dal 1997, si inserisce ben presto tra i protagonisti del turntablism italiano, vincendo per quattro anni consecutivi il “DMC Italy” (nel 2000 e nel 2001 con il team MenInSkratch, nel 2001 e nel 2002 come solista) e arrivando quattro volte in finale al “World DJ Championship”. Nel 2003 a Praga, insieme a Dj Aladyn, si classifica secondo nel \"ITF eastern emisphere\".\n\nNel 1999 fonda insieme a Dj Aladyn e Dj T <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dj+Myke\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jaywalker',806,6550,'The New Drifts','Jaywalker was formed in the summer of 2005 from the smoldering ashes of the california-rock group Longbow with three of the former members and a new bassist in search for a new sound and different musical flavors. The outcome was a deeper tone and slightly darker atmosphere which immediately appealed to the audience as well as the jury of a territorial talent competition launching the band into studio. The four pieces you can listen to on MySpace <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jaywalker\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Vaze Haze',96,389,'Young Ree$E',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Vaze+Haze\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Genesis Elijah',7557,50473,'Asaviour','Genesis Elijah was born Nathaniel Winston Joseph Bygrave on 1st July 1981. A prolific and well-known MC on the London scene and beyond, Genesis Elijah has released several recordings in his own right, firstly \"Jah Bless\" 12\" on Dominant 3rd Records/Country boy then a full length album \"Deh pon Road\" on Broken Souls / Brave Music to critical acclaim. GE\'s talents also extend to production, many of his tracks being self produced. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Genesis+Elijah\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('bluemason',129,1345,'Sefu',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/bluemason\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Swordbearer',363,7428,'Mary Sue','Swordbearer is a one-man folk metal band from The Forest of Glen Gardner, New Jersey that was started in 2004.  All music and vocals are the work of one man named Rhode Rachel.  He takes influence from bands such as Bathory, Moonsorrow, Windir, Nokturnal Mortum, Finntroll, Volkolak and many others.  His debut album \"Inspired by the Trees\" was released in August 2009.  Rhode is also involved or has been involved in other projects such as Folkearth and Folkodia. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Swordbearer\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('King Macarella',530,3229,'ABBBOSE',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/King+Macarella\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('King Macarella',530,3229,'ABBBOSE',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/King+Macarella\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('pe2ny',3140,72938,'TBNY','Pe2ny is a korean hiphop-artist. he is mainly a producer, but also a good rapper.\n\nIn 2007, Tablo of Epik High and Korea\'s leading hip-hop master Pe2ny who produced all of Epik High\'s albums formed a project group called Eternal Morning and released Soundtrack To A Lost Film, an instrumental album which sold more than 10,000 copies (an unprecedented record for an album of its kind). This time, Pe2ny crafts major buzz in the industry by presenting Alive Soul Cuts <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/pe2ny\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Kleo',28566,357960,'Soner Sarıkabadayı','There are a number of artists using the name Kleo, including:\n\n1. A house artist from Australia\n2. An alt-pop artist from Denmark\n3. A dark-pop artist from Glasgow, Scotland, formally known as KLEOPATRA <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Kleo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('12mé',624,6795,'Areno Jaz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/12m%C3%A9\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Chilli Mari',303,1624,'JUNG ÄM',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Chilli+Mari\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Les',126056,2158048,'LochHaven','1) Les - ambient / electronic artist\n\n2) Les is a rapper from Houston, Texas\n\n3) Les (Tvrtko Hopek), Croatian artist\n\n4) Les - Dutch punkband active in the early 90s. Willem Klumper - guitars & vocals, André van Leur - drums, Eric Vonx - bass & vocals\n\n5) Les is a Czech downtempo/post-rock/ambient/noise/drone project. more info at http://bandzone.cz/les\n\n6) Les - czech post hc/post black band  from Liberec (featuring members of Drom and Sick Gore Suffer) https://www.facebook.com/pages/LES/602746199762730?ref=ts&fref=ts <a href=\"https://www.last.fm