ref=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Vigos\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Shaba Stele',93,251,'Veezo View',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Shaba+Stele\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('BSTFRND',972,9041,'Shungu',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/BSTFRND\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Beki',334,2135,'Jyro',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Beki\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Eyecon',330,1019,'M.a.a.T. feat. Kabalew',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Eyecon\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Outer Space Beatz',95,1650,'Staki',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Outer+Space+Beatz\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Oliver Tree',1437951,43518429,'Whethan','OIiver Tree Nickell is an American vocalist, producer, and filmmaker from Santa Cruz, California. He signed to Atlantic Records in 2017, after his song \"When I\'m Down\" went viral. He blurs the lines between meme and music with his strange and hilarious online presence. \n\nThe Santa Cruz native is known for his wide-ranging creativity. Even by looking at his social media pages it\'s apparent that Oliver Tree\'s \'brand\' is composed of equal elements art, humor, and originality. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Oliver+Tree\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ag Club',249035,4788057,'Kenny Mason','Futuristic yet retro, surrealistic but deeply human, AG Club—short for Avant-Garde Club—more than lives up to its name. Since releasing their debut project, Halfway Off the Porch, in 2020, lead members Jody Fontaine and Baby Boy have created at the intersection of raw emotion and innovative style for anthems that are sleek, fun, and engrossing. As a result, they’ve earned more than 41 million combined global and video streams while establishing themselves as an emerging force in the Bay Area. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ag+Club\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dope Boys Bapele',142,1244,'Y Celeb',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dope+Boys+Bapele\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('St!llness',3228,86025,'Antenat','Sve je počelo negdje krajem 98. Yuri i Papi ( sada već bivši član) upoznali su se u jednoj od splitskih gimnazija i osnovali tvrdi hip-hop dvojac ST!llness.\nSvoj prvi underground single «fala» izbacili su početkom 2000. godine. Pjesma je odlično prošla kod ljubitelja domaćeg hip-hop-a zahvaljujući renomiranoj underground stranici H3S i odličnom beatu koji je napravio Shot (Elemental).\n\nNedugo zatim snimljena je i « Zar se ovo život zove», pjesma poznata kao prva u Hrvata s tematikom sindroma narodnjaka. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/St%21llness\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Masked Wolf',656881,6992819,'Vin Jay','Harry Michael (born in Australia), known professionally as Masked Wolf, is an Australian rapper. He is best known for his single \"Astronaut in the Ocean\". <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Masked+Wolf\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ofiri',515,5003,'Daniel Rubin',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ofiri\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Beton Sessions',57,187,'Yagel Harush',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Beton+Sessions\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Rae Sremmurd',1869567,45253407,'Migos','Rae Sremmurd is an American hip hop duo consisting of brothers Swae Lee and Slim Jxmmi, both from Tupelo, Mississippi. The group’s name is derived from “Ear Drummers” spelled backwards. In 2013, they became the first act signed to EarDrummers Records, a label founded by record producer Mike Will Made It and distributed through Interscope Records.\n\nThe duo gained mainstream recognition in 2014 with the singles \"No Flex Zone\", \"No Type\", and \"Throw Sum Mo\", the latter featuring Nicki Minaj and Young Thug. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Rae+Sremmurd\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('The Gumshoe Strut',433,3086,'Pip Skid','Underground rapper from Vancouver, Canada. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/The+Gumshoe+Strut\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Yung Cat',1466,10175,'FIGG NEWTON',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Yung+Cat\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Zaman',7823,71496,'Hedonistic Noise','1. For the Egyptian band see زمان\n2. For the Palestinian band see زمن\n3. Grunge/Punk band from Istanbul, Turkey. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Zaman\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Big Myke',406,3929,'Cutty Banks',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Big+Myke\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ice One',2197,17628,'Cor Veleno','Ice One aka Sebi is one of the top artistic forces in the Italian Hip Hop scene, renowned for his MCing, DJing, and production work. Raised in Rome, Ice One started in the early 1980s DJing for different venues in his city. Around that time he became involved in graf & break dancing performing with the Special Breakin\' Crew. \n\nIce One joined forces with a variety of groups, including 24-7 Crew, MC Shark\'s Raptional Scream, and the Mad DJ\'s Band. In the late 1980s, he performed with Ice T and Afrika Bambataa during their Italian tours.  <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ice+One\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dave East',202520,3479880,'38 Spesh','Dave East is an emerging artist from Harlem, NY. His music is regularly featured on Hot 97, Power 105, Shade 45, and Sirius\' Hip Hop Nation. With a loyal fan-base ranging from record executives to professional athletes and artists alike, Dave East is quickly becoming a staple within NY\'s new-school of hip hop. \n\n This newcomer displays versatile flow and distinct voice as he raps over vintage sounding production. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dave+East\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mary J. Blige',2384080,34843351,'Faith Evans','Mary Jane Blige (born January 11, 1971 in Bronx, New York, United States), is an American R&B, Soul, and Hip Hop singer, songwriter, rapper and actress. Known as The Queen of Hip-Hop Soul and The Queen of R&B, she has sold over 75 million records worldwide. \n\nIn 1992, Blige released her debut album What\'s The 411?. The album sold 3.4 million copies on the strength of singles You Remind Me, Real Love, Reminisce, Sweet Thing, and Love No Limit. The <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mary+J.+Blige\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('MMP Family',56,454,'A.T.I',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/MMP+Family\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ace Cino',10059,153435,'NUK','Ace Cino is a rapper from Detroit, Michigan. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ace+Cino\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil P',1368,5752,'RLSG BSMITH','About Me:I was born in Raised Ronterrius Williams,In The South Of Georgia And North Florida.Where I Grew Up And The Neighbor Hood Of Sub Division(Sub-D)and Quincy,Fl.I started FreeStylin Around The Age of 10,And Was Noticed By A Local Dj.Named Cadilliac Joe(Mr.Boop)Of Quincy,Fl And Was InFluenced That I had The Talent To Rap.So I begin Writing,As I Attended High School At East Gadsden High,Havana,Fl.I Was Introduced to Freestyle Battle\'s.I Battled My First Battle vs A SongWriter/Lyrics From NY and a live Judge Battle. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+P\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('PSR',7603,54959,'Kabe','PSR is an experimental ambient improv duo that began in late 2003 as a side project of At Knifepoint (now Pulsar47), a post-rock band hailing from Champaign/Urbana, IL. It all started when Dave and Aaron began getting together for frequent jam sessions, often times during post-show At Knifepoint parties. They began to develop their unique sound, built on a completely improvisational foundation. Field testing of the early PSR recordings was done by playing them in public at subliminal levels on Dave\'s cassette player. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/PSR\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bad Balance',37661,784787,'Detsl aka Le Truk','Bad Balance is a Russian rap group considered to be one of the first rap acts in USSR. The group maintained a devoted underground following during 1990\'s.\nBad Balance was formed as a breakdance crew in 1980\'s in Saint-Petersburg by students from Donetsk named Vlad Valov (SheFF) and Sergey Krutikov (Михей). Group switched to rapping and recorded the debut album \"Vishe Zakona\" in 1989 for Gala Records.\n\nThe band toured France and US. Classic Bad Balance albums \"Naletchiki Bad B. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bad+Balance\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Factor',15357,300916,'Awol One & Factor','Starting out as a DJ in 1998, Factor has evolved into one of Western Canada’s busiest super producers.  He is continuously working and touring with high caliber Canadian and American artists including: AWOL One, Moka Only, Myka 9, Ceschi, Sole, Aesop Rock, Buck 65, Gregory Pepper, Sunspot Jonz, Tha Liks, Xzibit, Kool Keith, Josh Martinez, Sadat X, and The Side Road Crew.   He is known for continuously dropping top-notch product out of Saskatoon since the late ‘90s. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Factor\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('12mé',624,6795,'Areno Jaz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/12m%C3%A9\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DJ Mzenga Man',100,825,'Jae cash',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/DJ+Mzenga+Man\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Franciar',43,275,'Macky 2',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Franciar\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Alpha Romeo',398,1887,'Alpha Romeo & die Winterreifen',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Alpha+Romeo\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Lil P',1368,5752,'RLSG BSMITH','About Me:I was born in Raised Ronterrius Williams,In The South Of Georgia And North Florida.Where I Grew Up And The Neighbor Hood Of Sub Division(Sub-D)and Quincy,Fl.I started FreeStylin Around The Age of 10,And Was Noticed By A Local Dj.Named Cadilliac Joe(Mr.Boop)Of Quincy,Fl And Was InFluenced That I had The Talent To Rap.So I begin Writing,As I Attended High School At East Gadsden High,Havana,Fl.I Was Introduced to Freestyle Battle\'s.I Battled My First Battle vs A SongWriter/Lyrics From NY and a live Judge Battle. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Lil+P\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Icaki',416,9951,'Novem',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Icaki\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('TWELVE\'LEN',75988,463992,'Dot Da Genius','Twelve\'Len (real name Lavares Joseph) is an R&B singer from Miami, Florida. He began as a rapper with friends Denzel Curry, Nell, and Yung Simmie, but later went to in a more alternative direction to create his own lane. His name comes from a mashup of V12 (as in the engine) and Len, his grandfather’s name.\n\nHis mainly works with producer Zach Fogarty.\n\n <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/TWELVE%27LEN\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Chase Manhattan',1320,5161,'Say Nothing',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Chase+Manhattan\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('No Sun',20049,159177,'Grivo',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/No+Sun\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Jonathan Cloud',665,4656,'Denzill Jones',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Jonathan+Cloud\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Brighty',489,2588,'Chris Bullen',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Brighty\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Blue City CDF',229,687,'Wstlnd',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Blue+City+CDF\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ruggedman',2325,11298,'Lord Of Ajasa','Bio\n\nBorn Michael Ugochukwu Stephens on the 20th of September in Ebem Ohafia, Abia state, all levels of schooling were done in Lagos state. I am a graduate of Political Science Lagos State University Ojo. I started loving rap music from around 1989 when I was learning the words in rap tracks I liked and rapping along to their instrumentals - until I decided that I could do mine, then I started writing my own lyrics. 1999 was when I put out my first cd for air play. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ruggedman\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Nomoreloss',88,914,'9ice',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Nomoreloss\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('BNDR',171,1380,'Gritando en Silencio',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/BNDR\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dinnie RD',137,272,'grummel',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dinnie+RD\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Dubb Saq',304,1109,'Bleak AG',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Dubb+Saq\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C.W. Da Youngblood',257,4250,'CW Da Youngblood',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C.W.+Da+Youngblood\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Bruce Banna',382,3194,'Shady Nate',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Bruce+Banna\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Young Tweez',83,352,'Joe Blow',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Young+Tweez\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Icaki',416,9951,'Novem',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Icaki\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Ali Gatie',574541,8120175,'Sam Fischer','Ali Gatie is an Iraqi–Canadian rapper, singer and songwriter. His 2019 song \"It\'s You\" charted worldwide, charting on the US Billboard Hot 100[1] and reaching the top 40 in Australia, Canada, Ireland and Sweden and the top 10 in New Zealand and in Germany.\nAli Gatie was born to Iraqi parents in Yemen in 1997. His family moved to Abu Dhabi before settling in Mississauga, Ontario. He grew up listening to Ed Sheeran, J. Cole and Frank Ocean, who influenced his music. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ali+Gatie\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('JUNG ÄM',195,2214,'Skinny Stylus',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/JUNG+%C3%84M\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Eu93ne',43445,123804,'Bird Svensøn',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Eu93ne\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Cream',2752495,45991919,'Derek and the Dominos','Cream was a British rock supergroup formed in London in 1966. The group consisted of bassist Jack Bruce, guitarist Eric Clapton, and drummer Ginger Baker. Jack Bruce was the primary songwriter and vocalist, with contributions from Clapton and Baker. The band members had previously been part of successful groups, and Cream is often recognized as one of the first supergroups. The band was known for the instrumental skills of its members.\n\nDuring their career from 1966 to 1968 <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Cream\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('CamB',1677,6138,'Freedom Stratton','CamB is a great, smaller Band from Erfurt :) <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/CamB\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Y2',7815,71250,'J.Blaze',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Y2\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Gogo.',289,1104,'Connis',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Gogo.\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('C-Lance',7509,57916,'Connor Gilbert',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/C-Lance\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('12mé',624,6795,'Areno Jaz',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/12m%C3%A9\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Connis',2097,10965,'Caev','If you’re seeking that one iconic image to represent Sint Maarten’s ebullient music scene, the dread-locked silhouette of saxophonist Connis Vanterpool can’t be far from mind.\n\n“Me, icon?” laughs the veteran horn-player, rolling his prominent eyes and flashing a wide grin. “I’m just a regular guy trying to make things happen.”\n\nBorn and raised in Sint Maarten, Connis graduated from Boston’s Berklee College of Music and built a career in jazz performance and production in the U.S. before returning to his native island in 2001. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Connis\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Les',126056,2158048,'LochHaven','1) Les - ambient / electronic artist\n\n2) Les is a rapper from Houston, Texas\n\n3) Les (Tvrtko Hopek), Croatian artist\n\n4) Les - Dutch punkband active in the early 90s. Willem Klumper - guitars & vocals, André van Leur - drums, Eric Vonx - bass & vocals\n\n5) Les is a Czech downtempo/post-rock/ambient/noise/drone project. more info at http://bandzone.cz/les\n\n6) Les - czech post hc/post black band  from Liberec (featuring members of Drom and Sick Gore Suffer) https://www.facebook.com/pages/LES/602746199762730?ref=ts&fref=ts <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Les\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Chilli Mari',303,1624,'JUNG ÄM',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Chilli+Mari\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Mondetto',1521,14677,'LCone',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Mondetto\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Chilli Mari',303,1624,'JUNG ÄM',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Chilli+Mari\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Les',126056,2158048,'LochHaven','1) Les - ambient / electronic artist\n\n2) Les is a rapper from Houston, Texas\n\n3) Les (Tvrtko Hopek), Croatian artist\n\n4) Les - Dutch punkband active in the early 90s. Willem Klumper - guitars & vocals, André van Leur - drums, Eric Vonx - bass & vocals\n\n5) Les is a Czech downtempo/post-rock/ambient/noise/drone project. more info at http://bandzone.cz/les\n\n6) Les - czech post hc/post black band  from Liberec (featuring members of Drom and Sick Gore Suffer) https://www.facebook.com/pages/LES/602746199762730?ref=ts&fref=ts <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Les\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Majouw',28,698,'Soda Goat',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Majouw\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Recyclone',546,8971,'Recyclone And Soso','Recyclone is the avante-guard hip hop/industrial alter-ego of Halifax musician and photographer Jon Hutt. Hutt grew up in and around the community of Truro, Nova Scotia, Canada, and contributed to east coast underground supergroup The Motes. The Motes, which included J. LaPointe (North of America), Daniel MacDonald, and Craig Thibault were the foundation of a regionally influential independent record label called Ant Records (releasing material by Sixtoo, DJ Moves, Wizurd and various side projects from The Motes). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Recyclone\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('ABBBOSE',463,3251,'King Macarella',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/ABBBOSE\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Detroit Rap News',3635,35023,'Whitehouse Studio',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Detroit+Rap+News\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Sker McGurt',159,3284,'SmokeCamp Chino',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Sker+McGurt\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Baby Gang',118128,6385865,'SIMBA LA RUE','Zaccaria Mouhib (Arabic: زَكَريا موهيب, romanized: Zakariyaa Mouhyb; born 26 June 2001), known professionally as Baby Gang, is an Italian-Moroccan rapper. He began his musical career in 2018 and released his debut EP \"EP1\" in 2021.\n\nBaby Gang released his first single \"Street\" in 2018 in Calolziocorte, followed by \"Education\" and \"Cella 1\" in 2019, songs inspired by his experiences in prison. In May 2021 he released the EP \"EP1\", which peaked at number 15 on the FIMI Albums Chart. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Baby+Gang\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Antony Z',6204,81532,'Shoda Monkas',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Antony+Z\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('Al Safir',18610,1140064,'Hard GZ',' <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Al+Safir\">Read more on Last.fm</a>'),('DaWiz',16